(194858, 11120, 4813, '<td valign="top">i''m sorry but I must give this photo a 1.  this photo would do good in another challenge it just doesn''t meet the challenge.  I made a new scoring system for myself and the only way to get a one is to submit a photo which is off the topic.  Sorry again</td>', 'i''m sorry but I must give this photo a 1.  this photo would do good in another challenge it just doesn''t meet the challenge.  I made a new scoring system for myself and the only way to get a one is to submit a photo which is off the topic.  Sorry again', '2003-01-20 00:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(194863, 11258, 4813, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, I love the brightness.  The only problem I have is that I can''t tell if it is snowing or you have a dirty lens</td>', 'Nice photo, I love the brightness.  The only problem I have is that I can''t tell if it is snowing or you have a dirty lens', '2003-01-20 00:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(194865, 11149, 4813, '<td valign="top">where is the sign?  Off topic for me</td>', 'where is the sign?  Off topic for me', '2003-01-20 00:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(194868, 11060, 5684, '<td valign="top">Very nice effect</td>', 'Very nice effect', '2003-01-20 00:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(194871, 11110, 6308, '<td valign="top">i love the sign against the blue sky</td>', 'i love the sign against the blue sky', '2003-01-20 00:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(194872, 11332, 4813, '<td valign="top">i''m not a border fan but I think it adds to the picture.  Great photo</td>', 'i''m not a border fan but I think it adds to the picture.  Great photo', '2003-01-20 00:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(194875, 11167, 3080, '<td valign="top">Now I know who''s footprints are in my photo. lol.  Great choice of signs! How far did you have to drive to get there?  Good thing you didn''t get the same angle as me cause you couldn''t call it "paved" with good intentions.  The road up front isn''t paved. lol.  I like the angle a lot.  Color of the sign is good.  you had the same prob as me with the sky though.  Great focus and clarity.  We were there Sunday around 2pm and ate at the Dam Site Inn.  Wonder if our paths crossed?  Good luck to you!  It''s a great sign!! :)</td>', 'Now I know who''s footprints are in my photo. lol.  Great choice of signs! How far did you have to drive to get there?  Good thing you didn''t get the same angle as me cause you couldn''t call it "paved" with good intentions.  The road up front isn''t paved. lol.  I like the angle a lot.  Color of the sign is good.  you had the same prob as me with the sky though.  Great focus and clarity.  We were there Sunday around 2pm and ate at the Dam Site Inn.  Wonder if our paths crossed?  Good luck to you!  It''s a great sign!! :)', '2003-01-20 00:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(194876, 11118, 4813, '<td valign="top">Funny...great photo with the most beautiful sky in the background</td>', 'Funny...great photo with the most beautiful sky in the background', '2003-01-20 00:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(194882, 11094, 4813, '<td valign="top">I wish that I could have read the sign</td>', 'I wish that I could have read the sign', '2003-01-20 00:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(194888, 11182, 92, '<td valign="top">This is the most superb photo I''ve seen in a long time ! It''s so very well done. It looks like something out of a major magazine. PERFECT 10 ! Good luck to you !</td>', 'This is the most superb photo I''ve seen in a long time ! It''s so very well done. It looks like something out of a major magazine. PERFECT 10 ! Good luck to you !', '2003-01-20 00:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
