(194898, 11342, 1143, '<td valign="top">love how different this is from the rest. cool, simple, black and white. think i''d rather have white and then black on the border.</td>', 'love how different this is from the rest. cool, simple, black and white. think i''d rather have white and then black on the border.', '2003-01-20 00:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
