(194908, 11108, 5684, '<td valign="top">very nice. I wish the sign was brighter butI realize  there isnt anything you can do but use a flash really and then it would be too reflective.</td>', 'very nice. I wish the sign was brighter butI realize  there isnt anything you can do but use a flash really and then it would be too reflective.', '2003-01-20 00:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
