(194936, 11134, 4813, '<td valign="top">the border or whatever it is really helps the photo</td>', 'the border or whatever it is really helps the photo', '2003-01-20 00:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(194938, 11068, 1143, '<td valign="top">Loved those signs in London - very helpful b/c I ALWAYS look left!!  Great idea .. coulda been executed a bit better as I can''t really read it like this.</td>', 'Loved those signs in London - very helpful b/c I ALWAYS look left!!  Great idea .. coulda been executed a bit better as I can''t really read it like this.', '2003-01-20 00:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(194942, 11199, 3280, '<td valign="top">Great clouds, seems a bit on the soft focus side though.</td>', 'Great clouds, seems a bit on the soft focus side though.', '2003-01-20 00:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(194944, 11120, 1143, '<td valign="top">*lmao* you are SO brave</td>', '*lmao* you are SO brave', '2003-01-20 00:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(194952, 11182, 255, '<td valign="top">absolutely perfect--will comment more later!</td>', 'absolutely perfect--will comment more later!', '2003-01-20 00:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(194962, 11049, 255, '<td valign="top">whoa, freaky! could be right out of a hitchcock movie with all that foggy greyness! that having been said--i usually go for more contrasty B&amp;W photos--but the monotone greys work for this picture. nice work!</td>', 'whoa, freaky! could be right out of a hitchcock movie with all that foggy greyness! that having been said--i usually go for more contrasty B&W photos--but the monotone greys work for this picture. nice work!', '2003-01-20 00:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(194963, 11137, 5684, '<td valign="top">Living in Orlando, I believe this was the marathon that went on at Disney right?</td>', 'Living in Orlando, I believe this was the marathon that went on at Disney right?', '2003-01-20 00:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(194965, 11161, 933, '<td valign="top">Hey, it''s downtown Portland!!</td>', 'Hey, it''s downtown Portland!!', '2003-01-20 00:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(194968, 11342, 255, '<td valign="top">man this is cool! more later.</td>', 'man this is cool! more later.', '2003-01-20 00:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(194983, 11167, 255, '<td valign="top">this is really cool-- the composition, framing--this is even one of the few color desaturated pics i have seen that i really like! the wintry trees make for a nice backdrop. very noce work!</td>', 'this is really cool-- the composition, framing--this is even one of the few color desaturated pics i have seen that i really like! the wintry trees make for a nice backdrop. very noce work!', '2003-01-20 01:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(194985, 11274, 4159, '<td valign="top">The sign itself is very funny, but I can''t say I completely agree with your composition - the sign is just off center, and the banner is distracting.</td>', 'The sign itself is very funny, but I can''t say I completely agree with your composition - the sign is just off center, and the banner is distracting.', '2003-01-20 01:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(194986, 11326, 4159, '<td valign="top">You forgot "Parker" and "Pixley."  I like your titling, but the picture is a bit too blurry, especially along the left, for my tastes.</td>', 'You forgot "Parker" and "Pixley."  I like your titling, but the picture is a bit too blurry, especially along the left, for my tastes.', '2003-01-20 01:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(194988, 11271, 4813, '<td valign="top">what the hell...I am sorry I just couldn''t resist.  I guess the devil made me do it.  Hell will freeze over before I make another pun.  I just hope that when the now melts hell is not is high water. Now I have to do all those things I said I would do when hell froze over.  Seriously, good photo  p.s. I give it a 6.66</td>', 'what the hell...I am sorry I just couldn''t resist.  I guess the devil made me do it.  Hell will freeze over before I make another pun.  I just hope that when the now melts hell is not is high water. Now I have to do all those things I said I would do when hell froze over.  Seriously, good photo  p.s. I give it a 6.66', '2003-01-20 01:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(194989, 11271, 4159, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if you found or made this sign, but it''s pretty funny.  As far as the picture goes, I would''ve liked a little more space on the upper and right edges of the signs.  You might have given it a little more umph if you had had an angle more to the left, too - that way, we could see the "stop ahead" sign on the road away from "Hell" which would''ve been interesting to people who look for that kind of stuff.</td>', 'I don''t know if you found or made this sign, but it''s pretty funny.  As far as the picture goes, I would''ve liked a little more space on the upper and right edges of the signs.  You might have given it a little more umph if you had had an angle more to the left, too - that way, we could see the "stop ahead" sign on the road away from "Hell" which would''ve been interesting to people who look for that kind of stuff.', '2003-01-20 01:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(194993, 11300, 4159, '<td valign="top">Well composed as night shots go, but I can''t find any significance in the actual street sign besides its being there in the night shot.</td>', 'Well composed as night shots go, but I can''t find any significance in the actual street sign besides its being there in the night shot.', '2003-01-20 01:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(194994, 11181, 4159, '<td valign="top">The flash is harsh, and the subject isn''t very forgiving.</td>', 'The flash is harsh, and the subject isn''t very forgiving.', '2003-01-20 01:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(194995, 11315, 3791, '<td valign="top">I like your picture but I''m not sure it fits the challenge  ¿?</td>', 'I like your picture but I''m not sure it fits the challenge  ¿?', '2003-01-20 01:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(194996, 11240, 4159, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, and photograph.  I wish the top of the sign hadn''t been quite as bright, but this is still a very good shot.</td>', 'Nice concept, and photograph.  I wish the top of the sign hadn''t been quite as bright, but this is still a very good shot.', '2003-01-20 01:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(194998, 11277, 4159, '<td valign="top">The focus really seems to be the 2nd st. pike here; I think the picture would''ve been more effective if it was more obviously the "street rd" part that was the focal point.</td>', 'The focus really seems to be the 2nd st. pike here; I think the picture would''ve been more effective if it was more obviously the "street rd" part that was the focal point.', '2003-01-20 01:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(194999, 11280, 4159, '<td valign="top">This border really kills the picture for me; it''s just too big.</td>', 'This border really kills the picture for me; it''s just too big.', '2003-01-20 01:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(195000, 11240, 3791, '<td valign="top">is it oversaturated or is the yellow paint damaged? nice angle and crop</td>', 'is it oversaturated or is the yellow paint damaged? nice angle and crop', '2003-01-20 01:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(195002, 11270, 4159, '<td valign="top">This might have been more effective if the lines of the posts had lined up with the edges of the picture, and you had used them to frame your picture a bit more.</td>', 'This might have been more effective if the lines of the posts had lined up with the edges of the picture, and you had used them to frame your picture a bit more.', '2003-01-20 01:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(195003, 11153, 4159, '<td valign="top">A really funny concept, but something ought to have been in focus for it to be carried out effectively.</td>', 'A really funny concept, but something ought to have been in focus for it to be carried out effectively.', '2003-01-20 01:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(195005, 11253, 4159, '<td valign="top">The grain and the washed-out color are problems for me here.</td>', 'The grain and the washed-out color are problems for me here.', '2003-01-20 01:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(195006, 11313, 4159, '<td valign="top">The branches distract and detract; also, you might have tried a closer crop on both sides, more so on the left.</td>', 'The branches distract and detract; also, you might have tried a closer crop on both sides, more so on the left.', '2003-01-20 01:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(195007, 11207, 3791, '<td valign="top">seams to be a dangerous road!!</td>', 'seams to be a dangerous road!!', '2003-01-20 01:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(195008, 11226, 4159, '<td valign="top">Great, you''ve got the song stuck in my head.  Hm.  The right side seems a bit washed out and/or overexposed.  And to get the "lollipop" concept across, you might have included some of the pole (stick).</td>', 'Great, you''ve got the song stuck in my head.  Hm.  The right side seems a bit washed out and/or overexposed.  And to get the "lollipop" concept across, you might have included some of the pole (stick).', '2003-01-20 01:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(195009, 11120, 3791, '<td valign="top">¿¿¿???</td>', '¿¿¿???', '2003-01-20 01:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(195011, 11096, 4159, '<td valign="top">I wonder if this might have worked better with a different angle - say, closer to the ground looking up, or from the side. Nice find, though.</td>', 'I wonder if this might have worked better with a different angle - say, closer to the ground looking up, or from the side. Nice find, though.', '2003-01-20 01:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(195012, 11346, 3791, '<td valign="top">beautiful sky! nice composition... what about the sign a little to the left?</td>', 'beautiful sky! nice composition... what about the sign a little to the left?', '2003-01-20 01:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(195013, 11343, 4159, '<td valign="top">Uf.  That''s a bit morbid.  Heh.  I think for this picture to have worked you would have needed to have the sign in focus, and more prominent.</td>', 'Uf.  That''s a bit morbid.  Heh.  I think for this picture to have worked you would have needed to have the sign in focus, and more prominent.', '2003-01-20 01:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(195014, 11230, 4159, '<td valign="top">The contrast in warm color with cool color is ncie here, and it''s effective in its simplicity.  I think I might have liked a bit more space on the left, but other than that, well done.</td>', 'The contrast in warm color with cool color is ncie here, and it''s effective in its simplicity.  I think I might have liked a bit more space on the left, but other than that, well done.', '2003-01-20 01:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(195015, 11296, 4159, '<td valign="top">Blurry, almost looks like it was taken while driving.  I''m not sure why this would be of interest as the subject of a photograph, either.</td>', 'Blurry, almost looks like it was taken while driving.  I''m not sure why this would be of interest as the subject of a photograph, either.', '2003-01-20 01:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(195016, 11182, 5391, '<td valign="top">Lovely tonal qualities and composition.  Feels like a piece of fine art.</td>', 'Lovely tonal qualities and composition.  Feels like a piece of fine art.', '2003-01-20 01:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(195018, 11304, 2058, '<td valign="top">Nice, I like the colors in this one... good composition too.  8</td>', 'Nice, I like the colors in this one... good composition too.  8', '2003-01-20 01:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(195019, 11120, 1863, '<td valign="top">An interesting interpretation of a "road sign" hehe... I can understand where you were coming from, kinda.. maybe you mean the wetness of the nose for the sign of how healthy your dog is? -Annida</td>', 'An interesting interpretation of a "road sign" hehe... I can understand where you were coming from, kinda.. maybe you mean the wetness of the nose for the sign of how healthy your dog is? -Annida', '2003-01-20 01:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(195021, 11269, 4159, '<td valign="top">That''s an odd street sign, most of the time the church puts up their own.  I would''ve liked to have had the actually sign in the upper right hand corner instead of just under it, and I think this could have been done with a bit different angle and still kept the church a good part of it.  How did this look in color?</td>', 'That''s an odd street sign, most of the time the church puts up their own.  I would''ve liked to have had the actually sign in the upper right hand corner instead of just under it, and I think this could have been done with a bit different angle and still kept the church a good part of it.  How did this look in color?', '2003-01-20 01:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(195022, 11266, 2058, '<td valign="top">One of my photos I ended up not submitting sort of had the same composition as this.  I like it!  The use of sepia tones gives a nice feeling of the past too.  7</td>', 'One of my photos I ended up not submitting sort of had the same composition as this.  I like it!  The use of sepia tones gives a nice feeling of the past too.  7', '2003-01-20 01:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(195023, 11125, 4159, '<td valign="top">I''m a bit reluctant to qualify this as a road sign, even if it is a sign that''s on the road.  Aside from that, though, it''s a little blurry, and you cut off bits of the letters that should''ve stayed.</td>', 'I''m a bit reluctant to qualify this as a road sign, even if it is a sign that''s on the road.  Aside from that, though, it''s a little blurry, and you cut off bits of the letters that should''ve stayed.', '2003-01-20 01:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(195024, 11108, 1863, '<td valign="top">Interesting photograph! I like the blur of the motion of the plane. The sign is a bit dark, but it doesn''t take too much away from the photograph. I also like the colour of your horizon. -Annida</td>', 'Interesting photograph! I like the blur of the motion of the plane. The sign is a bit dark, but it doesn''t take too much away from the photograph. I also like the colour of your horizon. -Annida', '2003-01-20 01:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(195026, 11180, 4159, '<td valign="top">The lights are too glaring for this to really look nice, and the brigh tlight on the tree in the bottom left is also very distracting.</td>', 'The lights are too glaring for this to really look nice, and the brigh tlight on the tree in the bottom left is also very distracting.', '2003-01-20 01:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(195027, 11132, 5391, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful, amazing shot.  The high contrast adds a cartooney feel to it, almost.  The monochromatic color emphasizes that, and the overall composition couldn''t be better.  Congrats.  Perfect.  (10)</td>', 'This is a beautiful, amazing shot.  The high contrast adds a cartooney feel to it, almost.  The monochromatic color emphasizes that, and the overall composition couldn''t be better.  Congrats.  Perfect.  (10)', '2003-01-20 01:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(195028, 11144, 4159, '<td valign="top">You should submit a picture a little closer to the allowed maximum, as that is much more effective in presentation.  Looking at this picture: the colors seem a little washed out, and it might have been better composed if the mailboxes were on the right side of the picture, and part of the road on the left...anything that didn''t have the mailboxes smack dab in the middle.</td>', 'You should submit a picture a little closer to the allowed maximum, as that is much more effective in presentation.  Looking at this picture: the colors seem a little washed out, and it might have been better composed if the mailboxes were on the right side of the picture, and part of the road on the left...anything that didn''t have the mailboxes smack dab in the middle.', '2003-01-20 01:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(195029, 11261, 1863, '<td valign="top">Lovely and crisp. which way do you go?!  I think the composition of the photograph is very balanced. well done.</td>', 'Lovely and crisp. which way do you go?!  I think the composition of the photograph is very balanced. well done.', '2003-01-20 01:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(195030, 11060, 92, '<td valign="top">Awesome ! 10</td>', 'Awesome ! 10', '2003-01-20 01:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(195031, 11049, 2058, '<td valign="top">This feels really forboding (did I spell that right?) to me... I like the photos that put the sign in context with the surroundings, and I think this one works rather well.  I think the foreground is a bit too dark, but this is a well done image otherwise.  I might have also made the dead end sign a bit more prominent, it doesnt stand out enough.  7</td>', 'This feels really forboding (did I spell that right?) to me... I like the photos that put the sign in context with the surroundings, and I think this one works rather well.  I think the foreground is a bit too dark, but this is a well done image otherwise.  I might have also made the dead end sign a bit more prominent, it doesnt stand out enough.  7', '2003-01-20 01:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(195032, 11097, 4159, '<td valign="top">The concept is good, but the colors and focus are a bit lacking.  Still, creative.</td>', 'The concept is good, but the colors and focus are a bit lacking.  Still, creative.', '2003-01-20 01:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(195033, 11060, 2058, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot!  How did you get the light beams to look like that?  Was it foggy out?  9</td>', 'Excellent shot!  How did you get the light beams to look like that?  Was it foggy out?  9', '2003-01-20 01:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(195034, 11258, 4159, '<td valign="top">What are all the colored specks all over the place?  This picture is chaotic in a way that I don''t think you intended; I think it would have been better cropped without the theater-for-rent part on the left.</td>', 'What are all the colored specks all over the place?  This picture is chaotic in a way that I don''t think you intended; I think it would have been better cropped without the theater-for-rent part on the left.', '2003-01-20 01:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(195036, 11218, 4159, '<td valign="top">Looks awfully dismal, not at all like TV, anyhow.  I think this might have been better if you had been standing a bit further to the left, so the pole didn''t cut right through the building.  How did this look in color?</td>', 'Looks awfully dismal, not at all like TV, anyhow.  I think this might have been better if you had been standing a bit further to the left, so the pole didn''t cut right through the building.  How did this look in color?', '2003-01-20 01:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(195037, 11220, 4159, '<td valign="top">Funny concept, but the sign isn''t really in focus and doesn''t seem to be placed effectively in the picture.</td>', 'Funny concept, but the sign isn''t really in focus and doesn''t seem to be placed effectively in the picture.', '2003-01-20 01:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
