(195042, 11087, 4159, '<td valign="top">I wish my local government was this creative.  I don''t think I like the way you cut off the curves here, I think it would have been more effective showing the full sign.</td>', 'I wish my local government was this creative.  I don''t think I like the way you cut off the curves here, I think it would have been more effective showing the full sign.', '2003-01-20 01:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
