(195045, 11110, 2058, '<td valign="top">Excellent color in this one.  I like the composition quite a bit.  My only criticism would be the jpeg compression is very evident here, as the image is only 30k, and you are allowed 150k.  6</td>', 'Excellent color in this one.  I like the composition quite a bit.  My only criticism would be the jpeg compression is very evident here, as the image is only 30k, and you are allowed 150k.  6', '2003-01-20 01:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
