(195314, 11181, 342, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this photo better if it had not been taken from above, but rather at the same level of the toys.</td>', 'I would have liked this photo better if it had not been taken from above, but rather at the same level of the toys.', '2003-01-20 07:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
