(195596, 11153, 3607, '<td valign="top">very original.  too bad the focus on the funeral home is a little soft (although i don''t know if it could have been done better given the DOF challenge inherent with the shot).</td>', 'very original.  too bad the focus on the funeral home is a little soft (although i don''t know if it could have been done better given the DOF challenge inherent with the shot).', '2003-01-20 11:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
