(195621, 11258, 3607, '<td valign="top">if you had only been two blocks further north you could have captured the only strip club still on times square - but that would have been signs of times square past ;-)<br/> <br/>its too bad the empty theater marquee is in the photo.  i think you could have found a couple of locations where the photo would have been filled more with lighted billboards.</td>', 'if you had only been two blocks further north you could have captured the only strip club still on times square - but that would have been signs of times square past ;-) its too bad the empty theater marquee is in the photo.  i think you could have found a couple of locations where the photo would have been filled more with lighted billboards.', '2003-01-20 11:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(195622, 11172, 2058, '<td valign="top">Very nice...  I like the depth of this, the sign in front really pops out.  7</td>', 'Very nice...  I like the depth of this, the sign in front really pops out.  7', '2003-01-20 11:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(195626, 11276, 3607, '<td valign="top">this photo makes me want to put on my sunglasses.  great shot.</td>', 'this photo makes me want to put on my sunglasses.  great shot.', '2003-01-20 11:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(195627, 11185, 3607, '<td valign="top">great color/gray contrast.  one of my favorites this week.  good shot.</td>', 'great color/gray contrast.  one of my favorites this week.  good shot.', '2003-01-20 11:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(195628, 11325, 2058, '<td valign="top">Good capture, very unique.  8</td>', 'Good capture, very unique.  8', '2003-01-20 11:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(195631, 11167, 3607, '<td valign="top">i like the angle you choose for the shot.  i might have increased the color saturation to further differentiate the sign from the grey background.</td>', 'i like the angle you choose for the shot.  i might have increased the color saturation to further differentiate the sign from the grey background.', '2003-01-20 11:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(195633, 11201, 2058, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting on the sign.  This might have worked really well in black and white too. 7</td>', 'I like the lighting on the sign.  This might have worked really well in black and white too. 7', '2003-01-20 11:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(195644, 11209, 3127, '<td valign="top">A little too much space at the bottom of the pic. Good color and clarity.</td>', 'A little too much space at the bottom of the pic. Good color and clarity.', '2003-01-20 11:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(195645, 11185, 3127, '<td valign="top">Very evocative. Good photo.</td>', 'Very evocative. Good photo.', '2003-01-20 11:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(195650, 11340, 3127, '<td valign="top">Moving and humbling photo. The street name brings to mind the phrase "man''s inhumanity to man". Total conent is excellent and black/white gives it the proper tone. Good depth and clarity.</td>', 'Moving and humbling photo. The street name brings to mind the phrase "man''s inhumanity to man". Total conent is excellent and black/white gives it the proper tone. Good depth and clarity.', '2003-01-20 11:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(195652, 11300, 5964, '<td valign="top">There is just something visually pleasing about this shot. I like the placement of the No Ped sign and the fact you can see the pedestrian crossing sign across the intersection. The black and White in the photo really makes the main No ped sign stand out. This just proves you can take an everyday sign and make it art. Great Job! 10 The only thing that troubles me about this shot is the bright light on tyhe building, The no ped sign is so bright compared to the dark background, but the light is even brighter, and draws my attention. The dilema though is if you cropped it out, then you would not have a full building, I like the choice you made, but the light is still a bit distracting.</td>', 'There is just something visually pleasing about this shot. I like the placement of the No Ped sign and the fact you can see the pedestrian crossing sign across the intersection. The black and White in the photo really makes the main No ped sign stand out. This just proves you can take an everyday sign and make it art. Great Job! 10 The only thing that troubles me about this shot is the bright light on tyhe building, The no ped sign is so bright compared to the dark background, but the light is even brighter, and draws my attention. The dilema though is if you cropped it out, then you would not have a full building, I like the choice you made, but the light is still a bit distracting.', '2003-01-20 11:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(195655, 11182, 3127, '<td valign="top">Great sharpness! This looks great in black and white!</td>', 'Great sharpness! This looks great in black and white!', '2003-01-20 11:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(195658, 11164, 3127, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and depth of field. Very good shot!</td>', 'Nice composition and depth of field. Very good shot!', '2003-01-20 11:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(195661, 11193, 5964, '<td valign="top">Great idea and flawless execution. I know your subject was red, but I do wonder what a black and white would have done here to help in contrast. The sign "pops" but not huge due to the same hue. At first I didn''t like the inclusion of the sky on the left hand side, but now, I think that is what makes the picture work. I like the placement of the sign it is pleasing to the eye, your focus was just excellent everything is just sooo crisp. THere is a small bush in the lower right hand side, but due to the colors it really does not stand out. In fact I didn''t notice it till about the tenth time staring at the shot. Great job.10.</td>', 'Great idea and flawless execution. I know your subject was red, but I do wonder what a black and white would have done here to help in contrast. The sign "pops" but not huge due to the same hue. At first I didn''t like the inclusion of the sky on the left hand side, but now, I think that is what makes the picture work. I like the placement of the sign it is pleasing to the eye, your focus was just excellent everything is just sooo crisp. THere is a small bush in the lower right hand side, but due to the colors it really does not stand out. In fact I didn''t notice it till about the tenth time staring at the shot. Great job.10.', '2003-01-20 11:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(195662, 11319, 5100, '<td valign="top">This seems to be a little underexposed, plus I''m not a fan of powelines in pictures..<br/>mhh... this is Monterrey, isn''t it ?</td>', 'This seems to be a little underexposed, plus I''m not a fan of powelines in pictures..mhh... this is Monterrey, isn''t it ?', '2003-01-20 11:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
