(195818, 11308, 3607, '<td valign="top">its great how the clouds and sky reflect off the sign, but i feel the sign was pictured at perhaps too sharp of an angle.  that said, excellent shot.</td>', 'its great how the clouds and sky reflect off the sign, but i feel the sign was pictured at perhaps too sharp of an angle.  that said, excellent shot.', '2003-01-20 14:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(195819, 11060, 3607, '<td valign="top">great effect!  how did you do that?  if you had increased the saturation would the red have come out a bit stronger (or maybe have used your flash to fill it out) - or would that have screwed up the effect?</td>', 'great effect!  how did you do that?  if you had increased the saturation would the red have come out a bit stronger (or maybe have used your flash to fill it out) - or would that have screwed up the effect?', '2003-01-20 14:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
