(195821, 11325, 3607, '<td valign="top">very nice.  many of the sign photos come out with the sign darker than the background.  you did a great job of having the sign stand out and still constructing a dramatic composition.  would increased saturation have brought out the blue a little more?</td>', 'very nice.  many of the sign photos come out with the sign darker than the background.  you did a great job of having the sign stand out and still constructing a dramatic composition.  would increased saturation have brought out the blue a little more?', '2003-01-20 14:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
