(195823, 11060, 5508, '<td valign="top">Brilliant shot. I would very much like to know how this was done. Good job.</td>', 'Brilliant shot. I would very much like to know how this was done. Good job.', '2003-01-20 14:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
