(195826, 11114, 2123, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  The colors and the clarity are gorgeous, and that weathered sign is wonderful. Wow, do I have enough adjectives in there? ;-) Great job. 10</td>', 'This is beautiful.  The colors and the clarity are gorgeous, and that weathered sign is wonderful. Wow, do I have enough adjectives in there? ;-) Great job. 10', '2003-01-20 14:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
