(196000, 11343, 3735, '<td valign="top">I got a chuckle . thank you</td>', 'I got a chuckle . thank you', '2003-01-20 15:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(196002, 11346, 5579, '<td valign="top">Great Color!!  9 from me</td>', 'Great Color!!  9 from me', '2003-01-20 15:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(196003, 11138, 5364, '<td valign="top">I find the border a bit intrusive, and I would have prefered it without the reflection on the sign, but otherwise a nicely executed picture.</td>', 'I find the border a bit intrusive, and I would have prefered it without the reflection on the sign, but otherwise a nicely executed picture.', '2003-01-20 15:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(196004, 11073, 2373, '<td valign="top">i would like to see more color or drasticreduction in color. the colors are just kind of there plain, i no that some peopl like these shots like this,  I do like this shot i am just missing somthing fromit.   thank and good luck!!!</td>', 'i would like to see more color or drasticreduction in color. the colors are just kind of there plain, i no that some peopl like these shots like this,  I do like this shot i am just missing somthing fromit.   thank and good luck!!!', '2003-01-20 15:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(196006, 11049, 1863, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite shot of the week! It is different, it''s original, and the sign seems to add to the mood of the background!  The fog just touching the ground.. it''s so atmospheric! Such a great job of catching this when you did. I love it! 10! -Annida</td>', 'This is my favorite shot of the week! It is different, it''s original, and the sign seems to add to the mood of the background!  The fog just touching the ground.. it''s so atmospheric! Such a great job of catching this when you did. I love it! 10! -Annida', '2003-01-20 16:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(196008, 11269, 1863, '<td valign="top">A very clever shot. The B&amp;W adds to the severity of the image. Compositionally I cannot fault it. The sky is a tiny bit too harsh, but still a great image. 9! -Annida</td>', 'A very clever shot. The B&W adds to the severity of the image. Compositionally I cannot fault it. The sky is a tiny bit too harsh, but still a great image. 9! -Annida', '2003-01-20 16:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(196009, 11151, 1863, '<td valign="top">A cleverly original idea :) You can''t get more in the road than this! -9- Annida</td>', 'A cleverly original idea :) You can''t get more in the road than this! -9- Annida', '2003-01-20 16:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(196011, 11066, 2373, '<td valign="top">Really, really cool effect. makes think of the eighties all over again, aha.<br/>My starts at the flat part ofthr sign buy thr 314 then moves down to the edge of the sign reading it as it goes.It doesnt stop there, tjey countinue onwardwnting to follow the lights. yes, yes they must follow the lights the lights,...........................<br/>......Great picture really good composition this picture fowls extremly well thanks alot....k....scorw=9</td>', 'Really, really cool effect. makes think of the eighties all over again, aha.My starts at the flat part ofthr sign buy thr 314 then moves down to the edge of the sign reading it as it goes.It doesnt stop there, tjey countinue onwardwnting to follow the lights. yes, yes they must follow the lights the lights,.................................Great picture really good composition this picture fowls extremly well thanks alot....k....scorw=9', '2003-01-20 16:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(196012, 11054, 1863, '<td valign="top">This photograph is very appealing to me. I like the way the mood is evoked by the sky, and then the stop sign with all the bullet holes in it. It just looks so out of place, it''s amazing! 8! -Annida</td>', 'This photograph is very appealing to me. I like the way the mood is evoked by the sky, and then the stop sign with all the bullet holes in it. It just looks so out of place, it''s amazing! 8! -Annida', '2003-01-20 16:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(196014, 11206, 1863, '<td valign="top">Compositionally perfect. The road makes my eye move into the photo, and to the trees, and the trees to the sky! Lovely! 10-Annida</td>', 'Compositionally perfect. The road makes my eye move into the photo, and to the trees, and the trees to the sky! Lovely! 10-Annida', '2003-01-20 16:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(196017, 11153, 2373, '<td valign="top">This is so almost a ten,  Great  idea, if the meter were in focus or at least clear or cleaner to make more of a pleasent item, and if the sign were in focus this would be a ten for sure.,..,,..,,..8</td>', 'This is so almost a ten,  Great  idea, if the meter were in focus or at least clear or cleaner to make more of a pleasent item, and if the sign were in focus this would be a ten for sure.,..,,..,,..8', '2003-01-20 16:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(196020, 11220, 2123, '<td valign="top">This seems blurry, and perhaps placing the sign a bit more off center would help the composition as well.</td>', 'This seems blurry, and perhaps placing the sign a bit more off center would help the composition as well.', '2003-01-20 16:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(196022, 11110, 2123, '<td valign="top">Great colors, but it seems a little blurry to me.</td>', 'Great colors, but it seems a little blurry to me.', '2003-01-20 16:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(196023, 11325, 1863, '<td valign="top">At first I thought, how the heck did they do this! But then I noticed the landing gear is out on the plane! AHA! gotcha. Now I understand better how this image was taken. I love the clouds, it reminds me of my favorite picture from last week in the landscape challenge.. anyway.. on to this photo! The sky is superb, and so is the outline on the dark plane. The sign is a little bit too bright, maybe overexposed. A clever shot! 9!!! -Annida</td>', 'At first I thought, how the heck did they do this! But then I noticed the landing gear is out on the plane! AHA! gotcha. Now I understand better how this image was taken. I love the clouds, it reminds me of my favorite picture from last week in the landscape challenge.. anyway.. on to this photo! The sky is superb, and so is the outline on the dark plane. The sign is a little bit too bright, maybe overexposed. A clever shot! 9!!! -Annida', '2003-01-20 16:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(196024, 11207, 2373, '<td valign="top">how much does this improve the way you drive?<br/>Great idea and nice shot.</td>', 'how much does this improve the way you drive?Great idea and nice shot.', '2003-01-20 16:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(196027, 11314, 1863, '<td valign="top">I adore this photograph. The composition is very good. I can only fault it because of the darkness! But you took it under a tree, you couldn''t help it! 9! -Annida</td>', 'I adore this photograph. The composition is very good. I can only fault it because of the darkness! But you took it under a tree, you couldn''t help it! 9! -Annida', '2003-01-20 16:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(196030, 11296, 5579, '<td valign="top">Great Shadows!!  You might want to look at cropping a little bit off the bottom to increase the WOW.</td>', 'Great Shadows!!  You might want to look at cropping a little bit off the bottom to increase the WOW.', '2003-01-20 16:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(196031, 11325, 2373, '<td valign="top">Good composition and i like how the sign stands out as the main object in the picture, evebn though the picture is clearly about the plane braking the speed limit.  Good job!!!</td>', 'Good composition and i like how the sign stands out as the main object in the picture, evebn though the picture is clearly about the plane braking the speed limit.  Good job!!!', '2003-01-20 16:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(196037, 11059, 2223, '<td valign="top">hey i was just on that highway, thru washington of course.</td>', 'hey i was just on that highway, thru washington of course.', '2003-01-20 16:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(196042, 11182, 2373, '<td valign="top">I have know advice for you.   This is a great picture!!!!       I LIke It</td>', 'I have know advice for you.   This is a great picture!!!!       I LIke It', '2003-01-20 16:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(196045, 11114, 2373, '<td valign="top">I love the old style sign mixed with the colos of the deep blue sky.</td>', 'I love the old style sign mixed with the colos of the deep blue sky.', '2003-01-20 16:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(196048, 11206, 2373, '<td valign="top">Dont see to many of these signs. Nice one</td>', 'Dont see to many of these signs. Nice one', '2003-01-20 16:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(196049, 11058, 1863, '<td valign="top">I love the sign you chose :) I''ve seen the duck crossing sign a few times, but never with the extra chick flying up like that, it''s hilarious. One thing is just really distracting! that pink line going through the stop sign. Did you use the slow shutter setting? (I''m new at photography, so I don''t know all the technical terms yet)... very inventive use! I give you a 9! -Annida</td>', 'I love the sign you chose :) I''ve seen the duck crossing sign a few times, but never with the extra chick flying up like that, it''s hilarious. One thing is just really distracting! that pink line going through the stop sign. Did you use the slow shutter setting? (I''m new at photography, so I don''t know all the technical terms yet)... very inventive use! I give you a 9! -Annida', '2003-01-20 16:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(196050, 11344, 669, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and composition.  For me it''s a little dark and seems to be slightly blurred. 5</td>', 'I like the idea and composition.  For me it''s a little dark and seems to be slightly blurred. 5', '2003-01-20 16:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(196051, 11300, 2373, '<td valign="top">this is somthing like what i was looking for,  Great job!!!!!!</td>', 'this is somthing like what i was looking for,  Great job!!!!!!', '2003-01-20 16:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(196053, 11330, 669, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, I think it''s a bit of a shame the background was quite dark.  Was this taken at dusk?</td>', 'Nice idea, I think it''s a bit of a shame the background was quite dark.  Was this taken at dusk?', '2003-01-20 16:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(196056, 11290, 1005, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm, neat looking sculpture, but it''s kinda far away to really see it good.  The gratuitous sign for the challenge doesn''t seem to fit with the title and subject, there''s no appearant connection.  5 Swash</td>', 'Hmmmm, neat looking sculpture, but it''s kinda far away to really see it good.  The gratuitous sign for the challenge doesn''t seem to fit with the title and subject, there''s no appearant connection.  5 Swash', '2003-01-20 16:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(196061, 11249, 669, '<td valign="top">My only slightly reservation is the angle of the sign.  With the plane quite high, I think the eye naturally draws to the sign, which being so close to the border looks a bit skew.</td>', 'My only slightly reservation is the angle of the sign.  With the plane quite high, I think the eye naturally draws to the sign, which being so close to the border looks a bit skew.', '2003-01-20 16:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(196068, 11317, 5728, '<td valign="top">Does this mean everone here died at this tree? Man that is sad!</td>', 'Does this mean everone here died at this tree? Man that is sad!', '2003-01-20 16:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(196072, 11120, 5728, '<td valign="top">Can''t really see a road sign in this photo. Am I missing something?</td>', 'Can''t really see a road sign in this photo. Am I missing something?', '2003-01-20 16:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(196074, 11110, 669, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo but is there jpeg artifacts around the sign?  Maybe increase the quality a little?</td>', 'This is a nice photo but is there jpeg artifacts around the sign?  Maybe increase the quality a little?', '2003-01-20 16:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(196076, 11269, 5728, '<td valign="top">This would have been nice in color. But I like it this way too.</td>', 'This would have been nice in color. But I like it this way too.', '2003-01-20 16:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(196079, 11283, 5728, '<td valign="top">Great shot. The poewer lines draw my attention a little, but in general I like it.</td>', 'Great shot. The poewer lines draw my attention a little, but in general I like it.', '2003-01-20 16:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(196080, 11221, 2363, '<td valign="top">Love this photo - my favourite in this challenge. The contrast between the blue and the yellow is great!</td>', 'Love this photo - my favourite in this challenge. The contrast between the blue and the yellow is great!', '2003-01-20 17:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(196081, 11223, 5728, '<td valign="top">cute</td>', 'cute', '2003-01-20 17:01:13.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(196082, 11149, 3735, '<td valign="top">Great photo but where is the sign ?</td>', 'Great photo but where is the sign ?', '2003-01-20 17:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(196085, 11298, 1647, '<td valign="top">Your composition is good, however it looks like the image needs to be rotated slightly counter clockwise - to get the signs and it''s legs level.  You might have also considered including more of the road in the foreground, although it looks quite a distance from the sign.  Focus and lighting are good and there''s a certain humour element in "Booger Hollow" that can''t be missed.</td>', 'Your composition is good, however it looks like the image needs to be rotated slightly counter clockwise - to get the signs and it''s legs level.  You might have also considered including more of the road in the foreground, although it looks quite a distance from the sign.  Focus and lighting are good and there''s a certain humour element in "Booger Hollow" that can''t be missed.', '2003-01-20 17:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(196086, 11258, 3735, '<td valign="top">I have a photo on the Kodak quilt in  Time Squair . If you had got just a little closer I could have seen it.</td>', 'I have a photo on the Kodak quilt in  Time Squair . If you had got just a little closer I could have seen it.', '2003-01-20 17:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(196087, 11161, 5728, '<td valign="top">COOL!</td>', 'COOL!', '2003-01-20 17:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(196092, 11224, 1647, '<td valign="top">The colour is great, however I find the grass behind the sign a little too bright - it makes it hard to focus on the sign.  Focus is quite good.</td>', 'The colour is great, however I find the grass behind the sign a little too bright - it makes it hard to focus on the sign.  Focus is quite good.', '2003-01-20 17:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(196095, 11285, 669, '<td valign="top">I really like the photo, but I''m not keen on the border at all.  I think the photo would look better without one at all, or possibly a darker colour.</td>', 'I really like the photo, but I''m not keen on the border at all.  I think the photo would look better without one at all, or possibly a darker colour.', '2003-01-20 17:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(196097, 11280, 1647, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting photo.  The black and white border complement the black and white house well - which appears to be the focal point of the image.  The blurred effect of the sign actually comes across quite well.  Good job.</td>', 'This is an interesting photo.  The black and white border complement the black and white house well - which appears to be the focal point of the image.  The blurred effect of the sign actually comes across quite well.  Good job.', '2003-01-20 17:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(196099, 11324, 1647, '<td valign="top">Well done - the framing is quite good although I wonder if a slightly longer shot (perhaps including the base of the sign post) would work well.  Colours are lovely and the clarity of the stop sign is very good.</td>', 'Well done - the framing is quite good although I wonder if a slightly longer shot (perhaps including the base of the sign post) would work well.  Colours are lovely and the clarity of the stop sign is very good.', '2003-01-20 17:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(196100, 11212, 3730, '<td valign="top">very interesting shot...wish you had gotten more of the ''yield'' sign instead of cutting the corners.</td>', 'very interesting shot...wish you had gotten more of the ''yield'' sign instead of cutting the corners.', '2003-01-20 17:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(196101, 11144, 5728, '<td valign="top">I like the way the flags drop down to the back.</td>', 'I like the way the flags drop down to the back.', '2003-01-20 17:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(196102, 11285, 3730, '<td valign="top">border doesn''t quite work (im sure someone else has mentioned that) ...other than that, it''s a stop sign...not very interesting IMO</td>', 'border doesn''t quite work (im sure someone else has mentioned that) ...other than that, it''s a stop sign...not very interesting IMO', '2003-01-20 17:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(196104, 11128, 3730, '<td valign="top">i like the selective focus on this one...maybe a bit soft on the foreground though.</td>', 'i like the selective focus on this one...maybe a bit soft on the foreground though.', '2003-01-20 17:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(196105, 11297, 3730, '<td valign="top">Your sign is a bit dark and doesn''t seem to be the focus of the image. nice sky and scenery.</td>', 'Your sign is a bit dark and doesn''t seem to be the focus of the image. nice sky and scenery.', '2003-01-20 17:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(196106, 11060, 3735, '<td valign="top">cool</td>', 'cool', '2003-01-20 17:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(196108, 11222, 1647, '<td valign="top">I love these old signs when you find them.  Your composition is quite good.  The only thing I would suggest is perhaps try a shot without the thick branch going across the sign and see which is more effective - I found it slightly distracting when reading the sign.  Focus and colour is nice and appropriate to the image.</td>', 'I love these old signs when you find them.  Your composition is quite good.  The only thing I would suggest is perhaps try a shot without the thick branch going across the sign and see which is more effective - I found it slightly distracting when reading the sign.  Focus and colour is nice and appropriate to the image.', '2003-01-20 17:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(196110, 11174, 3730, '<td valign="top">interesting technique...your sign is a bit crooked, though. i like the composition, with the moon.</td>', 'interesting technique...your sign is a bit crooked, though. i like the composition, with the moon.', '2003-01-20 17:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(196111, 11303, 3730, '<td valign="top">i thinking shooting at such a wide angle creates a very distracting photo with nothing being the main subject.</td>', 'i thinking shooting at such a wide angle creates a very distracting photo with nothing being the main subject.', '2003-01-20 17:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(196112, 11240, 5753, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing here that the ISO was a little high for this, hence the coarse grain and the brightness on the top right hand side?  Great idea though!</td>', 'I''m guessing here that the ISO was a little high for this, hence the coarse grain and the brightness on the top right hand side?  Great idea though!', '2003-01-20 17:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(196113, 11111, 1647, '<td valign="top">I really love the background - it says so much.  Colours and focus is great.  You''ve also met the challenge theme quite easily.  Well done - the best image I''ve viewed so far.</td>', 'I really love the background - it says so much.  Colours and focus is great.  You''ve also met the challenge theme quite easily.  Well done - the best image I''ve viewed so far.', '2003-01-20 17:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(196115, 11129, 3730, '<td valign="top">Mui buena, amigo. Me gusta de las colores...la composicion esta linda....and my spanish not so great :)</td>', 'Mui buena, amigo. Me gusta de las colores...la composicion esta linda....and my spanish not so great :)', '2003-01-20 17:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(196118, 11142, 3730, '<td valign="top">interesting angle. a bit dark. wish the graffitti wasn''t there.</td>', 'interesting angle. a bit dark. wish the graffitti wasn''t there.', '2003-01-20 17:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(196119, 11070, 5753, '<td valign="top">Wrong challenge?</td>', 'Wrong challenge?', '2003-01-20 17:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(196120, 11087, 3730, '<td valign="top">cute. a bit dark. composition is great.</td>', 'cute. a bit dark. composition is great.', '2003-01-20 17:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(196121, 11263, 3730, '<td valign="top">a bit too dark...i don''t particularly like the centered composition...good luck :)</td>', 'a bit too dark...i don''t particularly like the centered composition...good luck :)', '2003-01-20 17:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(196122, 11197, 1647, '<td valign="top">What a lovely building (we have no architecture like this in Australia really).  You''ve managed to include a sign although it looks a little out of focus - the main building is focused very well.</td>', 'What a lovely building (we have no architecture like this in Australia really).  You''ve managed to include a sign although it looks a little out of focus - the main building is focused very well.', '2003-01-20 17:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(196125, 11144, 3730, '<td valign="top">too small....hardly a road sign...good luck :)</td>', 'too small....hardly a road sign...good luck :)', '2003-01-20 17:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(196126, 11218, 5753, '<td valign="top">Picture seems a little too crowded on the top, and open in the bottom.  Would shooting this picture from lower balance it out a little more?  Looks very sharp though.  Good luck! 7</td>', 'Picture seems a little too crowded on the top, and open in the bottom.  Would shooting this picture from lower balance it out a little more?  Looks very sharp though.  Good luck! 7', '2003-01-20 17:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(196128, 11049, 3730, '<td valign="top">i really like the effect and the mood...it''s very scary...wish the sign was a bit lighter...good luck :)</td>', 'i really like the effect and the mood...it''s very scary...wish the sign was a bit lighter...good luck :)', '2003-01-20 17:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(196129, 11277, 5728, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, good capture!</td>', 'I like this photo, good capture!', '2003-01-20 17:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(196130, 11135, 3730, '<td valign="top">i nice enough road sign photo...that''s all...good luck :)</td>', 'i nice enough road sign photo...that''s all...good luck :)', '2003-01-20 17:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(196132, 11318, 5753, '<td valign="top">Striking colour!</td>', 'Striking colour!', '2003-01-20 17:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(196133, 11097, 1647, '<td valign="top">I love the headlights and taillights going through this shot - they are perfect.  There''s also a quirkiness with the sign being about a camera that I like a lot.  Add to that the fact that your composition (sign, road and tree) is perfect - there''s really very little to fault with this photo - well done.</td>', 'I love the headlights and taillights going through this shot - they are perfect.  There''s also a quirkiness with the sign being about a camera that I like a lot.  Add to that the fact that your composition (sign, road and tree) is perfect - there''s really very little to fault with this photo - well done.', '2003-01-20 17:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(196134, 11304, 3730, '<td valign="top">very nice colours on this shot...would like to see more of a symmetry, though...good luck :)</td>', 'very nice colours on this shot...would like to see more of a symmetry, though...good luck :)', '2003-01-20 17:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(196135, 11330, 6284, '<td valign="top">Very cute concept =o)</td>', 'Very cute concept =o)', '2003-01-20 17:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(196136, 11315, 3730, '<td valign="top">AWESOME MESSAGE!!!  ...but not really a road sign :( good luck :)</td>', 'AWESOME MESSAGE!!!  ...but not really a road sign :( good luck :)', '2003-01-20 17:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(196140, 11147, 3730, '<td valign="top">i see what you were trying to do here, but maybe if you had gotten closer to the sign it would have worked better...good luck... :)</td>', 'i see what you were trying to do here, but maybe if you had gotten closer to the sign it would have worked better...good luck... :)', '2003-01-20 17:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(196141, 11118, 1647, '<td valign="top">You''ve managed to get the colours incredibly vivid in this photo - although I believe it''s a totally legal manipulation.  The sky is a lovely outcome of this - I really like the colour against the silohuetted trees.  The "giant toad" title is also very funny - well done.</td>', 'You''ve managed to get the colours incredibly vivid in this photo - although I believe it''s a totally legal manipulation.  The sky is a lovely outcome of this - I really like the colour against the silohuetted trees.  The "giant toad" title is also very funny - well done.', '2003-01-20 17:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(196142, 11335, 3730, '<td valign="top">Love the sharpness on this photo, nice composition...good luck :)</td>', 'Love the sharpness on this photo, nice composition...good luck :)', '2003-01-20 17:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(196143, 11142, 4648, '<td valign="top">I sure wouldn''t know what to do here.  I''d give way to everyone I guess and not move until I was the last one left.  Love the angle you took it at.  That adds at least 2 to 3 more points.  Good focus and crop.  Real nice job.  It''s a 8 from me.</td>', 'I sure wouldn''t know what to do here.  I''d give way to everyone I guess and not move until I was the last one left.  Love the angle you took it at.  That adds at least 2 to 3 more points.  Good focus and crop.  Real nice job.  It''s a 8 from me.', '2003-01-20 17:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(196144, 11326, 3730, '<td valign="top">I don''t like to see a thin border on an image that''s already too busy. But that''s just me...the photo is, well, busy, but i do like the play on the signs...good luck :)</td>', 'I don''t like to see a thin border on an image that''s already too busy. But that''s just me...the photo is, well, busy, but i do like the play on the signs...good luck :)', '2003-01-20 17:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(196146, 11161, 4648, '<td valign="top">Great photo and really hard to understand sign.  They''re both a 9 form me.  Good cropping and focus.  Like the composition.  Nice setting.  Really nice photo.</td>', 'Great photo and really hard to understand sign.  They''re both a 9 form me.  Good cropping and focus.  Like the composition.  Nice setting.  Really nice photo.', '2003-01-20 17:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(196147, 11296, 4400, '<td valign="top">out of focus</td>', 'out of focus', '2003-01-20 17:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(196151, 11222, 4400, '<td valign="top">Nice and peaceful</td>', 'Nice and peaceful', '2003-01-20 17:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(196152, 11219, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo.  Shame you didn''t crop off the front part and get some sky.  The red buildings would look wonderful against the sky.  If you had taken it from in the street this could have been done without loosing the sign or kid.  But you technically did a great job on the photo.  It''s still a 6.</td>', 'Beautiful photo.  Shame you didn''t crop off the front part and get some sky.  The red buildings would look wonderful against the sky.  If you had taken it from in the street this could have been done without loosing the sign or kid.  But you technically did a great job on the photo.  It''s still a 6.', '2003-01-20 17:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
