(196154, 11262, 4400, '<td valign="top">ummmm peaceful yes!</td>', 'ummmm peaceful yes!', '2003-01-20 17:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(196155, 11096, 4648, '<td valign="top">Is this a "road sign"?  I obviously don''t understand it.  But I might figure it out if the photo had been taken further back and I could see some of the street and surroundings.  It''s cropped too tightly on the sign for those of us who don''t live over there.  It is a good sharply focused photo other wise.  Just too cramped.  Best I can do is give it a 5.</td>', 'Is this a "road sign"?  I obviously don''t understand it.  But I might figure it out if the photo had been taken further back and I could see some of the street and surroundings.  It''s cropped too tightly on the sign for those of us who don''t live over there.  It is a good sharply focused photo other wise.  Just too cramped.  Best I can do is give it a 5.', '2003-01-20 17:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(196157, 11138, 3032, '<td valign="top">Yes, else he wouldn''t be visible.</td>', 'Yes, else he wouldn''t be visible.', '2003-01-20 17:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(196160, 11285, 4648, '<td valign="top">It''s cropped too closely for me to see much unique about this sign.  It might be right at the edge of the woods and the road ends there, but I can''t tell from the photo.  Needs to be pulled back from showing some of the surroundings for me to see what is unique here.  The sign is also fuzzy around the edges.  Need better focus.  It''s a 4 from me.</td>', 'It''s cropped too closely for me to see much unique about this sign.  It might be right at the edge of the woods and the road ends there, but I can''t tell from the photo.  Needs to be pulled back from showing some of the surroundings for me to see what is unique here.  The sign is also fuzzy around the edges.  Need better focus.  It''s a 4 from me.', '2003-01-20 17:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(196162, 11092, 4679, '<td valign="top">LOL Cute.  Love it nice clear shot.  Too bad the road wasn''t under water at the time!!!!! ;)</td>', 'LOL Cute.  Love it nice clear shot.  Too bad the road wasn''t under water at the time!!!!! ;)', '2003-01-20 17:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(196163, 11063, 4648, '<td valign="top">Nice division of state and church here.  Wish the photo had been just a little lighter.  That''s my only problem with it.  But I''ll give it an 8.</td>', 'Nice division of state and church here.  Wish the photo had been just a little lighter.  That''s my only problem with it.  But I''ll give it an 8.', '2003-01-20 17:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(196167, 11083, 1005, '<td valign="top">Funny sign, but doesn''t it read:  Caution!  Donkeys having "fun", instead?  Nicely done.  Where in the world did you find this?  Too silly!  8 Swash</td>', 'Funny sign, but doesn''t it read:  Caution!  Donkeys having "fun", instead?  Nicely done.  Where in the world did you find this?  Too silly!  8 Swash', '2003-01-20 17:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
