(196172, 11207, 4648, '<td valign="top">Are they psychic or something?  Or are they just too stupid and can''t count?  This takes the cake, for me.  It''s a 10 for stupidity.  Also a great photo.  Good composition with good execution.</td>', 'Are they psychic or something?  Or are they just too stupid and can''t count?  This takes the cake, for me.  It''s a 10 for stupidity.  Also a great photo.  Good composition with good execution.', '2003-01-20 17:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
