(196234, 11325, 4494, '<td valign="top">That''s a pretty good shot.  The colors are nice and sign is really cool looking with the gunk dripping down it.  Did you try a B&amp;W?  That might have been nice also.  8.</td>', 'That''s a pretty good shot.  The colors are nice and sign is really cool looking with the gunk dripping down it.  Did you try a B&W?  That might have been nice also.  8.', '2003-01-20 18:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
