(196260, 11292, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo of a beautiful covered bridge.  Not too sure how this fits in the "Road Sign" challenge.  Speed limit sign?  What''s strange or unusual obout a speed limit sign?  As a photo of the covered bridge it''s a 10 with everything right on.  As for a photo about road sign, I don''t really believe it deserves more than a 7, and that because of the quality of the photo.  Great quality.</td>', 'Beautiful photo of a beautiful covered bridge.  Not too sure how this fits in the "Road Sign" challenge.  Speed limit sign?  What''s strange or unusual obout a speed limit sign?  As a photo of the covered bridge it''s a 10 with everything right on.  As for a photo about road sign, I don''t really believe it deserves more than a 7, and that because of the quality of the photo.  Great quality.', '2003-01-20 18:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
