(196263, 11098, 4494, '<td valign="top">Pretty creative!  You should have tried to get closer to the sign somehow without losing the trees.  Should have rotated the picture several degrees to the left also.</td>', 'Pretty creative!  You should have tried to get closer to the sign somehow without losing the trees.  Should have rotated the picture several degrees to the left also.', '2003-01-20 18:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
