(196313, 11281, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice subject and composition although the photo is a little grainy.  The black is a little washed out (perhaps levels in photoshop could have helped) and the yellow is showing some artifacts.  Of course, depending on the camera (and or zoom) used you may have done quite well.</td>', 'Nice subject and composition although the photo is a little grainy.  The black is a little washed out (perhaps levels in photoshop could have helped) and the yellow is showing some artifacts.  Of course, depending on the camera (and or zoom) used you may have done quite well.', '2003-01-20 19:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
