(196321, 11170, 327, '<td valign="top">Kool. Abstract building/sign. Like it.</td>', 'Kool. Abstract building/sign. Like it.', '2003-01-20 19:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(196322, 11326, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice photo showing the overuse of signs - I considered a very similar shot myself.  I''m not sure about the half-cropped sign on the right edge though - perhaps you should have left it entirely in or cropped it out fully.  I think having the walk sign in the top right corner could have worked well.  Goot work though.</td>', 'Nice photo showing the overuse of signs - I considered a very similar shot myself.  I''m not sure about the half-cropped sign on the right edge though - perhaps you should have left it entirely in or cropped it out fully.  I think having the walk sign in the top right corner could have worked well.  Goot work though.', '2003-01-20 19:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(196325, 11228, 327, '<td valign="top">Urban site...neat.</td>', 'Urban site...neat.', '2003-01-20 19:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(196327, 11243, 1647, '<td valign="top">Very funny photo - the sign is very realistic.  What''s on the tyre though?  Is it water?  Composition is good an focus is good - well done.</td>', 'Very funny photo - the sign is very realistic.  What''s on the tyre though?  Is it water?  Composition is good an focus is good - well done.', '2003-01-20 19:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(196329, 11146, 327, '<td valign="top">Really cool shot....Winner. Love it all....light, tones, composition, focus.</td>', 'Really cool shot....Winner. Love it all....light, tones, composition, focus.', '2003-01-20 19:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(196332, 11230, 327, '<td valign="top">Too cold for me.....burrrrrh. Love the tones, light. Neat shot.</td>', 'Too cold for me.....burrrrrh. Love the tones, light. Neat shot.', '2003-01-20 19:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(196333, 11207, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  The trees are a little blurry, but I suspect this might be from a long exposure and wind combined - not much you can do about that.  Perhaps a clearer sky would be nicer, but it''s not a big deal.  Colour is nice and realistic</td>', 'Nice composition.  The trees are a little blurry, but I suspect this might be from a long exposure and wind combined - not much you can do about that.  Perhaps a clearer sky would be nicer, but it''s not a big deal.  Colour is nice and realistic', '2003-01-20 19:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(196334, 11264, 327, '<td valign="top">lol great find.</td>', 'lol great find.', '2003-01-20 19:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(196335, 11342, 327, '<td valign="top">I like this.....</td>', 'I like this.....', '2003-01-20 19:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(196338, 11243, 327, '<td valign="top">This is just a HOOT and a half. LOLROTF. Good work. Funny.... Good shooting...<br/></td>', 'This is just a HOOT and a half. LOLROTF. Good work. Funny.... Good shooting...', '2003-01-20 19:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(196339, 11302, 1647, '<td valign="top">Technically the photo is fairly good - composition, colour, focus, etc.  Unfortunately it''s not a very exciting photo.  Perhaps you could have got a photo of some cyclists on the path or something?</td>', 'Technically the photo is fairly good - composition, colour, focus, etc.  Unfortunately it''s not a very exciting photo.  Perhaps you could have got a photo of some cyclists on the path or something?', '2003-01-20 19:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
