(196358, 11151, 3280, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge, I like it.  Very crisp focus.  I hope you didn\''t knock down the sign yourself!!  I wonder if this would look as good or better in a landscape orientation.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge, I like it.  Very crisp focus.  I hope you didn\''t knock down the sign yourself!!  I wonder if this would look as good or better in a landscape orientation.', '2003-01-20 19:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
