(196364, 11300, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very nice B &amp; W shot.  Lighting is excellent. I hope I don''t get this for critique because I''m not sure I could suggest anything to improve it!!</td>', 'Very nice B & W shot.  Lighting is excellent. I hope I don''t get this for critique because I''m not sure I could suggest anything to improve it!!', '2003-01-20 19:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(196365, 11342, 1647, '<td valign="top">Well done on submitting a macro shot to the challenge.  The shallow depth of field works well (blurring both the A and E evenly).  The border is ok and the photo actually has some interest to it - I keep looking at it.  Good work.</td>', 'Well done on submitting a macro shot to the challenge.  The shallow depth of field works well (blurring both the A and E evenly).  The border is ok and the photo actually has some interest to it - I keep looking at it.  Good work.', '2003-01-20 19:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(196366, 11280, 4494, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture.</td>', 'Very nice picture.', '2003-01-20 19:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(196367, 11326, 327, '<td valign="top">Oh my gosh!!!! What a hoot this is.......great find,,,good perspective.<br/></td>', 'Oh my gosh!!!! What a hoot this is.......great find,,,good perspective.', '2003-01-20 19:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(196368, 11291, 327, '<td valign="top">Just a good creative idea. I really admire this shot.......well done.<br/></td>', 'Just a good creative idea. I really admire this shot.......well done.', '2003-01-20 19:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(196369, 11324, 6150, '<td valign="top">Real nice shot.</td>', 'Real nice shot.', '2003-01-20 19:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(196370, 11145, 327, '<td valign="top">Neat find, like it.</td>', 'Neat find, like it.', '2003-01-20 19:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(196371, 11087, 4494, '<td valign="top">Ahahahaa, finally a funny sign!!  Very good.  Should have zoomed out a little and shot it more "straight on".  8.</td>', 'Ahahahaa, finally a funny sign!!  Very good.  Should have zoomed out a little and shot it more "straight on".  8.', '2003-01-20 19:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(196372, 11263, 1647, '<td valign="top">The sign is a tad underexposed.  It looks like the sun was behind the sign - I had to revisit my sign in the morning to get around this.  Framing is interesting and works ok - there''s just a fraction of something creeping into the bottom left of the image, but that''s not a big distraction.  Your title is very good.</td>', 'The sign is a tad underexposed.  It looks like the sun was behind the sign - I had to revisit my sign in the morning to get around this.  Framing is interesting and works ok - there''s just a fraction of something creeping into the bottom left of the image, but that''s not a big distraction.  Your title is very good.', '2003-01-20 19:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(196373, 11048, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice job.  I''ve done the polar bear plunge in the past but this looks pretty cold!!</td>', 'Nice job.  I''ve done the polar bear plunge in the past but this looks pretty cold!!', '2003-01-20 19:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(196375, 11300, 327, '<td valign="top">Lonely, spooky, wet and dark. Cool shot. Love the light.</td>', 'Lonely, spooky, wet and dark. Cool shot. Love the light.', '2003-01-20 19:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
