(196418, 11252, 4494, '<td valign="top">Pretty funny...  Should have had an old man looking at the sign instead.  But you get a rare 7 since your pic actually has something to do with the challenge. :)</td>', 'Pretty funny...  Should have had an old man looking at the sign instead.  But you get a rare 7 since your pic actually has something to do with the challenge. :)', '2003-01-20 19:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(196420, 11243, 4494, '<td valign="top">Love it!!  9.</td>', 'Love it!!  9.', '2003-01-20 19:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(196425, 11083, 327, '<td valign="top">Too funny...too cute....really caught my eye. Great find, good shot.</td>', 'Too funny...too cute....really caught my eye. Great find, good shot.', '2003-01-20 19:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(196426, 11230, 4494, '<td valign="top">Wow you know this is a good picture but why did you title it "road sign"?  You might as well have left the title blank.  You should have used "Forgotten Road Sign".   Or "A Sign Nobody Sees".  Use some creativity!!  6.</td>', 'Wow you know this is a good picture but why did you title it "road sign"?  You might as well have left the title blank.  You should have used "Forgotten Road Sign".   Or "A Sign Nobody Sees".  Use some creativity!!  6.', '2003-01-20 19:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(196428, 11249, 4494, '<td valign="top">Whoooaaaa, that plane is LOW!  Good one!</td>', 'Whoooaaaa, that plane is LOW!  Good one!', '2003-01-20 19:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(196431, 11153, 4494, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  However :)  you should have focused on the funeral home sign...  It''s the main subject and the "Time Expired" is really secondary.  8.</td>', 'Excellent.  However :)  you should have focused on the funeral home sign...  It''s the main subject and the "Time Expired" is really secondary.  8.', '2003-01-20 19:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(196434, 11328, 4494, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool.  Should have composed it so that the sign is all the way to the right of the frame (eliminating that ugly fence), and then waited for something interesting to sail by on the left, and snapped it.  7.</td>', 'Pretty cool.  Should have composed it so that the sign is all the way to the right of the frame (eliminating that ugly fence), and then waited for something interesting to sail by on the left, and snapped it.  7.', '2003-01-20 20:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(196435, 11315, 4494, '<td valign="top">That''s not a ROAD sign.  2.</td>', 'That''s not a ROAD sign.  2.', '2003-01-20 20:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(196437, 11269, 4494, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but the composition is irratting.  Could you have moved to the right about 5 feet and taken the pic?  That would have put the Sign on the left, the Church in the middle, and that nice Tree on the right.  Might have been better.  As it is, the tree and sign are fighting for attention.  5.</td>', 'Nice idea but the composition is irratting.  Could you have moved to the right about 5 feet and taken the pic?  That would have put the Sign on the left, the Church in the middle, and that nice Tree on the right.  Might have been better.  As it is, the tree and sign are fighting for attention.  5.', '2003-01-20 20:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(196438, 11110, 671, '<td valign="top">Good picture.  Just a smidgen of blue on the left edge might have improved it.  7</td>', 'Good picture.  Just a smidgen of blue on the left edge might have improved it.  7', '2003-01-20 20:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(196439, 11132, 671, '<td valign="top">great colors!  good cropping.</td>', 'great colors!  good cropping.', '2003-01-20 20:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(196440, 11201, 2158, '<td valign="top">Nice sign, but the shadows rather spoil it.  This would have worked better at a different time of day.</td>', 'Nice sign, but the shadows rather spoil it.  This would have worked better at a different time of day.', '2003-01-20 20:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(196441, 11054, 4494, '<td valign="top">The "title" of the picture is 50% of picture in this challenge (in my opinion), and I can''t believe the TERRIBLE titles I''ve seen on great pictures!! :)  You should have used "The Most Unpopular Stop Sign in the USA".  Or "Residents Petition to Have Stop Sign Removed".   You''d get a 10 with a good title, but a 7 with this title.  Very nice picture, BTW. :)</td>', 'The "title" of the picture is 50% of picture in this challenge (in my opinion), and I can''t believe the TERRIBLE titles I''ve seen on great pictures!! :)  You should have used "The Most Unpopular Stop Sign in the USA".  Or "Residents Petition to Have Stop Sign Removed".   You''d get a 10 with a good title, but a 7 with this title.  Very nice picture, BTW. :)', '2003-01-20 20:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(196442, 11325, 5854, '<td valign="top">Great idea !</td>', 'Great idea !', '2003-01-20 20:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(196443, 11274, 4494, '<td valign="top">Too bad you couldn''t angle it so the no parking sign was out of the pic.</td>', 'Too bad you couldn''t angle it so the no parking sign was out of the pic.', '2003-01-20 20:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(196444, 11179, 4494, '<td valign="top">And the answer is....  ?   What does this mean?</td>', 'And the answer is....  ?   What does this mean?', '2003-01-20 20:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(196445, 11092, 5753, '<td valign="top">Nice colour and focus....the trees give a very nice perception of depth. 9</td>', 'Nice colour and focus....the trees give a very nice perception of depth. 9', '2003-01-20 20:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(196446, 11344, 4494, '<td valign="top">Out of focus I think.  Plus you should have over-exposed this shot a little to lighten up the sign.</td>', 'Out of focus I think.  Plus you should have over-exposed this shot a little to lighten up the sign.', '2003-01-20 20:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(196448, 11214, 4494, '<td valign="top">Judging by the skid marks, no left-turn sign, and positioning of the cars, I would conclude that the blue-shirted driver is clearly at fault.  Probably also has a alcohol blood-level of 1.3 as well. :)</td>', 'Judging by the skid marks, no left-turn sign, and positioning of the cars, I would conclude that the blue-shirted driver is clearly at fault.  Probably also has a alcohol blood-level of 1.3 as well. :)', '2003-01-20 20:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(196455, 11095, 2158, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Personally I''d have gone for a black border rather than white, but that''s just a minor thing and won''t affect my overall opinion.</td>', 'Nice.  Personally I''d have gone for a black border rather than white, but that''s just a minor thing and won''t affect my overall opinion.', '2003-01-20 20:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(196469, 11318, 2158, '<td valign="top">Great colour contrast.</td>', 'Great colour contrast.', '2003-01-20 20:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(196473, 11289, 5964, '<td valign="top">Funny, I really liked the angle of the sign in this shot. I am also glad you included the whole sign too. At first I was thinking there was just too much open space, put after using envelopes to imitate cropping, I like the open space. If it was cropped then the sign would be dead center and that just doesn''t work too well. The color contast between the bright blue and yellow are great also. Good crisp focus. I guess the only draw back in my mind that it is kinda boring, but then street signs as a subject is fairly boring also.8.</td>', 'Funny, I really liked the angle of the sign in this shot. I am also glad you included the whole sign too. At first I was thinking there was just too much open space, put after using envelopes to imitate cropping, I like the open space. If it was cropped then the sign would be dead center and that just doesn''t work too well. The color contast between the bright blue and yellow are great also. Good crisp focus. I guess the only draw back in my mind that it is kinda boring, but then street signs as a subject is fairly boring also.8.', '2003-01-20 20:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(196480, 11061, 5753, '<td valign="top">Texture and colour all over the place.  Good work, good luck. 9</td>', 'Texture and colour all over the place.  Good work, good luck. 9', '2003-01-20 20:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(196484, 11274, 2158, '<td valign="top">I find the sign behind it a bit distracting.  Don''t know if you could have changed your angle slightly to avoid it??</td>', 'I find the sign behind it a bit distracting.  Don''t know if you could have changed your angle slightly to avoid it??', '2003-01-20 20:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(196485, 11188, 5964, '<td valign="top">Just too too funny. Great idea for a sign. The focus is good and crisp and the background doesn''t detract but adds to the feel of the sign. The only problem I am having is the angle of the shot. The sign is on an angle leaning the right, the scaffolding is leaning left, and camera doesn''t follow either. I wonder ehat it might have looked like with the sign perpendicular which would have the scaffolding kinda leaning and ready to fall on the sign. Just a thought. 8.</td>', 'Just too too funny. Great idea for a sign. The focus is good and crisp and the background doesn''t detract but adds to the feel of the sign. The only problem I am having is the angle of the shot. The sign is on an angle leaning the right, the scaffolding is leaning left, and camera doesn''t follow either. I wonder ehat it might have looked like with the sign perpendicular which would have the scaffolding kinda leaning and ready to fall on the sign. Just a thought. 8.', '2003-01-20 20:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(196493, 11068, 2158, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, but the lighting makes it a bit difficult to read the sign.</td>', 'Interesting shot, but the lighting makes it a bit difficult to read the sign.', '2003-01-20 21:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(196495, 11278, 4813, '<td valign="top">ten ten ten ten ten ten ten ten ten ten ten ten ten...Need I say more</td>', 'ten ten ten ten ten ten ten ten ten ten ten ten ten...Need I say more', '2003-01-20 21:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(196498, 11135, 5964, '<td valign="top">Too funny a sign. My suggestion would be to not place it center/off center as it is. Give it more of a perspective by taking the shot at a different angle. Good focus on the shot. The trees in the background neither add or detract from the shot I don;t know if you tried a shot with them blurred out or not, that may have been neat too. Overall cool sign and great pic. 8.</td>', 'Too funny a sign. My suggestion would be to not place it center/off center as it is. Give it more of a perspective by taking the shot at a different angle. Good focus on the shot. The trees in the background neither add or detract from the shot I don;t know if you tried a shot with them blurred out or not, that may have been neat too. Overall cool sign and great pic. 8.', '2003-01-20 21:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(196501, 11251, 4813, '<td valign="top">nice try but the title can''t save the fact that this picture is off the topic...Road Sign.  I do wish that I could take a photograph of a rainbow and have it turn out as good as your</td>', 'nice try but the title can''t save the fact that this picture is off the topic...Road Sign.  I do wish that I could take a photograph of a rainbow and have it turn out as good as your', '2003-01-20 21:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(196505, 11303, 4813, '<td valign="top">off topic to me</td>', 'off topic to me', '2003-01-20 21:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(196507, 11298, 4813, '<td valign="top">you can never go wrong with the word booger in the title</td>', 'you can never go wrong with the word booger in the title', '2003-01-20 21:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(196508, 11281, 4813, '<td valign="top">if the sign is the subject of the photo it is off center</td>', 'if the sign is the subject of the photo it is off center', '2003-01-20 21:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(196512, 11083, 4813, '<td valign="top">cows humping.  a ten for sure</td>', 'cows humping.  a ten for sure', '2003-01-20 21:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(196513, 11326, 4813, '<td valign="top">cute</td>', 'cute', '2003-01-20 21:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(196514, 11096, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice photo - it made sense to centre this photo like you have.  I might have tried a more shallow depth of field to really blur the bushes in the background (if that option is available to you).  Good work</td>', 'Nice photo - it made sense to centre this photo like you have.  I might have tried a more shallow depth of field to really blur the bushes in the background (if that option is available to you).  Good work', '2003-01-20 21:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(196515, 11219, 4813, '<td valign="top">great, great shot a nine...maybe a ten when I look it over again after I am done voting</td>', 'great, great shot a nine...maybe a ten when I look it over again after I am done voting', '2003-01-20 21:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(196516, 11161, 5964, '<td valign="top">Really neat sign photo. Your placement of the horizon/sign pole is excellent, very pleasing to my eyes and interesting. There seems to be a bit of a focus problem, the small print on the sign is pretty unreadable The background is fuzzy too, which might have been your intention, but then I would prefer a bit more blur. 8.</td>', 'Really neat sign photo. Your placement of the horizon/sign pole is excellent, very pleasing to my eyes and interesting. There seems to be a bit of a focus problem, the small print on the sign is pretty unreadable The background is fuzzy too, which might have been your intention, but then I would prefer a bit more blur. 8.', '2003-01-20 21:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(196517, 11068, 4813, '<td valign="top">off topic..no sign.  the angel is bothersome for me</td>', 'off topic..no sign.  the angel is bothersome for me', '2003-01-20 21:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(196519, 11220, 1647, '<td valign="top">The photo looks blurry, but it kind of adds a hand-painted feel to the drawing and I think it actually works fairly well.  Composition of the image is good and the muted colours work well.</td>', 'The photo looks blurry, but it kind of adds a hand-painted feel to the drawing and I think it actually works fairly well.  Composition of the image is good and the muted colours work well.', '2003-01-20 21:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(196522, 11131, 5753, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  From Avenue du Parc eh?  It feels like -20 just looking at that picture.  Good Luck! 8</td>', 'Nice shot.  From Avenue du Parc eh?  It feels like -20 just looking at that picture.  Good Luck! 8', '2003-01-20 21:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(196524, 11285, 1647, '<td valign="top">Well the message of this photo is obvious enough - as indicated by your title!  The only thing I''m not that keen on is the border - it''s quite harsh compared to the rest of the image which is soft.  I think it would be a stronger image without the border, or perhaps a subtle dark border.  Your framing of the sign is good.</td>', 'Well the message of this photo is obvious enough - as indicated by your title!  The only thing I''m not that keen on is the border - it''s quite harsh compared to the rest of the image which is soft.  I think it would be a stronger image without the border, or perhaps a subtle dark border.  Your framing of the sign is good.', '2003-01-20 21:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(196526, 11308, 5753, '<td valign="top">Nice angle. My head spinning staring at it. 9</td>', 'Nice angle. My head spinning staring at it. 9', '2003-01-20 21:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(196529, 11049, 1647, '<td valign="top">That fog machine must have cost a fortune to create this shot...  IE:  I love the fog.  It has a eerie quality that complements the "dead end" sign lovely.  Black and white is also very effective with this photo.  Well done.</td>', 'That fog machine must have cost a fortune to create this shot...  IE:  I love the fog.  It has a eerie quality that complements the "dead end" sign lovely.  Black and white is also very effective with this photo.  Well done.', '2003-01-20 21:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(196533, 11289, 1647, '<td valign="top">The colours and exposure are near perfect.  I would have liked to see what lay beyond the "dead end" sign though.</td>', 'The colours and exposure are near perfect.  I would have liked to see what lay beyond the "dead end" sign though.', '2003-01-20 21:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(196535, 11145, 1647, '<td valign="top">It''s a very nice photo although the window steals the show, so to speak.</td>', 'It''s a very nice photo although the window steals the show, so to speak.', '2003-01-20 21:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(196537, 11129, 5964, '<td valign="top">Cool placement and perspective in this shot. The colors are just extrordinary and the focus is very sharp.! My only suggestion would be to hack just a bit of the sky off, I played with the scroll wheel (acts like a crop tool) and I really like about 3/4 of an inch of sky gone, puts the more attention on the sign and is more appealing to my eyes. 8.</td>', 'Cool placement and perspective in this shot. The colors are just extrordinary and the focus is very sharp.! My only suggestion would be to hack just a bit of the sky off, I played with the scroll wheel (acts like a crop tool) and I really like about 3/4 of an inch of sky gone, puts the more attention on the sign and is more appealing to my eyes. 8.', '2003-01-20 21:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(196540, 11206, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice framing and composition.  The colours are very realistic and I love trees without leaves.</td>', 'Nice framing and composition.  The colours are very realistic and I love trees without leaves.', '2003-01-20 21:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(196548, 11181, 1647, '<td valign="top">Composition is very good and colour is vibrant.  The lighting looks a little bit harsh though - was it done with a flash perhaps?</td>', 'Composition is very good and colour is vibrant.  The lighting looks a little bit harsh though - was it done with a flash perhaps?', '2003-01-20 21:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(196553, 11094, 2058, '<td valign="top">This image could be larger, but I like the use of B&amp;W, and the composition.  Very lonely feeling.  7</td>', 'This image could be larger, but I like the use of B&W, and the composition.  Very lonely feeling.  7', '2003-01-20 21:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(196554, 11114, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice photo = the sign is framed by the tree very well, plus the outback location is obvious.</td>', 'Nice photo = the sign is framed by the tree very well, plus the outback location is obvious.', '2003-01-20 21:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(196559, 11332, 5964, '<td valign="top">Pavement, I see no stinking pavement. j/k Very cool shot I just love the fog. It kinda makes the shot a bit blurred. The placement of the sign in relation to the mountain and horizon is great. I may have improved the lighting somehow. The sign seems to be a tad too dark. I am not sure now that it is just the fog that blurred everything, the sign seems a touch fuzzy too. Overall great shot.8.</td>', 'Pavement, I see no stinking pavement. j/k Very cool shot I just love the fog. It kinda makes the shot a bit blurred. The placement of the sign in relation to the mountain and horizon is great. I may have improved the lighting somehow. The sign seems to be a tad too dark. I am not sure now that it is just the fog that blurred everything, the sign seems a touch fuzzy too. Overall great shot.8.', '2003-01-20 21:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(196562, 11244, 5131, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Did you plow it over for the shot? 8</td>', 'Nice shot. Did you plow it over for the shot? 8', '2003-01-20 22:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(196563, 11120, 5131, '<td valign="top">Huh?</td>', 'Huh?', '2003-01-20 22:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(196570, 11048, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective on the sign - it helps show the "inclement weather" in the area.  Was the photo really more effective in black and white than colour?  I guess it adds to the coldness aspect somewhat.  Focus is very good and the image is quite easy to look at.</td>', 'Nice perspective on the sign - it helps show the "inclement weather" in the area.  Was the photo really more effective in black and white than colour?  I guess it adds to the coldness aspect somewhat.  Focus is very good and the image is quite easy to look at.', '2003-01-20 22:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(196573, 11308, 689, '<td valign="top">Perspective is nice on this one ... like the way you picked up the reflections in the sign ... great exposure.</td>', 'Perspective is nice on this one ... like the way you picked up the reflections in the sign ... great exposure.', '2003-01-20 22:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(196575, 11049, 689, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the lot ... and choice of B&amp;W made this one go from an 8 to a 10. Great job.</td>', 'My favorite of the lot ... and choice of B&W made this one go from an 8 to a 10. Great job.', '2003-01-20 22:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(196576, 11324, 689, '<td valign="top">Slightly overexposed(note the white on the ship) and seems slightly blurry. I can''t tell if it is motion, focus or just camera limitations, but the colors are nice ... especially the blues.</td>', 'Slightly overexposed(note the white on the ship) and seems slightly blurry. I can''t tell if it is motion, focus or just camera limitations, but the colors are nice ... especially the blues.', '2003-01-20 22:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(196577, 11193, 5131, '<td valign="top">My first 10!</td>', 'My first 10!', '2003-01-20 22:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(196578, 11086, 689, '<td valign="top">Might have been more meaningful if you could have seen people waiting ... or the bus off in the distance.</td>', 'Might have been more meaningful if you could have seen people waiting ... or the bus off in the distance.', '2003-01-20 22:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(196583, 11095, 689, '<td valign="top">Good idea ... not looking for the ''perfect'' sign.</td>', 'Good idea ... not looking for the ''perfect'' sign.', '2003-01-20 22:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(196586, 11251, 689, '<td valign="top">Nice double rainbow!!</td>', 'Nice double rainbow!!', '2003-01-20 22:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(196587, 11182, 689, '<td valign="top">Nice use of B&amp;W with the modern and antique looks combined.</td>', 'Nice use of B&W with the modern and antique looks combined.', '2003-01-20 22:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(196588, 11262, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  The whiteness of the cross, and redness of the flowers, in an otherwise muted background is very effective - they certainly draw your attention.  Exposure and focus are also good - not quite brilliant, but certainly good enough.  And your title - well, yes it is international.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice composition.  The whiteness of the cross, and redness of the flowers, in an otherwise muted background is very effective - they certainly draw your attention.  Exposure and focus are also good - not quite brilliant, but certainly good enough.  And your title - well, yes it is international.  Well done.', '2003-01-20 22:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(196590, 11199, 689, '<td valign="top">Next time find some ducks to cross at the cow crossing ... show a scandle.</td>', 'Next time find some ducks to cross at the cow crossing ... show a scandle.', '2003-01-20 22:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(196594, 11092, 689, '<td valign="top">Nice framing including the road in the photo.</td>', 'Nice framing including the road in the photo.', '2003-01-20 22:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(196595, 11063, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  I''m curious as to why you chose such a bright border around a fairly dark image.  The focus is very crisp, which makes the writing easy to read and the balance of the signs is good.</td>', 'Nice composition.  I''m curious as to why you chose such a bright border around a fairly dark image.  The focus is very crisp, which makes the writing easy to read and the balance of the signs is good.', '2003-01-20 22:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(196597, 11149, 689, '<td valign="top">Where is the road sign?</td>', 'Where is the road sign?', '2003-01-20 22:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(196598, 11122, 689, '<td valign="top">Interesting take ... I like it ... it is different.</td>', 'Interesting take ... I like it ... it is different.', '2003-01-20 22:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(196599, 11226, 1647, '<td valign="top">I like the shallow depth of field - it brings attention to the sign.  I think you may have cropped it a little too tightly though, especially at the top.  With the shallow depth of field I would have tried to include a bit more background - it wouldn''t have distracted the viewer much.  Also, since you chose a new sign (still wrapped up) I was expecting something in the title to reflect that fact, like "brand new lollipop" or "coming to a street near you soon".  The focus and exposure win good points though.</td>', 'I like the shallow depth of field - it brings attention to the sign.  I think you may have cropped it a little too tightly though, especially at the top.  With the shallow depth of field I would have tried to include a bit more background - it wouldn''t have distracted the viewer much.  Also, since you chose a new sign (still wrapped up) I was expecting something in the title to reflect that fact, like "brand new lollipop" or "coming to a street near you soon".  The focus and exposure win good points though.', '2003-01-20 22:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(196602, 11221, 1647, '<td valign="top">That''s a very aggressive crop, but it works fairly well.  The biggest distraction I have is the yellow line running slightly diagonally down the sign.  I susect it might be glare of some sort, although the shadow on the nail indicates the sun is hard right.  Focus is good, as is the title - well done.</td>', 'That''s a very aggressive crop, but it works fairly well.  The biggest distraction I have is the yellow line running slightly diagonally down the sign.  I susect it might be glare of some sort, although the shadow on the nail indicates the sun is hard right.  Focus is good, as is the title - well done.', '2003-01-20 22:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(196604, 11331, 1647, '<td valign="top">The glasses are a lovely touch - good idea.  The exposure and focus are really quite good.  Well done.</td>', 'The glasses are a lovely touch - good idea.  The exposure and focus are really quite good.  Well done.', '2003-01-20 22:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(196605, 11108, 6011, '<td valign="top">Should have been taken in daylight.</td>', 'Should have been taken in daylight.', '2003-01-20 22:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(196606, 11252, 1647, '<td valign="top">I like the photo, but it''s slightly distracting that the bottom edge of the sign is cropped out.  In fact, I think you could have probably included at least half of the mand and really brought him into the photo.  His facial expression is quite good, as are exposure, colour and focus.</td>', 'I like the photo, but it''s slightly distracting that the bottom edge of the sign is cropped out.  In fact, I think you could have probably included at least half of the mand and really brought him into the photo.  His facial expression is quite good, as are exposure, colour and focus.', '2003-01-20 22:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(196608, 11304, 6011, '<td valign="top">Too close!</td>', 'Too close!', '2003-01-20 22:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(196609, 11260, 1647, '<td valign="top">Ok, this is one of very few photos where the border really adds to the photo - well done.  I''m glad you chose a thin yellow line and didn''t over do it.  The floating effect is also quite nice - it''s a simple elegant photo.  Framing is also nicely balanced.</td>', 'Ok, this is one of very few photos where the border really adds to the photo - well done.  I''m glad you chose a thin yellow line and didn''t over do it.  The floating effect is also quite nice - it''s a simple elegant photo.  Framing is also nicely balanced.', '2003-01-20 22:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(196610, 11271, 689, '<td valign="top">Actually ... seems you cant pass on your way to hell.</td>', 'Actually ... seems you cant pass on your way to hell.', '2003-01-20 22:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(196611, 11182, 5508, '<td valign="top">I realy like this photo. I think it''s a great example of how less is more. It''s simple, clean and gets it''s point accross. I hope it does well. Good Luck.</td>', 'I realy like this photo. I think it''s a great example of how less is more. It''s simple, clean and gets it''s point accross. I hope it does well. Good Luck.', '2003-01-20 22:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(196612, 11201, 1647, '<td valign="top">Very interesting lighting.  Normally I might have thought "poorly lit" but it adds an element of interest to the photo.  The framing is nicely balanced.  Some of the edges look just a little bit harsh - did you sharpen this photo?  Otherwise it''s very nice - and the blue sky background is wonderful.</td>', 'Very interesting lighting.  Normally I might have thought "poorly lit" but it adds an element of interest to the photo.  The framing is nicely balanced.  Some of the edges look just a little bit harsh - did you sharpen this photo?  Otherwise it''s very nice - and the blue sky background is wonderful.', '2003-01-20 22:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(196616, 11342, 5508, '<td valign="top">Usually I give a neg and a pos comment. I can''t find a neg here. Love it, great stuff.</td>', 'Usually I give a neg and a pos comment. I can''t find a neg here. Love it, great stuff.', '2003-01-20 22:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
