(196618, 11291, 5508, '<td valign="top">Very creative. I wish the light was highlighting the sign rather than your fingers. Great choice with black and white.</td>', 'Very creative. I wish the light was highlighting the sign rather than your fingers. Great choice with black and white.', '2003-01-20 22:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
