(196673, 11092, 5964, '<td valign="top">What a good find for a road sign, this one gave me the giggles. Your focus was very good, sharp on the main subject and then goes fuzzy in the background. The road trailing on the left is a nice touch, but I think it is cropped a bit too close. Overall good job.8.</td>', 'What a good find for a road sign, this one gave me the giggles. Your focus was very good, sharp on the main subject and then goes fuzzy in the background. The road trailing on the left is a nice touch, but I think it is cropped a bit too close. Overall good job.8.', '2003-01-20 23:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(196674, 11087, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the tight crop on this, and this is a truly funny sign!</td>', 'I like the tight crop on this, and this is a truly funny sign!', '2003-01-20 23:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(196679, 11232, 5964, '<td valign="top">Cool signs! I liked how crisp the focus was onthe forward signs, but the no horse sign, I would have liked to se a bit more in focus, for the rest I like the blur.  My attention is drawn to the other sign for it also tells part of the story here, that is why I would like to see it a bit crisper. The colors are great, just wished the sky would have cooperated that day and given a deeper blue. 8.</td>', 'Cool signs! I liked how crisp the focus was onthe forward signs, but the no horse sign, I would have liked to se a bit more in focus, for the rest I like the blur.  My attention is drawn to the other sign for it also tells part of the story here, that is why I would like to see it a bit crisper. The colors are great, just wished the sky would have cooperated that day and given a deeper blue. 8.', '2003-01-20 23:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(196680, 11221, 811, '<td valign="top">Ouch!!  I like the close crop of this, and the colors are really attention grabbers.</td>', 'Ouch!!  I like the close crop of this, and the colors are really attention grabbers.', '2003-01-20 23:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(196681, 11249, 6011, '<td valign="top">Great picture!</td>', 'Great picture!', '2003-01-20 23:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(196687, 11172, 5964, '<td valign="top">I gonna find ya...... sorry just couldn''t resist. Very catchy title. I really like how you drew the red color from the shot to the border, but my attention is drawn to that part of the picture first, I don''t know if that was your intention or not. I like the depth both of the signs create (the fire lane does help with this also), and you kept the 2nd sign in focus, I like that.  There is something that bothers me about the colors though, mabey a bit too yellow, can''t totally put my finger on it right now.  Was it a hazy day? There is also red spots all through the trees which doesn''t look natural, you may have over saturated the red a bit too much. I figured you saturated it to get the effect with the fire lane. If you did, that may also be causing the color problem. <br/>    Overall I like the effect with the fire lane, but I feel your colors were a bit off. Thanks for reading my ramblings. 8.</td>', 'I gonna find ya...... sorry just couldn''t resist. Very catchy title. I really like how you drew the red color from the shot to the border, but my attention is drawn to that part of the picture first, I don''t know if that was your intention or not. I like the depth both of the signs create (the fire lane does help with this also), and you kept the 2nd sign in focus, I like that.  There is something that bothers me about the colors though, mabey a bit too yellow, can''t totally put my finger on it right now.  Was it a hazy day? There is also red spots all through the trees which doesn''t look natural, you may have over saturated the red a bit too much. I figured you saturated it to get the effect with the fire lane. If you did, that may also be causing the color problem.     Overall I like the effect with the fire lane, but I feel your colors were a bit off. Thanks for reading my ramblings. 8.', '2003-01-21 00:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(196690, 11207, 3569, '<td valign="top">I would have done it closer to the road , looking down the road to where the deaths may have occurred.</td>', 'I would have done it closer to the road , looking down the road to where the deaths may have occurred.', '2003-01-21 00:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(196692, 11224, 3569, '<td valign="top">The sign is too centered, either on side or the other would have been better.  Great sign though.</td>', 'The sign is too centered, either on side or the other would have been better.  Great sign though.', '2003-01-21 00:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(196694, 11060, 6011, '<td valign="top">eerie</td>', 'eerie', '2003-01-21 00:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(196696, 11343, 3569, '<td valign="top">Cute!!!  I would have shown more road than buildings though..</td>', 'Cute!!!  I would have shown more road than buildings though..', '2003-01-21 00:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(196698, 11324, 3569, '<td valign="top">Very good set-up.  Might have looked more interesting to just end the road off in to water.</td>', 'Very good set-up.  Might have looked more interesting to just end the road off in to water.', '2003-01-21 00:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(196699, 11251, 6011, '<td valign="top">Looks like Ireland...beautiful country with all it''s rainbows.</td>', 'Looks like Ireland...beautiful country with all it''s rainbows.', '2003-01-21 00:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(196701, 11235, 3569, '<td valign="top">Good shot, would have tried to work around powerlines to left.</td>', 'Good shot, would have tried to work around powerlines to left.', '2003-01-21 00:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(196702, 11134, 1647, '<td valign="top">Ok, let me be the hundreth person to question the black circle.  I''m guessing it was taken through a piece of card and the DOF provides the blurred edge.  If so, well done it looks like post processing.  Focus and exposure of the signs is very good.</td>', 'Ok, let me be the hundreth person to question the black circle.  I''m guessing it was taken through a piece of card and the DOF provides the blurred edge.  If so, well done it looks like post processing.  Focus and exposure of the signs is very good.', '2003-01-21 00:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(196703, 11197, 3569, '<td valign="top">It may have been better if the sign were placed in a corner, not centered.  Interesting building though.</td>', 'It may have been better if the sign were placed in a corner, not centered.  Interesting building though.', '2003-01-21 00:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(196704, 11125, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure and focus (very sharp), and colour.  Why is the last L partly cropped?</td>', 'Nice exposure and focus (very sharp), and colour.  Why is the last L partly cropped?', '2003-01-21 00:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(196705, 11223, 3280, '<td valign="top">Great title and good shot too! I like the orientation here.</td>', 'Great title and good shot too! I like the orientation here.', '2003-01-21 00:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(196707, 11094, 3569, '<td valign="top">Nice curve, but the signs don''t do much for to help me figure out the subject.</td>', 'Nice curve, but the signs don''t do much for to help me figure out the subject.', '2003-01-21 00:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(196708, 11185, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice use of selective colouring - there''s just one tiny red light on the leftmost building.  I like the title as well - very smart.  The simple border is nice - just enough to frame the image without taking it over.  Well done.  Any reason why the sign is partially cropped?  Is it just to stop the sign from totally taking over the image?</td>', 'Nice use of selective colouring - there''s just one tiny red light on the leftmost building.  I like the title as well - very smart.  The simple border is nice - just enough to frame the image without taking it over.  Well done.  Any reason why the sign is partially cropped?  Is it just to stop the sign from totally taking over the image?', '2003-01-21 00:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(196711, 11270, 5964, '<td valign="top">Railroad crossing on railroad Ave., Geez they were sure inventive when naming that road. I like the black and white effect, colors would not give the crossing sign as much contrast. Good job with the focus ont he subjects int he fore ground, the background is a bit busy and distracting though, did you try blurring it out at all, or play with the saturation levels? Sometimes you can get rid of annoying wires with a little toying around. 7.</td>', 'Railroad crossing on railroad Ave., Geez they were sure inventive when naming that road. I like the black and white effect, colors would not give the crossing sign as much contrast. Good job with the focus ont he subjects int he fore ground, the background is a bit busy and distracting though, did you try blurring it out at all, or play with the saturation levels? Sometimes you can get rid of annoying wires with a little toying around. 7.', '2003-01-21 00:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(196712, 11120, 1647, '<td valign="top">So, was it damp?  No doubt you are copping the "this isn''t a road sign" type comments.  I like the b&amp;w effect and I like the soft focus.  It''s an aggressive crop but it works ok.</td>', 'So, was it damp?  No doubt you are copping the "this isn''t a road sign" type comments.  I like the b&w effect and I like the soft focus.  It''s an aggressive crop but it works ok.', '2003-01-21 00:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(196713, 11139, 1647, '<td valign="top">It looks like you struggled slightly with depth of field - which is understandable.  It also looks like you took the image very slightly off centre - the bottom bolt is near the centre, but the top one is definitely off.  This isn''t a big deal though - I guess I just like symmetry.</td>', 'It looks like you struggled slightly with depth of field - which is understandable.  It also looks like you took the image very slightly off centre - the bottom bolt is near the centre, but the top one is definitely off.  This isn''t a big deal though - I guess I just like symmetry.', '2003-01-21 00:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(196714, 11199, 1647, '<td valign="top">I find the tilt of the sign (ie: leaning to the right) slightly distracting - I guess I expected it to be upright since it is the focal point of the image.  Also, it''s a little dark, although it looks like the weather was your enemy in this instance.</td>', 'I find the tilt of the sign (ie: leaning to the right) slightly distracting - I guess I expected it to be upright since it is the focal point of the image.  Also, it''s a little dark, although it looks like the weather was your enemy in this instance.', '2003-01-21 00:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(196722, 11215, 4813, '<td valign="top">Not really road signs more like advertisments</td>', 'Not really road signs more like advertisments', '2003-01-21 01:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(196723, 11128, 5964, '<td valign="top">I like the background blurred it would have been to busy otherwise, but the sign seems to be a bit too blurry also. Did you try to sharpen it using PS or PSP? You may want to try a few different angles also. I personally don''t care for things perfectly centered (well every once in a while) usually they are not as appealing to my eyes.  The sign was OK, it is very hard to find any interesting signs around, but then again a different angle may have helped give the sign a bit more pizzazz. 4.</td>', 'I like the background blurred it would have been to busy otherwise, but the sign seems to be a bit too blurry also. Did you try to sharpen it using PS or PSP? You may want to try a few different angles also. I personally don''t care for things perfectly centered (well every once in a while) usually they are not as appealing to my eyes.  The sign was OK, it is very hard to find any interesting signs around, but then again a different angle may have helped give the sign a bit more pizzazz. 4.', '2003-01-21 01:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(196725, 11083, 3839, '<td valign="top">Weird looking cows - and they both have udders!  You live near a very strange place! 6</td>', 'Weird looking cows - and they both have udders!  You live near a very strange place! 6', '2003-01-21 01:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(196726, 11120, 5964, '<td valign="top">I am a little confused as to why this shot is in the road signs competition.</td>', 'I am a little confused as to why this shot is in the road signs competition.', '2003-01-21 01:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(196727, 11059, 5964, '<td valign="top">There we go again trying to ruin my favorite vacation land. Very interesting place to find a road sign,though it makes for a cool shot. The tree makes a perfect pole, much more interesting than a piece of steel. Your framing of the sign was great, really makes the sign stand out. Lighting and focus was also exceptional. The colors are OK I understand it is winter not much color to be found anywhere. 7.</td>', 'There we go again trying to ruin my favorite vacation land. Very interesting place to find a road sign,though it makes for a cool shot. The tree makes a perfect pole, much more interesting than a piece of steel. Your framing of the sign was great, really makes the sign stand out. Lighting and focus was also exceptional. The colors are OK I understand it is winter not much color to be found anywhere. 7.', '2003-01-21 01:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(196728, 11222, 1863, '<td valign="top">Nice and original. I like the composition. 9 -Annida</td>', 'Nice and original. I like the composition. 9 -Annida', '2003-01-21 01:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(196729, 11314, 5561, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites this week.</td>', 'One of my favorites this week.', '2003-01-21 01:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(196730, 11095, 5964, '<td valign="top">My overall impression of this shot is so, so. The sign itself is very interesting and I like the upward angle you used, but I think you oversaturated the red too much. All the tree branches and the telephome post have red in them, the sign looks all pixely because of this also. The shadow on the sign is also a bit distracting. I cant figure if you are trying to make a statement with the over saturation about the red=blood. I guess either way it really didn''t work for me. 3.</td>', 'My overall impression of this shot is so, so. The sign itself is very interesting and I like the upward angle you used, but I think you oversaturated the red too much. All the tree branches and the telephome post have red in them, the sign looks all pixely because of this also. The shadow on the sign is also a bit distracting. I cant figure if you are trying to make a statement with the over saturation about the red=blood. I guess either way it really didn''t work for me. 3.', '2003-01-21 01:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(196732, 11144, 543, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if you did it on purpose but the photo to me appears out of focus. Was that intentional or do you need some advice. It also appears grainy you may need to check your settings. Finally it is small if you reduced the photo do you know that you can have a photo as large as 620?</td>', 'I''m not sure if you did it on purpose but the photo to me appears out of focus. Was that intentional or do you need some advice. It also appears grainy you may need to check your settings. Finally it is small if you reduced the photo do you know that you can have a photo as large as 620?', '2003-01-21 01:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(196736, 11095, 3273, '<td valign="top">Too tightly cropped to the edge of the sign, a couple of the points of the octagon have been cut off.  You may also have had a raindrop land on your lens (there seems to be a strange white spot on the branch in the top right corner).</td>', 'Too tightly cropped to the edge of the sign, a couple of the points of the octagon have been cut off.  You may also have had a raindrop land on your lens (there seems to be a strange white spot on the branch in the top right corner).', '2003-01-21 01:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(196737, 11267, 5964, '<td valign="top">I like the angle you chose for the sign, but with the background, it  lead my eyes right to some ugly and distracting poles and wires. It makes me wonder why you chose this angle and to include the plant and everything else on the background (Sugar plant?). I would like to have seen the whole pole on the left too, the way it is, it is cropped too close.  The sign itself is in good focus, and I like the lighting, not too light or dark. 6.</td>', 'I like the angle you chose for the sign, but with the background, it  lead my eyes right to some ugly and distracting poles and wires. It makes me wonder why you chose this angle and to include the plant and everything else on the background (Sugar plant?). I would like to have seen the whole pole on the left too, the way it is, it is cropped too close.  The sign itself is in good focus, and I like the lighting, not too light or dark. 6.', '2003-01-21 02:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(196743, 11215, 5964, '<td valign="top">I am not too sure if I would have gone with framing htre shots in center, especially with your title, it would have been nice to get the signs and also catch a  glimpse of the store itself. I probably would have tried to use the rule of thirds and used the pole to create the left quadrant.  That would have also reduced the distracting street/poles on the left currently. The focus is also a bit off on the signs also. This shot does have potential, I just personally would have liked it executed a bitdifferent.3.</td>', 'I am not too sure if I would have gone with framing htre shots in center, especially with your title, it would have been nice to get the signs and also catch a  glimpse of the store itself. I probably would have tried to use the rule of thirds and used the pole to create the left quadrant.  That would have also reduced the distracting street/poles on the left currently. The focus is also a bit off on the signs also. This shot does have potential, I just personally would have liked it executed a bitdifferent.3.', '2003-01-21 02:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(196744, 11315, 4813, '<td valign="top">off topic that is a peace sign not a road sign</td>', 'off topic that is a peace sign not a road sign', '2003-01-21 02:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(196745, 11304, 3273, '<td valign="top">This would have been so much better if the angles were even.  For example the areas of sky in the bottom corners should be the same shape and size and the top diagonals should both go to the top corners of the frame.</td>', 'This would have been so much better if the angles were even.  For example the areas of sky in the bottom corners should be the same shape and size and the top diagonals should both go to the top corners of the frame.', '2003-01-21 02:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(196746, 11223, 4813, '<td valign="top">off topic</td>', 'off topic', '2003-01-21 02:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(196748, 11138, 3273, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but in my opinion there''s too much earth in the foreground, it would have been better either to crop it completely or have the sky as the extra space.</td>', 'Nice shot but in my opinion there''s too much earth in the foreground, it would have been better either to crop it completely or have the sky as the extra space.', '2003-01-21 02:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
