(197102, 11145, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good title!  The dead vines remind me of those pole christmas trees some people make, using just a pole and strings of lights.  The window in the background addes to the desolation.   Nice find!  It''s a nit that you''ve probably heard before, but the free hanging branches on the right needed to be cropped (IMO), but not enough to change my score.  To me, this is falling somewhere in the 7 to 8 range, I started it as a 7, but it''s growing on me.  Let''s go 8!  Swash</td>', 'Good title!  The dead vines remind me of those pole christmas trees some people make, using just a pole and strings of lights.  The window in the background addes to the desolation.   Nice find!  It''s a nit that you''ve probably heard before, but the free hanging branches on the right needed to be cropped (IMO), but not enough to change my score.  To me, this is falling somewhere in the 7 to 8 range, I started it as a 7, but it''s growing on me.  Let''s go 8!  Swash', '2003-01-21 16:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(197103, 11203, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice angle, very clear shot.  The wear on the sign did make me wonder a bit about the photo quality, but it''s the sign....IMO, too close.  I want to see at least the whole pattern, if not the whole sign (looks like a wonderful blue background behind the sign, was there something we''re not seeing that was really bad?)  I can''t decide if that''s glare on the sign (esp. the staff and foot bindings) or if that''s wear on the sign.  (let''s call it wear, O.K?)  7 Swash</td>', 'Nice angle, very clear shot.  The wear on the sign did make me wonder a bit about the photo quality, but it''s the sign....IMO, too close.  I want to see at least the whole pattern, if not the whole sign (looks like a wonderful blue background behind the sign, was there something we''re not seeing that was really bad?)  I can''t decide if that''s glare on the sign (esp. the staff and foot bindings) or if that''s wear on the sign.  (let''s call it wear, O.K?)  7 Swash', '2003-01-21 16:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(197105, 11085, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice humor (title), but isn''t the "thing" some sort of weather station, not really a sign?  (I see a sign further on, so you''re O.K.) Good color, focus, framing.  Unfortunate background in a way (except for the sign), it''s busy with all the light poles and traffic.  6 Swash</td>', 'Nice humor (title), but isn''t the "thing" some sort of weather station, not really a sign?  (I see a sign further on, so you''re O.K.) Good color, focus, framing.  Unfortunate background in a way (except for the sign), it''s busy with all the light poles and traffic.  6 Swash', '2003-01-21 16:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(197106, 11272, 1005, '<td valign="top">Well taken shot.  Was the lighting that orange/red?  Very clear night shot, how many second exposure?  I tried a "hand crop" on my screen, suggestion:  take off the bottom (about 1/2 way up the sign''s posts) and the light on the left edge.   It might help.  I like the trees.  6 Swash</td>', 'Well taken shot.  Was the lighting that orange/red?  Very clear night shot, how many second exposure?  I tried a "hand crop" on my screen, suggestion:  take off the bottom (about 1/2 way up the sign''s posts) and the light on the left edge.   It might help.  I like the trees.  6 Swash', '2003-01-21 16:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(197107, 11346, 1005, '<td valign="top">Pretty sky, good focus and color.  I think I would have liked to see the curve, too.  Dirty sign!  (no score effect, just a commentary)  7 Swash</td>', 'Pretty sky, good focus and color.  I think I would have liked to see the curve, too.  Dirty sign!  (no score effect, just a commentary)  7 Swash', '2003-01-21 16:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
