(197134, 11174, 4967, '<td valign="top">Are you sure this isn''t the drinking limit?  hehehe... interesting effect you have here, it would be interesting to see how you did it.  I didn''t know any place had a speed limit of 21, but thats a little too slow for me :-)  Oh well... hopefully I won''t come across that road anytime soon... You did a very nice job of having the sign not too bright as well as the moon, nice job of using exposure... also I like your composition, the moon in the upper right hand corner is a nice touch.  Good job, and good luck!</td>', 'Are you sure this isn''t the drinking limit?  hehehe... interesting effect you have here, it would be interesting to see how you did it.  I didn''t know any place had a speed limit of 21, but thats a little too slow for me :-)  Oh well... hopefully I won''t come across that road anytime soon... You did a very nice job of having the sign not too bright as well as the moon, nice job of using exposure... also I like your composition, the moon in the upper right hand corner is a nice touch.  Good job, and good luck!', '2003-01-21 16:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(197135, 11136, 4967, '<td valign="top">Nice catch... I maybe would have tried cropping off a little more at the top, and maybe some on the left but that is just personal oppinion.  I like the bend in the sign, I think it adds character.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice catch... I maybe would have tried cropping off a little more at the top, and maybe some on the left but that is just personal oppinion.  I like the bend in the sign, I think it adds character.  Good luck.', '2003-01-21 16:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(197137, 11289, 4967, '<td valign="top">Nice angle here, I like the clean background, and the way you didn''t shoot straight on.  Very nice use of blank space as well.  I really like this picture, because of the clean look to it.  Even though it''s not extremely exciting I really think this is a great photo.  My first -10-  Nice job, and good luck!</td>', 'Nice angle here, I like the clean background, and the way you didn''t shoot straight on.  Very nice use of blank space as well.  I really like this picture, because of the clean look to it.  Even though it''s not extremely exciting I really think this is a great photo.  My first -10-  Nice job, and good luck!', '2003-01-21 17:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(197138, 11280, 4967, '<td valign="top">I think this picture would have been positively awesome if you had used a different DOF, putting your aperture at highest it would go, would have allowed the sign to be in focus as well as the background.  The colors here are great, as are you use of composition.  The sign being out of focus is just really bothersome though.  Nice creative use of the challenge.  -8- good luck!</td>', 'I think this picture would have been positively awesome if you had used a different DOF, putting your aperture at highest it would go, would have allowed the sign to be in focus as well as the background.  The colors here are great, as are you use of composition.  The sign being out of focus is just really bothersome though.  Nice creative use of the challenge.  -8- good luck!', '2003-01-21 17:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(197139, 11060, 4967, '<td valign="top">zooming while taking the photo?  I did a photo similar to this for action, it was of a gravestone.... this is very well done, I love the glimpses of trees behind this, and it looks like the stop sign is glowing.  Very nicely done... only thing I might say, is I would have tried to make the sign straight... it looks tilted... otherwise great job.  Good luck!</td>', 'zooming while taking the photo?  I did a photo similar to this for action, it was of a gravestone.... this is very well done, I love the glimpses of trees behind this, and it looks like the stop sign is glowing.  Very nicely done... only thing I might say, is I would have tried to make the sign straight... it looks tilted... otherwise great job.  Good luck!', '2003-01-21 17:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(197140, 11108, 4967, '<td valign="top">Wow... excellent catch here!  I would have liked a little more lighting on thee sign, but it''s understandable why you couldn''t get that.  The horizon also isn''t quite level, but that is a minor problem.  Even though there are a couple of problems here, I give you a -9-  great job!  Good luck.</td>', 'Wow... excellent catch here!  I would have liked a little more lighting on thee sign, but it''s understandable why you couldn''t get that.  The horizon also isn''t quite level, but that is a minor problem.  Even though there are a couple of problems here, I give you a -9-  great job!  Good luck.', '2003-01-21 17:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(197145, 11156, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful!  truly a great photo.  I love this picture.. I think it is simple, yet imaginative, and I love the angle you shot it at.  Solid 10.  Good job!  Good luck!</td>', 'This is beautiful!  truly a great photo.  I love this picture.. I think it is simple, yet imaginative, and I love the angle you shot it at.  Solid 10.  Good job!  Good luck!', '2003-01-21 17:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(197147, 11193, 2178, '<td valign="top">Great colors and perspective. One of my faves from this challenge.</td>', 'Great colors and perspective. One of my faves from this challenge.', '2003-01-21 17:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(197148, 11132, 2178, '<td valign="top">Love the toning here, the composition is nice, I can feel the rust :) One of my faves from this challenge.</td>', 'Love the toning here, the composition is nice, I can feel the rust :) One of my faves from this challenge.', '2003-01-21 17:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
