(197152, 11110, 2178, '<td valign="top">Simple and sweet. The sky color is killer. :)</td>', 'Simple and sweet. The sky color is killer. :)', '2003-01-21 17:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(197154, 11176, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wow, neat billboard!  Very good focus, framing, color.  I''m not terribly fond of the brush in the foreground, too much of it.  Too bad the side borders were junked up with that building and the overhead wires, but I''m pretty soft on those sorts of issues (no score change due to it).  The horn I see is a tad over-exposed.  <br/>7 Swash</td>', 'Wow, neat billboard!  Very good focus, framing, color.  I''m not terribly fond of the brush in the foreground, too much of it.  Too bad the side borders were junked up with that building and the overhead wires, but I''m pretty soft on those sorts of issues (no score change due to it).  The horn I see is a tad over-exposed.  7 Swash', '2003-01-21 17:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(197155, 11244, 4967, '<td valign="top">I actually think red might have been cooler for this picture then black and white.  I think this would have been an awesome pic, if you had made it color.  It''s really nice as it is, but it lacks pizzaz.  Still a -9- though.  Good luck.</td>', 'I actually think red might have been cooler for this picture then black and white.  I think this would have been an awesome pic, if you had made it color.  It''s really nice as it is, but it lacks pizzaz.  Still a -9- though.  Good luck.', '2003-01-21 17:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(197157, 11197, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wow, that is one beautiful, ornate building.  Interesting how there seems to be two architectural styles, one more modern and the other more "ancient".  O.K. I see your sign, but it seems to me to be less the subject and more "incidental" part of the photo.  Very good photography.  7 Swash</td>', 'Wow, that is one beautiful, ornate building.  Interesting how there seems to be two architectural styles, one more modern and the other more "ancient".  O.K. I see your sign, but it seems to me to be less the subject and more "incidental" part of the photo.  Very good photography.  7 Swash', '2003-01-21 17:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(197158, 11235, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very well taken shot!  Great color, focus, slightly odd framing.  Suggestion: crop the white building out entirely, maybe rotate the photo 5 degrees counterclockwise, (I think that''s legal!)  7 Swash</td>', 'Very well taken shot!  Great color, focus, slightly odd framing.  Suggestion: crop the white building out entirely, maybe rotate the photo 5 degrees counterclockwise, (I think that''s legal!)  7 Swash', '2003-01-21 17:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(197159, 11340, 2170, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  Nice and grainy.</td>', 'Excellent.  Nice and grainy.', '2003-01-21 17:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(197162, 11330, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute title!  I like the inclusion of the cars, definately adds.  I know they are moving, a faster exposure might have made them more solidly in the shot.  Sorry about the poles and wires, I know it couldn''t be helped, but sure doesn''t add to the shot.  Very strong focus on the sign, very nice.  7 Swash</td>', 'Cute title!  I like the inclusion of the cars, definately adds.  I know they are moving, a faster exposure might have made them more solidly in the shot.  Sorry about the poles and wires, I know it couldn''t be helped, but sure doesn''t add to the shot.  Very strong focus on the sign, very nice.  7 Swash', '2003-01-21 17:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
