(197359, 11108, 1796, '<td valign="top">nice shot. with a slow-sync flash, this might really have popped  -  I''m assuming that the sign is reflective. don''t know if you tried it and if so, how it came out, but it sure would be interesting to try.</td>', 'nice shot. with a slow-sync flash, this might really have popped  -  I''m assuming that the sign is reflective. don''t know if you tried it and if so, how it came out, but it sure would be interesting to try.', '2003-01-21 22:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
