(197371, 11258, 5212, '<td valign="top">Very colorful shot and meets the ch allenge well.  KNow this was a difficult shot to make with all the movement on the streets, and yet it;s fairly clear.   The blue small areas bother me a bit, but again a nice shot in a difficult situation.</td>', 'Very colorful shot and meets the ch allenge well.  KNow this was a difficult shot to make with all the movement on the streets, and yet it;s fairly clear.   The blue small areas bother me a bit, but again a nice shot in a difficult situation.', '2003-01-21 22:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
