(197427, 11203, 5212, '<td valign="top">Great capture, cropping!  If I was nit picking, I would try to eliminate the black area at the upper left right above the sign.</td>', 'Great capture, cropping!  If I was nit picking, I would try to eliminate the black area at the upper left right above the sign.', '2003-01-21 23:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(197428, 11149, 1647, '<td valign="top">Ok, I''m probably not the first but there is no sign to be seen.  Although your title does make a good substitute road sign.  Composition of your photo is good and the shadows in foreground and distance help bring the tents into attention.  Unfortunately it struggles to meet the challenge.</td>', 'Ok, I''m probably not the first but there is no sign to be seen.  Although your title does make a good substitute road sign.  Composition of your photo is good and the shadows in foreground and distance help bring the tents into attention.  Unfortunately it struggles to meet the challenge.', '2003-01-21 23:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(197429, 11217, 5212, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, looks like it needed  a slight rotation to the left to get the ocean line level.</td>', 'Nice composition, looks like it needed  a slight rotation to the left to get the ocean line level.', '2003-01-21 23:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(197430, 11220, 811, '<td valign="top">Here in my area, we would say that "shot gun holler."  A neat sign, but it seems that the focus is a bit off, and I am seeing some noise in the sky.  You might want to try NEATIMAGE (free download is available) if you have not.  It does wonders on pictures.</td>', 'Here in my area, we would say that "shot gun holler."  A neat sign, but it seems that the focus is a bit off, and I am seeing some noise in the sky.  You might want to try NEATIMAGE (free download is available) if you have not.  It does wonders on pictures.', '2003-01-21 23:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(197431, 11085, 6202, '<td valign="top">Only thing missing is Dr Smith.  Cool photo</td>', 'Only thing missing is Dr Smith.  Cool photo', '2003-01-21 23:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(197432, 11094, 1647, '<td valign="top">It''s a lovely b&amp;w, with lots of atmosphere, but the road really steals attention from the sign.  Framing is interesting - lot''s of sky, but it helps create the mood for the photo.  I just wish the sign played a more significant role in this photo.</td>', 'It''s a lovely b&w, with lots of atmosphere, but the road really steals attention from the sign.  Framing is interesting - lot''s of sky, but it helps create the mood for the photo.  I just wish the sign played a more significant role in this photo.', '2003-01-21 23:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(197433, 11343, 5212, '<td valign="top">I might have croppe out the trees and sky in the background that looks overexposed and rotated the image to the right, as everything is tilted.</td>', 'I might have croppe out the trees and sky in the background that looks overexposed and rotated the image to the right, as everything is tilted.', '2003-01-21 23:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(197434, 11292, 1647, '<td valign="top">Great focus, exposure and colours.  The framing of the road and bridge also works really well.</td>', 'Great focus, exposure and colours.  The framing of the road and bridge also works really well.', '2003-01-21 23:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(197435, 11214, 6202, '<td valign="top">I was thinking of doing something similar, but my little boy wouldn''t share his matchbox signs.  Looks good<br/></td>', 'I was thinking of doing something similar, but my little boy wouldn''t share his matchbox signs.  Looks good', '2003-01-21 23:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(197436, 11142, 5212, '<td valign="top">I would have really liked this without the graffiti.  Angle of shot and composition are nice.</td>', 'I would have really liked this without the graffiti.  Angle of shot and composition are nice.', '2003-01-21 23:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(197437, 11179, 1647, '<td valign="top">The lighting on the tree is interesting.  Did you use a flashlight perhaps to light the sign?  Great clarity on the sign.  I''m not sure from your title whether "Jerry and Gonsalves" is something I should recognise, or just a corner you chose randomly (perhaps where you live).</td>', 'The lighting on the tree is interesting.  Did you use a flashlight perhaps to light the sign?  Great clarity on the sign.  I''m not sure from your title whether "Jerry and Gonsalves" is something I should recognise, or just a corner you chose randomly (perhaps where you live).', '2003-01-21 23:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(197438, 11193, 1647, '<td valign="top">Wow - that''s certainly an interesting place to find a STOP sign.  Your colouring and focus is brilliant - so much detail.  The sign is also "crispy clear".  My only (possibly) negative comment would be the alignment of the left edge of the rock and stop sign - perhaps more or less overlap between the two would be better?</td>', 'Wow - that''s certainly an interesting place to find a STOP sign.  Your colouring and focus is brilliant - so much detail.  The sign is also "crispy clear".  My only (possibly) negative comment would be the alignment of the left edge of the rock and stop sign - perhaps more or less overlap between the two would be better?', '2003-01-21 23:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(197439, 11330, 5212, '<td valign="top">What can I say here!  The lines and tree lead up to the sign.</td>', 'What can I say here!  The lines and tree lead up to the sign.', '2003-01-21 23:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(197440, 11133, 5212, '<td valign="top">I like the way the top sign leads to the blue sign leads to the car in front.  Looks like it could have been a bit more in focus and sharp, but interesting shot anyway.</td>', 'I like the way the top sign leads to the blue sign leads to the car in front.  Looks like it could have been a bit more in focus and sharp, but interesting shot anyway.', '2003-01-21 23:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(197441, 11060, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice work - you have created the effect well.  Your title is also very witty.  One of very few "artistic" signs in this challenge.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice work - you have created the effect well.  Your title is also very witty.  One of very few "artistic" signs in this challenge.  Well done.', '2003-01-21 23:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(197442, 11251, 5212, '<td valign="top">Great shot, a little grain in the sky to be picky.  Love the way the rainbow divides the shades of the sky and the road arrows kind of lead your eye to the end of the road that''s visible.</td>', 'Great shot, a little grain in the sky to be picky.  Love the way the rainbow divides the shades of the sky and the road arrows kind of lead your eye to the end of the road that''s visible.', '2003-01-21 23:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(197443, 11078, 1647, '<td valign="top">Effectively removing the background really brings attention to the sign.  To me it feels that cropping part of the callbox was a bad move - could you perhaps have taken the photo from lower down to include all of it?  Other than that the focus is pretty good.  The border is also nice and simple.</td>', 'Effectively removing the background really brings attention to the sign.  To me it feels that cropping part of the callbox was a bad move - could you perhaps have taken the photo from lower down to include all of it?  Other than that the focus is pretty good.  The border is also nice and simple.', '2003-01-21 23:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(197444, 11138, 5212, '<td valign="top">Can''t reaaly tell.  Might have cropped out some of the dirt at the bottom.  I think a little bit of it showing would add the depth you wanted, imho</td>', 'Can''t reaaly tell.  Might have cropped out some of the dirt at the bottom.  I think a little bit of it showing would add the depth you wanted, imho', '2003-01-21 23:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
