(197501, 11251, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great rainbow.  Love the 2 toned sky.  the grass is great color.  The cars and stuff, well I guess we''ll have to settle for it :)  This is a great capture.  Looks like you pulled over to get it too.  Always handy to keep a camera around.  Good Luck - Inspzil</td>', 'Great rainbow.  Love the 2 toned sky.  the grass is great color.  The cars and stuff, well I guess we''ll have to settle for it :)  This is a great capture.  Looks like you pulled over to get it too.  Always handy to keep a camera around.  Good Luck - Inspzil', '2003-01-22 05:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(197502, 11283, 3540, '<td valign="top">Very nice clear pic.  Good DOF.  Why B&amp;W?  - Inspzil</td>', 'Very nice clear pic.  Good DOF.  Why B&W?  - Inspzil', '2003-01-22 05:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(197504, 11070, 1863, '<td valign="top">Very creative :) I like the composition! -Annida</td>', 'Very creative :) I like the composition! -Annida', '2003-01-22 06:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(197505, 11279, 1863, '<td valign="top">This evokes so much sadness in me :( I think that if you had been able to put the camera lower to get a direct photo of the cross on the right.. or maybe just even the plaque on the ground? I''m not sure what I can suggest. Well done though, this is a very emotional photograph. -Annida</td>', 'This evokes so much sadness in me :( I think that if you had been able to put the camera lower to get a direct photo of the cross on the right.. or maybe just even the plaque on the ground? I''m not sure what I can suggest. Well done though, this is a very emotional photograph. -Annida', '2003-01-22 06:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(197506, 11118, 1863, '<td valign="top">The sky and background are SO beautiful, I can''t even begin to describe how beautiful they are. -Annida</td>', 'The sky and background are SO beautiful, I can''t even begin to describe how beautiful they are. -Annida', '2003-01-22 06:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(197508, 11259, 1863, '<td valign="top">Very creative, and something I only saw while I was in Europe! I like this beacuse of its creativity. The colours are bleeding a bit though.. hmm.. I just love how different this is though! 9! -Annida</td>', 'Very creative, and something I only saw while I was in Europe! I like this beacuse of its creativity. The colours are bleeding a bit though.. hmm.. I just love how different this is though! 9! -Annida', '2003-01-22 06:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(197511, 11303, 1863, '<td valign="top">I like the colour of the sky in this picture :) what I don''t like is the big wire in the middle of the sky, the really dark one.  Everything is a bit fuzzy too.. I think that was probably intentional though :) good work! -Annida</td>', 'I like the colour of the sky in this picture :) what I don''t like is the big wire in the middle of the sky, the really dark one.  Everything is a bit fuzzy too.. I think that was probably intentional though :) good work! -Annida', '2003-01-22 07:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(197512, 11144, 1863, '<td valign="top">This is a nice picture :) I wish it was a bit bigger though so I could actually see what''s happening! -Annida</td>', 'This is a nice picture :) I wish it was a bit bigger though so I could actually see what''s happening! -Annida', '2003-01-22 07:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(197517, 11271, 4927, '<td valign="top">So, I guess hell really does exist after all! Lmao, gave me a good laugh. Everything in the photo looks great, except I think the photo was cropped a little to close. I would have preferred more space above and to the right of the sign.  No big deal though, just a suggestion, good photo overall. Good Luck.</td>', 'So, I guess hell really does exist after all! Lmao, gave me a good laugh. Everything in the photo looks great, except I think the photo was cropped a little to close. I would have preferred more space above and to the right of the sign.  No big deal though, just a suggestion, good photo overall. Good Luck.', '2003-01-22 07:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(197518, 11149, 1863, '<td valign="top">This is a very very beautiful photograph! I\''m trying to find the road sign... is it the structures on the left? Overall, I think this is such an interesting photo. the road leading into the darkness over toward the right of the photo is amazing! And its composition is superb.  After a lot of thought I have decided that this photograph does in fact meet the challenge! It''s so cleverly done :) I can''t believe how I missed it the first two times I looked at it. Sometimes if I don''t "get" a picture I have to look at it over and over. This is so well done, and the picture is superb! I give you a 10!  -Annida</td>', 'This is a very very beautiful photograph! I\''m trying to find the road sign... is it the structures on the left? Overall, I think this is such an interesting photo. the road leading into the darkness over toward the right of the photo is amazing! And its composition is superb.  After a lot of thought I have decided that this photograph does in fact meet the challenge! It''s so cleverly done :) I can''t believe how I missed it the first two times I looked at it. Sometimes if I don''t "get" a picture I have to look at it over and over. This is so well done, and the picture is superb! I give you a 10!  -Annida', '2003-01-22 07:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(197521, 11262, 1863, '<td valign="top">This is a very dramatic photo! It''s taken from a good angle, and the bare trees in the background add to the drama. I think if you had walked back a few steps and placed the cross on the right hand corner of the picture, the road would lead your eyes toward the cross, and make the composition a bit more harmonious. good work! -Annida</td>', 'This is a very dramatic photo! It''s taken from a good angle, and the bare trees in the background add to the drama. I think if you had walked back a few steps and placed the cross on the right hand corner of the picture, the road would lead your eyes toward the cross, and make the composition a bit more harmonious. good work! -Annida', '2003-01-22 07:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(197523, 11149, 4927, '<td valign="top">Ummm....nice photo, but where''s the sign? I''m sure you''ve already got a ton of comments asking that, but it''s a very broad interpretation of the challenge. Perhaps you could have made a sign saying "Village next Left" and stuck it somewhere near the road, would''ve probably worked much better for this challenge topic.</td>', 'Ummm....nice photo, but where''s the sign? I''m sure you''ve already got a ton of comments asking that, but it''s a very broad interpretation of the challenge. Perhaps you could have made a sign saying "Village next Left" and stuck it somewhere near the road, would''ve probably worked much better for this challenge topic.', '2003-01-22 07:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(197524, 11153, 4927, '<td valign="top">Haha, very ironic indeed, clever manipulation of the challenge topic. Excellent use of location and composition. It''s also very refreshing after looking through the myriad of ''regular'' road signs.</td>', 'Haha, very ironic indeed, clever manipulation of the challenge topic. Excellent use of location and composition. It''s also very refreshing after looking through the myriad of ''regular'' road signs.', '2003-01-22 07:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(197525, 11125, 1863, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting photograph. I find that you cropped it a bit too close to the letters though, and that''s a shame, because I think it detracts from it. keep up the good work :) -Annida</td>', 'This is an interesting photograph. I find that you cropped it a bit too close to the letters though, and that''s a shame, because I think it detracts from it. keep up the good work :) -Annida', '2003-01-22 07:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(197526, 11207, 4927, '<td valign="top">Lol, dangerous road. Wow, that''s pretty bad that there''s that many fatalities on the road that they''ve decided to dedicate a sign to it.</td>', 'Lol, dangerous road. Wow, that''s pretty bad that there''s that many fatalities on the road that they''ve decided to dedicate a sign to it.', '2003-01-22 07:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(197529, 11147, 4927, '<td valign="top">This would have been a great photo had it been larger, it seems much to small. I also think that zooming in some to cut out the tree on the left and bring the signs in closer to the viewer would have worked well. The helicopter in the background was a nice touch, it really adds to the atmosphere.</td>', 'This would have been a great photo had it been larger, it seems much to small. I also think that zooming in some to cut out the tree on the left and bring the signs in closer to the viewer would have worked well. The helicopter in the background was a nice touch, it really adds to the atmosphere.', '2003-01-22 07:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(197535, 11164, 4927, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. That Sky "Dive"r building looks like a shack though, I''d be afraid to go skydiving with them.</td>', 'Nice photo. That Sky "Dive"r building looks like a shack though, I''d be afraid to go skydiving with them.', '2003-01-22 07:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(197537, 11193, 4482, '<td valign="top">WOW! My 10 of the week!!Crisp sharp colors. The Stop seems to be floating. Rule of 3rds works well here. Good job!</td>', 'WOW! My 10 of the week!!Crisp sharp colors. The Stop seems to be floating. Rule of 3rds works well here. Good job!', '2003-01-22 07:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(197538, 11318, 4482, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition! My second best photo of the challlenge! I really love the jet in the back ground and your title makes me laugh! Hihihihihihihi! :OP</td>', 'Excellent composition! My second best photo of the challlenge! I really love the jet in the back ground and your title makes me laugh! Hihihihihihihi! :OP', '2003-01-22 07:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(197539, 11060, 4482, '<td valign="top">wOOHOO! Oh , Ireally need to know how you did this! This is one for the " How.d they do this" section. 8 from me!</td>', 'wOOHOO! Oh , Ireally need to know how you did this! This is one for the " How.d they do this" section. 8 from me!', '2003-01-22 08:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(197541, 11308, 4482, '<td valign="top">Thi is a very dynamic shot! The angle is superb and leads me all the way up the light. The only thing that bothers me a bit is the light being over-shadowed. Your sky is great! 8</td>', 'Thi is a very dynamic shot! The angle is superb and leads me all the way up the light. The only thing that bothers me a bit is the light being over-shadowed. Your sky is great! 8', '2003-01-22 08:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(197543, 11054, 4482, '<td valign="top">Very cool sign! The sun set is nice but probaly a day shot would''ve accentuated the holes in it. Still an 7 from me!</td>', 'Very cool sign! The sun set is nice but probaly a day shot would''ve accentuated the holes in it. Still an 7 from me!', '2003-01-22 08:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(197544, 11291, 4482, '<td valign="top">Probably the most original shot of the week. :o)<br/>A little over-ex on the fingers. I would''ve shone the light more on the sign... my eyes keep going back to your knuckles. Still an 8 from me  :)</td>', 'Probably the most original shot of the week. :o)A little over-ex on the fingers. I would''ve shone the light more on the sign... my eyes keep going back to your knuckles. Still an 8 from me  :)', '2003-01-22 08:10:37.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(197546, 11049, 4482, '<td valign="top">Wow! The use of B&amp;W is perfect for this shot! Reminds me of an old B&amp;W horor movie! I love teh dark atmosphere of the whole shot. The sign blends in but youre still drawn towards it. The mist ads to the mistery. After careful consideration.... from an 8 to a 9! Good job!!</td>', 'Wow! The use of B&W is perfect for this shot! Reminds me of an old B&W horor movie! I love teh dark atmosphere of the whole shot. The sign blends in but youre still drawn towards it. The mist ads to the mistery. After careful consideration.... from an 8 to a 9! Good job!!', '2003-01-22 08:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(197547, 11061, 5964, '<td valign="top">The first thing that hit me in this shot is what awesome clors, the green is just so vivid.I like how you kept the first two signs, which are the most notable in excellent focus. I also really liked how the road comes in then curves off out of the shot. I think you could have cropped it up to about the bottom of the two track, the weeds do nothing for the shot unless you just reallly wanted the bottle included, but in my opinion, you really don''tneed it. 8.</td>', 'The first thing that hit me in this shot is what awesome clors, the green is just so vivid.I like how you kept the first two signs, which are the most notable in excellent focus. I also really liked how the road comes in then curves off out of the shot. I think you could have cropped it up to about the bottom of the two track, the weeds do nothing for the shot unless you just reallly wanted the bottle included, but in my opinion, you really don''tneed it. 8.', '2003-01-22 08:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(197548, 11325, 4482, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot. The high contrast  between the dark sky and the flash hitting the sign talks to me. It makes the photo that much more dramatic. 8</td>', 'I like this shot a lot. The high contrast  between the dark sky and the flash hitting the sign talks to me. It makes the photo that much more dramatic. 8', '2003-01-22 08:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(197549, 11129, 4482, '<td valign="top">Simple ,classic, crisp, good cropping, clear colors... I like.  8</td>', 'Simple ,classic, crisp, good cropping, clear colors... I like.  8', '2003-01-22 08:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(197550, 11324, 4482, '<td valign="top">Toooooo funny! Humor in photos works well for me. Colors are crisp and good focus. I''m not sure about the boat though. Maybe with a more "frontal" view of only the water and sky??? Good job! 8</td>', 'Toooooo funny! Humor in photos works well for me. Colors are crisp and good focus. I''m not sure about the boat though. Maybe with a more "frontal" view of only the water and sky??? Good job! 8', '2003-01-22 08:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(197557, 11291, 1863, '<td valign="top">This is so clever! I love it! I wish I couldn''t see the tip of your thumb though. Good choice of black and white! Well done, very creative. 9! -Annida</td>', 'This is so clever! I love it! I wish I couldn''t see the tip of your thumb though. Good choice of black and white! Well done, very creative. 9! -Annida', '2003-01-22 08:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(197560, 11083, 1863, '<td valign="top">This is hilariously funny! I love it. The picture is a bit dark though. was that second animal drawn on? hehehe.. funny -Annida</td>', 'This is hilariously funny! I love it. The picture is a bit dark though. was that second animal drawn on? hehehe.. funny -Annida', '2003-01-22 08:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(197562, 11276, 3540, '<td valign="top">The overexposure of the sun is too much.  It''s overpowering the image even if it is the subject (which would sort of make this sign just in the way) - Inspzil</td>', 'The overexposure of the sun is too much.  It''s overpowering the image even if it is the subject (which would sort of make this sign just in the way) - Inspzil', '2003-01-22 08:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(197563, 11165, 6147, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and editing.</td>', 'Very nice composition and editing.', '2003-01-22 08:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(197564, 11318, 6147, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, the blue sky brings out the sign nicely as well.  I''m not sure if the jet is distracting, or to add something that I missed in the concept.</td>', 'Nice idea, the blue sky brings out the sign nicely as well.  I''m not sure if the jet is distracting, or to add something that I missed in the concept.', '2003-01-22 08:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(197565, 11261, 3540, '<td valign="top">This looks awfully cluttered with stuff.  There is a focal point, but I''m not seeing anything here that makes me think of this as anything worthy of hanging on a wall.  Sorry! - Inspzil</td>', 'This looks awfully cluttered with stuff.  There is a focal point, but I''m not seeing anything here that makes me think of this as anything worthy of hanging on a wall.  Sorry! - Inspzil', '2003-01-22 08:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(197566, 11226, 6147, '<td valign="top">Is that a lollipop wrapper? :-)</td>', 'Is that a lollipop wrapper? :-)', '2003-01-22 08:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(197567, 11311, 6147, '<td valign="top">Nice concept and composition.</td>', 'Nice concept and composition.', '2003-01-22 08:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(197568, 11290, 3540, '<td valign="top">Nice night pic.  Good capture.  Too bad that damn sign is in the way! :)  I hope you took some pics of that statue thing in the middle of the circle.  It looks very photoworthy.  Good job - Inspzil</td>', 'Nice night pic.  Good capture.  Too bad that damn sign is in the way! :)  I hope you took some pics of that statue thing in the middle of the circle.  It looks very photoworthy.  Good job - Inspzil', '2003-01-22 08:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(197569, 11174, 3540, '<td valign="top">21?  the little reflection above the sign is unusual.  Like this was taken thru a window.  Moon looks a little blown out.  I don''t think it should be all white, but it may have been necessary to overexpose the moon to properly expose the sign.  (thinking while typing).  Inspzil</td>', '21?  the little reflection above the sign is unusual.  Like this was taken thru a window.  Moon looks a little blown out.  I don''t think it should be all white, but it may have been necessary to overexpose the moon to properly expose the sign.  (thinking while typing).  Inspzil', '2003-01-22 08:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(197570, 11094, 6147, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the medium (black and white).  The low horizon adds to the feeling of desolation.  Maybe a gradiant filter would have decreased the white out in the clouds and allowed for more contrast in the clouds and scenary.</td>', 'Nice use of the medium (black and white).  The low horizon adds to the feeling of desolation.  Maybe a gradiant filter would have decreased the white out in the clouds and allowed for more contrast in the clouds and scenary.', '2003-01-22 08:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(197571, 11132, 6147, '<td valign="top">I really like the textures here.</td>', 'I really like the textures here.', '2003-01-22 08:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(197573, 11083, 3540, '<td valign="top">Hilarious!  A better day would''ve been better.  - Inspzil</td>', 'Hilarious!  A better day would''ve been better.  - Inspzil', '2003-01-22 09:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(197574, 11278, 6147, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and wide DOF.  I would have wanted the Maple Sign a bit lighter - maybe a reflector, or some post production techniques, still overall very nice.</td>', 'Nice composition and wide DOF.  I would have wanted the Maple Sign a bit lighter - maybe a reflector, or some post production techniques, still overall very nice.', '2003-01-22 09:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(197575, 11234, 6147, '<td valign="top">Interesting exposure; long with a flash?</td>', 'Interesting exposure; long with a flash?', '2003-01-22 09:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(197590, 11330, 5728, '<td valign="top">Those cars look like the same model! Was that a coincidence? Nice idea.</td>', 'Those cars look like the same model! Was that a coincidence? Nice idea.', '2003-01-22 10:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(197598, 11167, 4648, '<td valign="top">I LOVE IT.  You get a 10.</td>', 'I LOVE IT.  You get a 10.', '2003-01-22 10:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(197599, 11289, 2123, '<td valign="top">The color is great, very bold and graphic shot.</td>', 'The color is great, very bold and graphic shot.', '2003-01-22 10:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(197600, 11296, 2123, '<td valign="top">This seems blurry to me, and I think a different angle would have been effective, showing the road going off into the distance.  I like the quality of light, though.</td>', 'This seems blurry to me, and I think a different angle would have been effective, showing the road going off into the distance.  I like the quality of light, though.', '2003-01-22 10:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(197601, 11311, 2123, '<td valign="top">Lots of blue sky/sign shots this week, I like the inclusion of clouds and you''ve used an interesting angle.</td>', 'Lots of blue sky/sign shots this week, I like the inclusion of clouds and you''ve used an interesting angle.', '2003-01-22 10:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(197602, 11266, 2123, '<td valign="top">I love roads or paths going off into the distance. :-D  The choice of sepia is nice here, too. 8</td>', 'I love roads or paths going off into the distance. :-D  The choice of sepia is nice here, too. 8', '2003-01-22 10:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(197603, 11222, 2123, '<td valign="top">This is great.  I love the greens and the lichen on the rock, I''m glad you went with color rather than black and white. 8</td>', 'This is great.  I love the greens and the lichen on the rock, I''m glad you went with color rather than black and white. 8', '2003-01-22 10:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
