(197802, 11153, 4536, '<td valign="top">Clever. Some more depth of field would have helped this, IMO, the funeral home sign would be better in focus.</td>', 'Clever. Some more depth of field would have helped this, IMO, the funeral home sign would be better in focus.', '2003-01-22 15:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(197820, 11061, 4536, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and colors. The bottle is a bit distracting, cropping it out would help.</td>', 'Nice composition and colors. The bottle is a bit distracting, cropping it out would help.', '2003-01-22 16:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(197840, 11188, 1647, '<td valign="top">I love the sign, or should I say "OMG, What a funny sign".  Composition is fairly good - it''s a shame you couldn''t get a crane in the background somehow.  Focus is also pretty good.</td>', 'I love the sign, or should I say "OMG, What a funny sign".  Composition is fairly good - it''s a shame you couldn''t get a crane in the background somehow.  Focus is also pretty good.', '2003-01-22 16:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(197849, 11279, 1647, '<td valign="top">The effect of the flowers being so much brighter than the signs is interesting, although it keeps drawing my eyes away from the signs themselves.  I wonder if it would have been possible to use the flash to brighten the signs up or something?  Besides that though, composition and framing is very good and well balanced all around.  Such a tragic loss of young life.</td>', 'The effect of the flowers being so much brighter than the signs is interesting, although it keeps drawing my eyes away from the signs themselves.  I wonder if it would have been possible to use the flash to brighten the signs up or something?  Besides that though, composition and framing is very good and well balanced all around.  Such a tragic loss of young life.', '2003-01-22 16:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(197857, 11278, 1647, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately the tree really steals the show for me - probably because it''s so well lit and the signs (especially Maple) are very dark to read.  I like the composition though - it feels very balanced.  The border feels appropriate and isn''t overdone.  Good job.</td>', 'Unfortunately the tree really steals the show for me - probably because it''s so well lit and the signs (especially Maple) are very dark to read.  I like the composition though - it feels very balanced.  The border feels appropriate and isn''t overdone.  Good job.', '2003-01-22 16:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(197875, 11182, 1647, '<td valign="top">Wow - such a vivid image.  Black and white is a must for this image.  The subtle grey line in the border is great and I love the contrast in this photo.  The only thing I would have tried differently would be to move the sign slightly so that it didn''t overlap the building - although it''s hard for me to image what that would look like - perhaps it would destroy the towering effect.</td>', 'Wow - such a vivid image.  Black and white is a must for this image.  The subtle grey line in the border is great and I love the contrast in this photo.  The only thing I would have tried differently would be to move the sign slightly so that it didn''t overlap the building - although it''s hard for me to image what that would look like - perhaps it would destroy the towering effect.', '2003-01-22 17:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(197893, 11326, 811, '<td valign="top">I love the variety and number of signs you were able to capture here  I also like how the yellow signs jump out of the picture.  As a side note, and not effecting the picture score in any way, I think the red border is a bit much.  Maybe a more subdued color would be better, but that is just me.</td>', 'I love the variety and number of signs you were able to capture here  I also like how the yellow signs jump out of the picture.  As a side note, and not effecting the picture score in any way, I think the red border is a bit much.  Maybe a more subdued color would be better, but that is just me.', '2003-01-22 17:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(197897, 11235, 5340, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors. Very sharp image. Good luck.</td>', 'Beautiful colors. Very sharp image. Good luck.', '2003-01-22 17:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(197899, 11114, 5340, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape. Good pic.</td>', 'Nice landscape. Good pic.', '2003-01-22 17:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(197901, 11318, 5340, '<td valign="top">Nice colors &amp; graphic effect.</td>', 'Nice colors & graphic effect.', '2003-01-22 17:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
