(197949, 11087, 5340, '<td valign="top">Very original!</td>', 'Very original!', '2003-01-22 17:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(197953, 11346, 4411, '<td valign="top">Could have been a great shot. As it is it just missses. The sign is too central, and I would have got lower so that the sign was fully against the sky &amp; seperated from the background. Colours &amp; exposure are great though, good work.</td>', 'Could have been a great shot. As it is it just missses. The sign is too central, and I would have got lower so that the sign was fully against the sky & seperated from the background. Colours & exposure are great though, good work.', '2003-01-22 18:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(197958, 11122, 4411, '<td valign="top">A good abstract idea. I think you should have focused on the sign, as that is supposed to be the main subject, and the moon is so small it''s hard to tell whether it''s in focus or not. Nice idea, needs better implementation.</td>', 'A good abstract idea. I think you should have focused on the sign, as that is supposed to be the main subject, and the moon is so small it''s hard to tell whether it''s in focus or not. Nice idea, needs better implementation.', '2003-01-22 18:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(197959, 11054, 5340, '<td valign="top">Great work. 9</td>', 'Great work. 9', '2003-01-22 18:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(197960, 11083, 4411, '<td valign="top">Where does it say prohibited? Looks like ''Warning: Cows shagging ahead" to me ; )<br/>Composition is good, but the background is very cluttered/distracting. If you had shot from further away, with full zoom and a tight DoF the background should have blurred out nicely.</td>', 'Where does it say prohibited? Looks like ''Warning: Cows shagging ahead" to me ; )Composition is good, but the background is very cluttered/distracting. If you had shot from further away, with full zoom and a tight DoF the background should have blurred out nicely.', '2003-01-22 18:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(197966, 11318, 1792, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice composition.', '2003-01-22 18:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(197972, 11280, 1792, '<td valign="top">Good concept and composition, however, the blur of the sign is distracting.  It may have been done deliberately, but it somehow doesn''t seem to enhance the overall effect for me.</td>', 'Good concept and composition, however, the blur of the sign is distracting.  It may have been done deliberately, but it somehow doesn''t seem to enhance the overall effect for me.', '2003-01-22 18:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(197974, 11059, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  It looks like there is a tiny bit of colour left in the photo - I wonder if it would look good completely black and white (although I don''t mind the touch of colour).  Focus is crisp as well.</td>', 'Nice composition.  It looks like there is a tiny bit of colour left in the photo - I wonder if it would look good completely black and white (although I don''t mind the touch of colour).  Focus is crisp as well.', '2003-01-22 18:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(197975, 11164, 1647, '<td valign="top">Great photo - the sign really grabs my attention because the focus is so crisp and colour so vibrant.  The depth of field also helps control my attention.  Lighting is great and composition is good.  Well done - definitely one of the best this week.</td>', 'Great photo - the sign really grabs my attention because the focus is so crisp and colour so vibrant.  The depth of field also helps control my attention.  Lighting is great and composition is good.  Well done - definitely one of the best this week.', '2003-01-22 18:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(197976, 11346, 1647, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame the sign is a bit dirty - it kind of distracted me.  Beyond that I really like the composition and the colours - the blue sky and green shrubs really make the sign stand out nicely.</td>', 'It''s a shame the sign is a bit dirty - it kind of distracted me.  Beyond that I really like the composition and the colours - the blue sky and green shrubs really make the sign stand out nicely.', '2003-01-22 18:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(197977, 11296, 1647, '<td valign="top">This photo looks a little bit soft / blurry - perhaps it was zoomed or taken with a low res camera.  It looks like rotating the picture slightly might have made the signpost vertical which might have made it slightly more dominant.</td>', 'This photo looks a little bit soft / blurry - perhaps it was zoomed or taken with a low res camera.  It looks like rotating the picture slightly might have made the signpost vertical which might have made it slightly more dominant.', '2003-01-22 18:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(197978, 11219, 5340, '<td valign="top">Good picture!</td>', 'Good picture!', '2003-01-22 19:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(197979, 11078, 5340, '<td valign="top">Good contrast.</td>', 'Good contrast.', '2003-01-22 19:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(197981, 11048, 5340, '<td valign="top">Very good!</td>', 'Very good!', '2003-01-22 19:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(197982, 11146, 1647, '<td valign="top">Great focus and colour.  It looks like the sign has a lot of history to it.  The lighting and depth of field help to ensure that the sign grabs my attention and holds it.  Well done.</td>', 'Great focus and colour.  It looks like the sign has a lot of history to it.  The lighting and depth of field help to ensure that the sign grabs my attention and holds it.  Well done.', '2003-01-22 19:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(197983, 11223, 5340, '<td valign="top">Good capture!</td>', 'Good capture!', '2003-01-22 19:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(197984, 11132, 1647, '<td valign="top">What a brilliant use of colour to make a relatively boring photo very interesting.  It looks like a very shallow depth of field was used to focus the sign whilst blurring the truck every so slightly - very effective for this challenge.  I''ll be very surprised if this isn''t one of the top places when results come out.  Well done.  I don''t think I would have done anything differently in this photo.</td>', 'What a brilliant use of colour to make a relatively boring photo very interesting.  It looks like a very shallow depth of field was used to focus the sign whilst blurring the truck every so slightly - very effective for this challenge.  I''ll be very surprised if this isn''t one of the top places when results come out.  Well done.  I don''t think I would have done anything differently in this photo.', '2003-01-22 19:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(197985, 11116, 5340, '<td valign="top">The ducks are very smart in your country... Good job.</td>', 'The ducks are very smart in your country... Good job.', '2003-01-22 19:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(197986, 11138, 5340, '<td valign="top">Great capture!</td>', 'Great capture!', '2003-01-22 19:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(197987, 11054, 1647, '<td valign="top">This is a very picturesque photo - a lovely sunset, a silohuetted rail car and a stop sign that''s obviously been target practice once or twice.  Colours are great, focus is perfect and composition is wonderful.  Well done - one of the best.</td>', 'This is a very picturesque photo - a lovely sunset, a silohuetted rail car and a stop sign that''s obviously been target practice once or twice.  Colours are great, focus is perfect and composition is wonderful.  Well done - one of the best.', '2003-01-22 19:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(197988, 11197, 6301, '<td valign="top">Where is this builiding??? Wonderful!!!1 thank you for sharing this with us..... unusual sign too</td>', 'Where is this builiding??? Wonderful!!!1 thank you for sharing this with us..... unusual sign too', '2003-01-22 19:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(197989, 11262, 5340, '<td valign="top">R.I.P.</td>', 'R.I.P.', '2003-01-22 19:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(197990, 11318, 4411, '<td valign="top">Nice vivid colours. A shame about the plane, I would have prefered a clear sky. I would also have zoomed out a touch, so that the signs were not so close to the edge of the frame. Otherwise, great shot. I like it.</td>', 'Nice vivid colours. A shame about the plane, I would have prefered a clear sky. I would also have zoomed out a touch, so that the signs were not so close to the edge of the frame. Otherwise, great shot. I like it.', '2003-01-22 19:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(197991, 11280, 5340, '<td valign="top">I like it very much! 9</td>', 'I like it very much! 9', '2003-01-22 19:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(197993, 11261, 5340, '<td valign="top">Good work1</td>', 'Good work1', '2003-01-22 19:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(197994, 11182, 5340, '<td valign="top">Great pic! 9</td>', 'Great pic! 9', '2003-01-22 19:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(197996, 11145, 5340, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot!</td>', 'Beautiful shot!', '2003-01-22 19:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(197998, 11333, 5340, '<td valign="top">Nice pic.</td>', 'Nice pic.', '2003-01-22 19:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(198001, 11304, 5340, '<td valign="top">Great colours and angle.</td>', 'Great colours and angle.', '2003-01-22 19:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(198002, 11343, 5340, '<td valign="top">Ha, ha, ha!</td>', 'Ha, ha, ha!', '2003-01-22 19:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(198003, 11059, 5340, '<td valign="top">Good shot.</td>', 'Good shot.', '2003-01-22 19:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(198004, 11278, 5340, '<td valign="top">Good capture. Nice colours.</td>', 'Good capture. Nice colours.', '2003-01-22 19:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(198005, 11145, 4815, '<td valign="top">This is my absolute fav foto for this week. Ultra superb delicate pastel hues. Really really appreciated muted tones in contrast to the screaming dayglo colors common to this website. The mood is very well felt with the washed out red stop, the growth, the crooked window frames, the snow,etc. I like the nice touch how the window frame leans against the sign. The tight composition accentuates the impact of each visual element. The overcast lighting allows the gentle colors to have full voice. This is indeed a first rate masterpiece that deserves many more positive comments. Please continue with such wonderful inspiring work. A fantastic image. ...9</td>', 'This is my absolute fav foto for this week. Ultra superb delicate pastel hues. Really really appreciated muted tones in contrast to the screaming dayglo colors common to this website. The mood is very well felt with the washed out red stop, the growth, the crooked window frames, the snow,etc. I like the nice touch how the window frame leans against the sign. The tight composition accentuates the impact of each visual element. The overcast lighting allows the gentle colors to have full voice. This is indeed a first rate masterpiece that deserves many more positive comments. Please continue with such wonderful inspiring work. A fantastic image. ...9', '2003-01-22 19:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(198006, 11206, 5340, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.</td>', 'Nice photo.', '2003-01-22 19:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(198009, 11331, 5340, '<td valign="top">Good work!</td>', 'Good work!', '2003-01-22 19:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(198010, 11156, 5340, '<td valign="top">Beautiful...</td>', 'Beautiful...', '2003-01-22 19:30:11.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(198011, 11061, 5340, '<td valign="top">I like the colours and perpective.</td>', 'I like the colours and perpective.', '2003-01-22 19:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(198013, 11300, 5340, '<td valign="top">Great B&amp;W.</td>', 'Great B&W.', '2003-01-22 19:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(198014, 11054, 4815, '<td valign="top">Another first class image in my books. The bullet holes, broody landscape, railcar slihouette all speak together of desolation. The pink clouds and light red sign compliment each other. As do the sign shape and "wheel" . There is not much in the way of texture in this foto. And to me, that permits the visual elements that are present to have more punch in terms of shape. And  variety of shape (with a few color accents)  is what seems to  essentaily pull this whole  picture together. A truly wonderful image easily achieving top ten status this week.</td>', 'Another first class image in my books. The bullet holes, broody landscape, railcar slihouette all speak together of desolation. The pink clouds and light red sign compliment each other. As do the sign shape and "wheel" . There is not much in the way of texture in this foto. And to me, that permits the visual elements that are present to have more punch in terms of shape. And  variety of shape (with a few color accents)  is what seems to  essentaily pull this whole  picture together. A truly wonderful image easily achieving top ten status this week.', '2003-01-22 19:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(198018, 11137, 4813, '<td valign="top">nice photo...good capture of the confetti.  Just courious what is so special about the time 2:18:35</td>', 'nice photo...good capture of the confetti.  Just courious what is so special about the time 2:18:35', '2003-01-22 19:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(198021, 11075, 4813, '<td valign="top">the caption even adds more to the overall package...I like it</td>', 'the caption even adds more to the overall package...I like it', '2003-01-22 19:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(198022, 11049, 4815, '<td valign="top">Man I can almost drown in the mist just looking at this foto. The accent of the foreground leaves melting into moody silhouettes just takes my breath away. I really like the damp feel of the pavement and the touch of delicate branches like spider web strands. The moment you chose for the foto was perfect. I like the grey looming fog instead of blazing white that is commonly seen. Continue with your outstanding vision.</td>', 'Man I can almost drown in the mist just looking at this foto. The accent of the foreground leaves melting into moody silhouettes just takes my breath away. I really like the damp feel of the pavement and the touch of delicate branches like spider web strands. The moment you chose for the foto was perfect. I like the grey looming fog instead of blazing white that is commonly seen. Continue with your outstanding vision.', '2003-01-22 19:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(198024, 11144, 2158, '<td valign="top">It''s really difficult to judge a photo this small.  It''s probably better than it looks.</td>', 'It''s really difficult to judge a photo this small.  It''s probably better than it looks.', '2003-01-22 19:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(198030, 11092, 4411, '<td valign="top">LOL! Great title. Composition is great, I like the way the sign dominates the right hand side and the road runs up the left edge (maybe a bit too close, but it works).</td>', 'LOL! Great title. Composition is great, I like the way the sign dominates the right hand side and the road runs up the left edge (maybe a bit too close, but it works).', '2003-01-22 20:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(198033, 11280, 2158, '<td valign="top">That looks like a really nice view.  It''s a pity the sign is so out of focus.</td>', 'That looks like a really nice view.  It''s a pity the sign is so out of focus.', '2003-01-22 20:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(198034, 11223, 2752, '<td valign="top">Great shot..I especially like the angle taken..very well composed..excellent focus.</td>', 'Great shot..I especially like the angle taken..very well composed..excellent focus.', '2003-01-22 20:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(198035, 11289, 2752, '<td valign="top">very sharp,well taken shot.  Colors are great and well composed.</td>', 'very sharp,well taken shot.  Colors are great and well composed.', '2003-01-22 20:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(198036, 11179, 2752, '<td valign="top">I like your use of flash...very dramatic and the background of trees compliments the street sign very well.</td>', 'I like your use of flash...very dramatic and the background of trees compliments the street sign very well.', '2003-01-22 20:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(198037, 11139, 2752, '<td valign="top">great angle shot of this sign..great focus and composition.</td>', 'great angle shot of this sign..great focus and composition.', '2003-01-22 20:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(198039, 11049, 2752, '<td valign="top">This would make a neat entry to a movie..I like your composition in the fog.  The road takes me in and I want to see what''s at the end of the road.</td>', 'This would make a neat entry to a movie..I like your composition in the fog.  The road takes me in and I want to see what''s at the end of the road.', '2003-01-22 20:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(198040, 11153, 2752, '<td valign="top">What a priceless shot...Composition is good and the colors drab enough to add to the theme.  Only suggestion would be a better job of focusing.</td>', 'What a priceless shot...Composition is good and the colors drab enough to add to the theme.  Only suggestion would be a better job of focusing.', '2003-01-22 20:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(198041, 11060, 2752, '<td valign="top">Great shot...I like the trees reaching skyward and the effect made by timed exposure.</td>', 'Great shot...I like the trees reaching skyward and the effect made by timed exposure.', '2003-01-22 20:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(198043, 11319, 2752, '<td valign="top">Lovely scenery...I wonder if the sign were off to the side of the shot it would be more effective?</td>', 'Lovely scenery...I wonder if the sign were off to the side of the shot it would be more effective?', '2003-01-22 20:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(198044, 11308, 2752, '<td valign="top">great angle shot..composition is good as is the focus.  well done</td>', 'great angle shot..composition is good as is the focus.  well done', '2003-01-22 20:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(198046, 11207, 2752, '<td valign="top">Great shot...hope the message gets through. Composition is good.</td>', 'Great shot...hope the message gets through. Composition is good.', '2003-01-22 20:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(198047, 11145, 2752, '<td valign="top">Great shot...everything looks very neglected..colors add to the theme.</td>', 'Great shot...everything looks very neglected..colors add to the theme.', '2003-01-22 20:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(198055, 11111, 4162, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, very interesting wall behind and great use of title to tell a story. Perhaps colour saturation could be boosted a bit on the sign.</td>', 'This is a great shot, very interesting wall behind and great use of title to tell a story. Perhaps colour saturation could be boosted a bit on the sign.', '2003-01-22 21:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(198058, 11318, 4162, '<td valign="top">Lovely contrast in colour here, a good simple composition</td>', 'Lovely contrast in colour here, a good simple composition', '2003-01-22 21:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(198059, 11218, 4162, '<td valign="top">This is a great street scene and great in B/W. Not sure that the road sign element is strong enough, but I still like it!</td>', 'This is a great street scene and great in B/W. Not sure that the road sign element is strong enough, but I still like it!', '2003-01-22 21:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(198063, 11049, 4162, '<td valign="top">What a great, atmospheric shot this is, with the road sign totally matching the mood of the scene. Good Luck!</td>', 'What a great, atmospheric shot this is, with the road sign totally matching the mood of the scene. Good Luck!', '2003-01-22 21:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(198064, 11324, 4162, '<td valign="top">I love the composition of this, also good use of DOF to emphasise the sign.  Good Luck</td>', 'I love the composition of this, also good use of DOF to emphasise the sign.  Good Luck', '2003-01-22 21:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(198065, 11343, 1664, '<td valign="top">Funny!</td>', 'Funny!', '2003-01-22 21:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(198067, 11197, 4162, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic building, would have done so well in the windows and doors challenge, however is a bit weak on the signs! Still, I love this! Isn''t this the same architect  whose ideas they are thinking of using for the Gound Zero site?</td>', 'What a fantastic building, would have done so well in the windows and doors challenge, however is a bit weak on the signs! Still, I love this! Isn''t this the same architect  whose ideas they are thinking of using for the Gound Zero site?', '2003-01-22 21:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(198068, 11258, 1664, '<td valign="top">The limo is prominent enough to detract from the title.</td>', 'The limo is prominent enough to detract from the title.', '2003-01-22 21:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(198070, 11132, 4162, '<td valign="top">I am not sure how you did this, but I love the effect you have created, really changes a boring scene into something very interesting.  Good Luck!</td>', 'I am not sure how you did this, but I love the effect you have created, really changes a boring scene into something very interesting.  Good Luck!', '2003-01-22 21:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(198071, 11228, 1664, '<td valign="top">Good photo, bad scene.</td>', 'Good photo, bad scene.', '2003-01-22 21:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(198072, 11087, 4162, '<td valign="top">This is so cool! Is it for real, or is it one of those signs you can buy? Nice use of colours for the border, perhaps would have cropped the trees off and concentrated only on the sign.</td>', 'This is so cool! Is it for real, or is it one of those signs you can buy? Nice use of colours for the border, perhaps would have cropped the trees off and concentrated only on the sign.', '2003-01-22 21:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(198073, 11182, 3306, '<td valign="top">Really sharp focus. I like the angle. Nice picture.</td>', 'Really sharp focus. I like the angle. Nice picture.', '2003-01-22 21:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(198074, 11167, 4162, '<td valign="top">Yikes!!! What a find!</td>', 'Yikes!!! What a find!', '2003-01-22 21:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(198075, 11308, 4210, '<td valign="top">Great angle. I love the reflection.</td>', 'Great angle. I love the reflection.', '2003-01-22 21:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(198076, 11326, 4210, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot and I think the title is great too. It is a little cluttered, but it doesn''t have extra "stuff" in it either. Great focus. I might have picked a diferent boarder though. The pink is kinda an odd colour choice.</td>', 'I really like this shot and I think the title is great too. It is a little cluttered, but it doesn''t have extra "stuff" in it either. Great focus. I might have picked a diferent boarder though. The pink is kinda an odd colour choice.', '2003-01-22 21:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(198077, 11063, 4210, '<td valign="top">The sign is interesting, but the photo doesn''t appeal to me. The offcenterness is nice though.</td>', 'The sign is interesting, but the photo doesn''t appeal to me. The offcenterness is nice though.', '2003-01-22 21:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(198078, 11251, 4210, '<td valign="top">A liberal interpretation, but not too bad. This photo feels slightly tilted however.</td>', 'A liberal interpretation, but not too bad. This photo feels slightly tilted however.', '2003-01-22 21:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(198079, 11311, 4210, '<td valign="top">Cute. Good use of negative space and good lighting.</td>', 'Cute. Good use of negative space and good lighting.', '2003-01-22 21:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(198080, 11232, 4210, '<td valign="top">Great colour and composition.</td>', 'Great colour and composition.', '2003-01-22 21:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(198082, 11167, 4210, '<td valign="top">Great composition</td>', 'Great composition', '2003-01-22 21:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(198083, 11315, 4210, '<td valign="top">A good photo, but I don''t feel it properly fits the challenge. This would have been great for the photojournalism challenge though!</td>', 'A good photo, but I don''t feel it properly fits the challenge. This would have been great for the photojournalism challenge though!', '2003-01-22 22:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(198084, 11235, 4210, '<td valign="top">Interesting colour, nice photo</td>', 'Interesting colour, nice photo', '2003-01-22 22:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(198085, 11049, 4210, '<td valign="top">Great choice of black and white.</td>', 'Great choice of black and white.', '2003-01-22 22:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(198086, 11118, 4210, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colours!</td>', 'Wonderful colours!', '2003-01-22 22:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(198088, 11340, 4210, '<td valign="top">Wonderful. I feel this would have done well in a challenge like photojournalism as well!</td>', 'Wonderful. I feel this would have done well in a challenge like photojournalism as well!', '2003-01-22 22:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(198090, 11153, 4210, '<td valign="top">An interesting photo, but it feels like nothing is in focus.</td>', 'An interesting photo, but it feels like nothing is in focus.', '2003-01-22 22:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(198093, 11315, 675, '<td valign="top">not only are you showing a sign where children were used for something they have no idea about, which is wrong, dead wrong, but this isn''t a road sign...it''s just propaganda.  go hug saddam. if there were negative numbers i would give them</td>', 'not only are you showing a sign where children were used for something they have no idea about, which is wrong, dead wrong, but this isn''t a road sign...it''s just propaganda.  go hug saddam. if there were negative numbers i would give them', '2003-01-22 22:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(198094, 11170, 675, '<td valign="top">that''s a cool sign, very modern.  i don''t think your composition reflects what you were trying to do here very well though. it just seems too cluttered</td>', 'that''s a cool sign, very modern.  i don''t think your composition reflects what you were trying to do here very well though. it just seems too cluttered', '2003-01-22 22:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(198095, 11218, 675, '<td valign="top">that''s a pretty good idea. the trees really do hurt your score i think, as good as this picture is technically</td>', 'that''s a pretty good idea. the trees really do hurt your score i think, as good as this picture is technically', '2003-01-22 22:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(198097, 11181, 675, '<td valign="top">cute, interesting take on the challenge</td>', 'cute, interesting take on the challenge', '2003-01-22 22:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(198098, 11279, 675, '<td valign="top">this is very thoughtful and a good way to memorialize a tragedy.  the photo is well composed and technically sound</td>', 'this is very thoughtful and a good way to memorialize a tragedy.  the photo is well composed and technically sound', '2003-01-22 22:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(198099, 11148, 675, '<td valign="top">black and white works well here. the moving taxi can either be good or bad. i can''t decide but i''m leading towards good because i''m thinking you left it in trying to show the hurriedness of taxies in the city. overall, the sharpness leaves a lot to be desired, and there is also a lot of noise. not a bad photo though by any means</td>', 'black and white works well here. the moving taxi can either be good or bad. i can''t decide but i''m leading towards good because i''m thinking you left it in trying to show the hurriedness of taxies in the city. overall, the sharpness leaves a lot to be desired, and there is also a lot of noise. not a bad photo though by any means', '2003-01-22 22:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(198100, 11165, 675, '<td valign="top">i love the color contrast, however the hospital is a little too off level</td>', 'i love the color contrast, however the hospital is a little too off level', '2003-01-22 22:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(198101, 11215, 675, '<td valign="top">what''s that elvis presley song "The Ghetto"? yeah this sort of seems like that song. the sings aren''t in focus enough, but i think your composition makes up for that by showing a little bit more of the surroundings</td>', 'what''s that elvis presley song "The Ghetto"? yeah this sort of seems like that song. the sings aren''t in focus enough, but i think your composition makes up for that by showing a little bit more of the surroundings', '2003-01-22 22:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(198104, 11174, 4210, '<td valign="top">How....odd.<br/>Very nice.</td>', 'How....odd.Very nice.', '2003-01-22 22:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(198105, 11340, 675, '<td valign="top">there is a lot of noise in this picture. i really like the composition though. it is quite telling of the situation and neighborhood at hand. good catch</td>', 'there is a lot of noise in this picture. i really like the composition though. it is quite telling of the situation and neighborhood at hand. good catch', '2003-01-22 22:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(198107, 11058, 675, '<td valign="top">the title hurts the photo, but that obviously isn''t the biggest part of the photo. the sign looks nice. there is the distracting shadow on the bottom of the words, probably from the flash? anyway the photo is very clear and sharp. the motion isn''t the best, but it is good enough</td>', 'the title hurts the photo, but that obviously isn''t the biggest part of the photo. the sign looks nice. there is the distracting shadow on the bottom of the words, probably from the flash? anyway the photo is very clear and sharp. the motion isn''t the best, but it is good enough', '2003-01-22 22:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(198108, 11320, 675, '<td valign="top">i don''t understand what you are trying to portray.  the sign is okay, although it''s not to interesting to me. the focus is spotty at best and is almost distracting</td>', 'i don''t understand what you are trying to portray.  the sign is okay, although it''s not to interesting to me. the focus is spotty at best and is almost distracting', '2003-01-22 22:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(198109, 11245, 4210, '<td valign="top">Nice colour</td>', 'Nice colour', '2003-01-22 22:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
