(198200, 11144, 2123, '<td valign="top">Well, a couple of things going on here.  First, the pic really is too small.  It''s best to use the space that we''re allotted.  Secondly, mailboxes don''t really qualify as road signs, at least to me, and thirdly, the whole thing is a little washed out and the lighting is dim.  Perhaps fiddling with the color in post processing could have given you a bit more punch.</td>', 'Well, a couple of things going on here.  First, the pic really is too small.  It''s best to use the space that we''re allotted.  Secondly, mailboxes don''t really qualify as road signs, at least to me, and thirdly, the whole thing is a little washed out and the lighting is dim.  Perhaps fiddling with the color in post processing could have given you a bit more punch.', '2003-01-22 23:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(198202, 11206, 4648, '<td valign="top">What do you do for "tame fowl", run them down.  Beautiful photo.  Love the composition, the colors, the clouds especially.  Even though the trees show it''s fall the grass is still so beautiful and green.  Really good shot.  Worth a 9</td>', 'What do you do for "tame fowl", run them down.  Beautiful photo.  Love the composition, the colors, the clouds especially.  Even though the trees show it''s fall the grass is still so beautiful and green.  Really good shot.  Worth a 9', '2003-01-22 23:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(198203, 11274, 5822, '<td valign="top">But where''s Little John? :)</td>', 'But where''s Little John? :)', '2003-01-22 23:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(198206, 11153, 6328, '<td valign="top">doesn''t do much for me</td>', 'doesn''t do much for me', '2003-01-22 23:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(198207, 11111, 4648, '<td valign="top">I really don''t understand what the sign means.  But the wall looks like it has been shot up more than once and by more than a pistol.  Not know where this is taken I can''t be sure.  But you did a great job of photographing it:  the holes in the concrete, plaster and concrete knocked off, small holes in the bricks, and a large area of the bricks blown away.  Sure looks like a bad place to be sitting on a bench.  Great details in the photo, and nice lighting.  Focus and cropping real good.  Good composition and real nice execution.  It''s a 9.</td>', 'I really don''t understand what the sign means.  But the wall looks like it has been shot up more than once and by more than a pistol.  Not know where this is taken I can''t be sure.  But you did a great job of photographing it:  the holes in the concrete, plaster and concrete knocked off, small holes in the bricks, and a large area of the bricks blown away.  Sure looks like a bad place to be sitting on a bench.  Great details in the photo, and nice lighting.  Focus and cropping real good.  Good composition and real nice execution.  It''s a 9.', '2003-01-22 23:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(198208, 11170, 6328, '<td valign="top">beautiful color, composition, would like to have seen more of the sign on the bottom right and perhaps more of the roof and sky.</td>', 'beautiful color, composition, would like to have seen more of the sign on the bottom right and perhaps more of the roof and sky.', '2003-01-22 23:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(198210, 11185, 6328, '<td valign="top">Stop What?!  Is it steam?  Pollution?  You don''t really tell us.</td>', 'Stop What?!  Is it steam?  Pollution?  You don''t really tell us.', '2003-01-22 23:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(198212, 11266, 6328, '<td valign="top">nice color, composition, nice and low to the ground.</td>', 'nice color, composition, nice and low to the ground.', '2003-01-22 23:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(198213, 11289, 6328, '<td valign="top">no comment</td>', 'no comment', '2003-01-22 23:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(198215, 11199, 4648, '<td valign="top">Looks like cow and sheep crossing.  More than that the clouds look like a storm is fixing to cross that field.  Wish the photo was just a little lighter.  The ground area is a little dark.  The clouds are beautiful, especially how they go from blue sky on the right to black clouds of storm on the left.  Nice cropping.  Still worth a 7.</td>', 'Looks like cow and sheep crossing.  More than that the clouds look like a storm is fixing to cross that field.  Wish the photo was just a little lighter.  The ground area is a little dark.  The clouds are beautiful, especially how they go from blue sky on the right to black clouds of storm on the left.  Nice cropping.  Still worth a 7.', '2003-01-22 23:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(198216, 11277, 6328, '<td valign="top">confusing directions, wouldn;t want to drive here.  Nice  and clear, like the green with the white lettering.</td>', 'confusing directions, wouldn;t want to drive here.  Nice  and clear, like the green with the white lettering.', '2003-01-22 23:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(198217, 11193, 6328, '<td valign="top">What did you do?  Put two pictures together?  Nice and sharp, but not natural to find.  .  .</td>', 'What did you do?  Put two pictures together?  Nice and sharp, but not natural to find.  .  .', '2003-01-22 23:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(198218, 11328, 6328, '<td valign="top">don''t know what to say.</td>', 'don''t know what to say.', '2003-01-22 23:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(198220, 11087, 4648, '<td valign="top">Who went to the trouble to time a turtle.  What does that sign really say?  You call the "slow as a tortise" and we call them "Sunday drivers".  Every country seems to have their own.  Nice photo and cute sign.  Glad you got some of the tree in the photo.  Not really exciting, but cute and worth a 6 for the photo techs.</td>', 'Who went to the trouble to time a turtle.  What does that sign really say?  You call the "slow as a tortise" and we call them "Sunday drivers".  Every country seems to have their own.  Nice photo and cute sign.  Glad you got some of the tree in the photo.  Not really exciting, but cute and worth a 6 for the photo techs.', '2003-01-22 23:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(198221, 11230, 5822, '<td valign="top">How did you get such a nice blue?</td>', 'How did you get such a nice blue?', '2003-01-22 23:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(198222, 11348, 6328, '<td valign="top">it''s too busy.  telephone lines, etc., are too distracting from everything else, etc.</td>', 'it''s too busy.  telephone lines, etc., are too distracting from everything else, etc.', '2003-01-22 23:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(198224, 11220, 6328, '<td valign="top">me thinks perhaps you should have stood up in the bed of a truck and shot downwards towards the houses for a more dramatic shot.  Perhaps too much sky takes away from the shot</td>', 'me thinks perhaps you should have stood up in the bed of a truck and shot downwards towards the houses for a more dramatic shot.  Perhaps too much sky takes away from the shot', '2003-01-22 23:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(198225, 11228, 6328, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Talk about a message!  Like the color of the rust showing on the box, the red and white stripes on the signs, the red brick wall with the white graffiti.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Wow!  Talk about a message!  Like the color of the rust showing on the box, the red and white stripes on the signs, the red brick wall with the white graffiti.  Nicely done!', '2003-01-22 23:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(198226, 11335, 4648, '<td valign="top">Don''t understand what you are showing us.  Decent photo, a little dark,  but it really doesn''t say anything about the sign.  And your title doesn''t help me understand either.  The photo should say it on it''s own, but then the title should help add to your meaning.  The photo is worth a 5 but I don''t see the challenge other than a hand sign just there.  So 5 is all I can give it.  Sorry.</td>', 'Don''t understand what you are showing us.  Decent photo, a little dark,  but it really doesn''t say anything about the sign.  And your title doesn''t help me understand either.  The photo should say it on it''s own, but then the title should help add to your meaning.  The photo is worth a 5 but I don''t see the challenge other than a hand sign just there.  So 5 is all I can give it.  Sorry.', '2003-01-22 23:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(198227, 11234, 1863, '<td valign="top">An interesting shot :)  It seems a bit over exposed on the sign, and fuzzy in the background. I realize this is probably your intentions though :) It''s very eye catching :) Keep up the good work! -Annida</td>', 'An interesting shot :)  It seems a bit over exposed on the sign, and fuzzy in the background. I realize this is probably your intentions though :) It''s very eye catching :) Keep up the good work! -Annida', '2003-01-22 23:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(198228, 11318, 6328, '<td valign="top">Nice backround with the Blue Sky.  Like the Plane going by.  That Green really stands out.  Really nice job!</td>', 'Nice backround with the Blue Sky.  Like the Plane going by.  That Green really stands out.  Really nice job!', '2003-01-22 23:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(198229, 11068, 6328, '<td valign="top">You obviously got down and dirty for this shot.  Nicely done, very nice colours.</td>', 'You obviously got down and dirty for this shot.  Nicely done, very nice colours.', '2003-01-22 23:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(198230, 11303, 6328, '<td valign="top">just a bit too busy for me.  Don''t know where you want to take me.  My eyes keep looking at the white car on the left.</td>', 'just a bit too busy for me.  Don''t know where you want to take me.  My eyes keep looking at the white car on the left.', '2003-01-22 23:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(198231, 11312, 6328, '<td valign="top">doesn''t say anything to me</td>', 'doesn''t say anything to me', '2003-01-22 23:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(198232, 11197, 1863, '<td valign="top">I love the building in this photograph :) it''s a very different structure. It just looks like the sign was thrown in as an afterthought.I think if maybe you had been able to concentrate more on the sign and maybe the windows above it, it may have been a much more successful photograph -Annida</td>', 'I love the building in this photograph :) it''s a very different structure. It just looks like the sign was thrown in as an afterthought.I think if maybe you had been able to concentrate more on the sign and maybe the windows above it, it may have been a much more successful photograph -Annida', '2003-01-22 23:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(198233, 11320, 6320, '<td valign="top">HAHAHA!! thats really funny!! 10</td>', 'HAHAHA!! thats really funny!! 10', '2003-01-22 23:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(198234, 11114, 6328, '<td valign="top">too busy for me, but the blue sky is nice.</td>', 'too busy for me, but the blue sky is nice.', '2003-01-22 23:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(198236, 11078, 4648, '<td valign="top">How did you get the beautiful colors, good focus, and the completely white background unless you put a white posterboard behind it.  But that doesn''t appear to be the case.  Well done.  Like the boarder.  Nice one for a 7.</td>', 'How did you get the beautiful colors, good focus, and the completely white background unless you put a white posterboard behind it.  But that doesn''t appear to be the case.  Well done.  Like the boarder.  Nice one for a 7.', '2003-01-22 23:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(198237, 11297, 6328, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Beautiful sky with the lighthouse.  Too bad the dogs can''t enjoy the sights as well as their humans!</td>', 'Wow.  Beautiful sky with the lighthouse.  Too bad the dogs can''t enjoy the sights as well as their humans!', '2003-01-22 23:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(198238, 11290, 1863, '<td valign="top">I am not sure about this photograph. I like the circular feel. What I think you should have done was concentrate more on the sign. it looks at the moment as if it was an after thought. -Annida</td>', 'I am not sure about this photograph. I like the circular feel. What I think you should have done was concentrate more on the sign. it looks at the moment as if it was an after thought. -Annida', '2003-01-22 23:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(198239, 11342, 6328, '<td valign="top">doesn''t turn my crank</td>', 'doesn''t turn my crank', '2003-01-22 23:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(198242, 11230, 3320, '<td valign="top">Gminish, is that you ? I always dreamt about Alaska ... <br/>Anyway .. you or not you ;-) .. I just love that shot, the color contrasts, the way the lines are leading the eyes ... there .. somewhere in the nice and cold stillness .. probably going nowhere .. last sign (well almost) of urbanism ... going there to forget, searching for amnesia <br/>PS:How could they manage to have a yield sign there ? there is that many cars ?<br/> <br/>Congratulations and good luck<br/>10<br/>Lionel</td>', 'Gminish, is that you ? I always dreamt about Alaska ... Anyway .. you or not you ;-) .. I just love that shot, the color contrasts, the way the lines are leading the eyes ... there .. somewhere in the nice and cold stillness .. probably going nowhere .. last sign (well almost) of urbanism ... going there to forget, searching for amnesia PS:How could they manage to have a yield sign there ? there is that many cars ? Congratulations and good luck10Lionel', '2003-01-22 23:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(198244, 11116, 4648, '<td valign="top">I disagree with you.  I think that means the ducks must use the right land and turn right with the rest of the traffic.  I can''t believe this sign is in the city.  Must be a lake nearby.  Nice clear photo.  Good composition with nice execution.  Nothing really wrong, just no "wow".  But good photo.  7.</td>', 'I disagree with you.  I think that means the ducks must use the right land and turn right with the rest of the traffic.  I can''t believe this sign is in the city.  Must be a lake nearby.  Nice clear photo.  Good composition with nice execution.  Nothing really wrong, just no "wow".  But good photo.  7.', '2003-01-22 23:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(198247, 11203, 1647, '<td valign="top">Where was this photo taken?  It looks more like a coin than a historical marker - is it preserved in a museum or something?  Unfortunately, being taken so close it loses its context as a road sign.  Your focus is quite good, although I''m not sure why you have cropped it unevenly (perhaps to hide objects beside it?).</td>', 'Where was this photo taken?  It looks more like a coin than a historical marker - is it preserved in a museum or something?  Unfortunately, being taken so close it loses its context as a road sign.  Your focus is quite good, although I''m not sure why you have cropped it unevenly (perhaps to hide objects beside it?).', '2003-01-23 00:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(198249, 11129, 1647, '<td valign="top">I love the clouds behind this signpost - they create a lovely background.  Focus on the sign is wonderful and composition is quite good also.</td>', 'I love the clouds behind this signpost - they create a lovely background.  Focus on the sign is wonderful and composition is quite good also.', '2003-01-23 00:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(198251, 11135, 1647, '<td valign="top">Another humous title - well done, the photo is quite boring on it''s own but the title rescues it somewhat.  Focus is quite good on ths sign and colour is fine.  It looks like the sign is partly in shadow (top left wedge looks brighter).</td>', 'Another humous title - well done, the photo is quite boring on it''s own but the title rescues it somewhat.  Focus is quite good on ths sign and colour is fine.  It looks like the sign is partly in shadow (top left wedge looks brighter).', '2003-01-23 00:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(198253, 11308, 4648, '<td valign="top">Strange angle.  Camera appears to be tilted, which makes it akward to look at.  Focus and cropping good, but too odd of an angle for me personally.  It''s a 5.</td>', 'Strange angle.  Camera appears to be tilted, which makes it akward to look at.  Focus and cropping good, but too odd of an angle for me personally.  It''s a 5.', '2003-01-23 00:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(198254, 11156, 1647, '<td valign="top">I love the detail in the tree it looks stunning - I hope you took a photo of it on it''s own as well.  Composition of the sign and tree is quite good.  My only negative is that the lighting of the sign could have been slightly better - although I admit that people might think you strange lighting a street sign to remove darkness and reflections.  Good work.</td>', 'I love the detail in the tree it looks stunning - I hope you took a photo of it on it''s own as well.  Composition of the sign and tree is quite good.  My only negative is that the lighting of the sign could have been slightly better - although I admit that people might think you strange lighting a street sign to remove darkness and reflections.  Good work.', '2003-01-23 00:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(198256, 11244, 1647, '<td valign="top">Very crisp and vivid - the snow has so much texture in it.  Focus and composition are lovely - the only thing I would have done differently would be a little less snow around the top of the S (currently it blends a little too well).  The border is very appropriate for the image.  One of the better photo''s this week.</td>', 'Very crisp and vivid - the snow has so much texture in it.  Focus and composition are lovely - the only thing I would have done differently would be a little less snow around the top of the S (currently it blends a little too well).  The border is very appropriate for the image.  One of the better photo''s this week.', '2003-01-23 00:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(198257, 11326, 4648, '<td valign="top">Your title sounds like a blond driver at a flashing red light.  Think they have enough signs and poles?  I''ve never seen a street like this.  Nice sharp focus, good lighting, good composition.  Photo looks crowded because street is crowded.  Too much.  But the photo is worth a 7 and sure does meet the challenge of "street signs".</td>', 'Your title sounds like a blond driver at a flashing red light.  Think they have enough signs and poles?  I''ve never seen a street like this.  Nice sharp focus, good lighting, good composition.  Photo looks crowded because street is crowded.  Too much.  But the photo is worth a 7 and sure does meet the challenge of "street signs".', '2003-01-23 00:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(198260, 11348, 1647, '<td valign="top">A simple photo - which works well, I really like the concept.  The sign looks just a little bit blury unfortunately (but perhaps it''s just my eyes when I look closer).  The power lines are a little distracting - especially the one passing through the sign.</td>', 'A simple photo - which works well, I really like the concept.  The sign looks just a little bit blury unfortunately (but perhaps it''s just my eyes when I look closer).  The power lines are a little distracting - especially the one passing through the sign.', '2003-01-23 00:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(198262, 11135, 4648, '<td valign="top">In the USA to belt means to hit.  Does this sign say to hit front and rear passengers?  I''ll vote for that.  Good clean and clear sign with overall good focus and light.  Nice photo.  6</td>', 'In the USA to belt means to hit.  Does this sign say to hit front and rear passengers?  I''ll vote for that.  Good clean and clear sign with overall good focus and light.  Nice photo.  6', '2003-01-23 00:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(198264, 11317, 1647, '<td valign="top">This photo looks just a little bit blurry / grainy.  Perhaps it was taken in fairly low light (it looks a little like ISO noise).  Composition of the image is good, although the title isn''t too obvious without knowing the full story(perhaps someone''s age?).</td>', 'This photo looks just a little bit blurry / grainy.  Perhaps it was taken in fairly low light (it looks a little like ISO noise).  Composition of the image is good, although the title isn''t too obvious without knowing the full story(perhaps someone''s age?).', '2003-01-23 00:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(198266, 11051, 4648, '<td valign="top">What if they keep circling the fountain, do you keep yielding to them?  Nice fountain and nice night photo.  The street light are really good.  Love the red bushes at the bottom of the photo.  Real nice photo.  Worth an 8</td>', 'What if they keep circling the fountain, do you keep yielding to them?  Nice fountain and nice night photo.  The street light are really good.  Love the red bushes at the bottom of the photo.  Real nice photo.  Worth an 8', '2003-01-23 00:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(198268, 11070, 4648, '<td valign="top">Wrong challenge!  Would have been a winner in the other one.  I''m probably the only one going to say this - I like the car in the photo.  Keeps it from being a photo of just a silo in a field.  Add something to it.  The sky is washed out but everything else is right on.  Good job.  7</td>', 'Wrong challenge!  Would have been a winner in the other one.  I''m probably the only one going to say this - I like the car in the photo.  Keeps it from being a photo of just a silo in a field.  Add something to it.  The sky is washed out but everything else is right on.  Good job.  7', '2003-01-23 00:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(198269, 11304, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice focus and exposure - makes a very crisp image.  Composition is also good - I really have nothing bad to say about this image.</td>', 'Nice focus and exposure - makes a very crisp image.  Composition is also good - I really have nothing bad to say about this image.', '2003-01-23 00:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(198272, 11308, 1647, '<td valign="top">Certainly an artistic view of a streetlight and sign.  Focus looks fine to me, composition is good, and the clouds are interesting.</td>', 'Certainly an artistic view of a streetlight and sign.  Focus looks fine to me, composition is good, and the clouds are interesting.', '2003-01-23 00:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(198273, 11222, 4648, '<td valign="top">How slow one must drive to read this sign.  It really should be cleaned up and the weeks cut back from around it.  I''m serious.  This is an antique and should be preserved, other than just in a really good photo, which you have done for an 8</td>', 'How slow one must drive to read this sign.  It really should be cleaned up and the weeks cut back from around it.  I''m serious.  This is an antique and should be preserved, other than just in a really good photo, which you have done for an 8', '2003-01-23 00:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(198275, 11058, 1647, '<td valign="top">I like the taillights going through the image.  The main negative from my point of view (and it''s not a big one) is the reflection occuring under the word "XING".  Other than that it''s quite good - composition is good with the sign well placed.  The black and white border also works well, effectively providing a border to both the white snow and the black sky.  Good work.</td>', 'I like the taillights going through the image.  The main negative from my point of view (and it''s not a big one) is the reflection occuring under the word "XING".  Other than that it''s quite good - composition is good with the sign well placed.  The black and white border also works well, effectively providing a border to both the white snow and the black sky.  Good work.', '2003-01-23 00:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(198280, 11325, 1647, '<td valign="top">I love the mood of this photo.  It looks like you maybe used a flash to light the sign - either way the effect is great, it really draws your attention by being much brighter than anything else.  The texture of the sign really adds interest as well.  If I changed anything it would be to extend the right edge just slightly - the sign feels a little to close for my liking.</td>', 'I love the mood of this photo.  It looks like you maybe used a flash to light the sign - either way the effect is great, it really draws your attention by being much brighter than anything else.  The texture of the sign really adds interest as well.  If I changed anything it would be to extend the right edge just slightly - the sign feels a little to close for my liking.', '2003-01-23 00:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(198296, 11075, 1707, '<td valign="top">It''s time that sign be changed!</td>', 'It''s time that sign be changed!', '2003-01-23 00:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(198310, 11145, 5964, '<td valign="top">Cool find, it sure looks like a long lost forgotten sign. Besides the fact that the sign is faded, I think the shrubbery really adds the touch to create the image of forgottoness. Due to the nature of the shot there are not many colors, except the green, I think I would like to see this shot in black and white.  The placement of the sign is great, focus is good, and in this shot I really like the inclusion of the whole post. 7.</td>', 'Cool find, it sure looks like a long lost forgotten sign. Besides the fact that the sign is faded, I think the shrubbery really adds the touch to create the image of forgottoness. Due to the nature of the shot there are not many colors, except the green, I think I would like to see this shot in black and white.  The placement of the sign is great, focus is good, and in this shot I really like the inclusion of the whole post. 7.', '2003-01-23 01:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(198315, 11063, 5964, '<td valign="top">Very cool find, I just love the title. Your focus is good, but color wise, there is just too much blue in this shot. Where is the green of the signs? The color contrast of blue/green or even white/green would also help the signs stand out a bit more. I also might have tried to approach this shot at a different angle if at all possible. Due to the fact of having to read both signs I would have tried to get the post dead center in the shot, or if you cropped some include a bit more sky on the state side, give the shot a sense of balance. 7.</td>', 'Very cool find, I just love the title. Your focus is good, but color wise, there is just too much blue in this shot. Where is the green of the signs? The color contrast of blue/green or even white/green would also help the signs stand out a bit more. I also might have tried to approach this shot at a different angle if at all possible. Due to the fact of having to read both signs I would have tried to get the post dead center in the shot, or if you cropped some include a bit more sky on the state side, give the shot a sense of balance. 7.', '2003-01-23 01:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(198358, 11142, 4514, '<td valign="top">This is intresting and a good shot to.  I understand that Tag is the term for Marked by Graffitti but I think it actually takes away form the shot.</td>', 'This is intresting and a good shot to.  I understand that Tag is the term for Marked by Graffitti but I think it actually takes away form the shot.', '2003-01-23 03:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(198360, 11264, 4514, '<td valign="top">This is an intresting shot.  South 95 North US1.  Hmmmm.</td>', 'This is an intresting shot.  South 95 North US1.  Hmmmm.', '2003-01-23 03:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(198361, 11188, 4514, '<td valign="top">Yeah!  what he said.</td>', 'Yeah!  what he said.', '2003-01-23 03:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(198362, 11314, 4514, '<td valign="top">Sligtly dark.</td>', 'Sligtly dark.', '2003-01-23 03:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(198363, 11059, 4514, '<td valign="top">Cute.  Very Cute.</td>', 'Cute.  Very Cute.', '2003-01-23 03:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(198364, 11167, 4514, '<td valign="top">Very Nice shot.</td>', 'Very Nice shot.', '2003-01-23 03:15:43.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(198366, 11131, 4514, '<td valign="top">Very Nice shot.</td>', 'Very Nice shot.', '2003-01-23 03:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(198367, 11346, 4514, '<td valign="top">In my oppinion it is too Blah.  Clouds are nice.</td>', 'In my oppinion it is too Blah.  Clouds are nice.', '2003-01-23 03:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(198368, 11137, 4514, '<td valign="top">Very Cute.  Did you Win????</td>', 'Very Cute.  Did you Win????', '2003-01-23 03:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(198369, 11272, 4514, '<td valign="top">Boy is that Bug Lighting anoying.</td>', 'Boy is that Bug Lighting anoying.', '2003-01-23 03:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(198414, 11325, 1829, '<td valign="top">Now this is brilliant.  Excellent capture.</td>', 'Now this is brilliant.  Excellent capture.', '2003-01-23 06:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(198415, 11049, 1829, '<td valign="top">What a classic.  Excellent capture.  Well done. 10 :)</td>', 'What a classic.  Excellent capture.  Well done. 10 :)', '2003-01-23 06:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(198416, 11066, 5158, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture! It''s one of my very few favourits this time.<br/>I like the color choice, the wonderfull composition (not many pictures of this challenge used special angles). It''s one of the few pictures with space.<br/>It could be a little darker though in the bright parts: the street reflection and the lamps are somewhat bright. I like the dark sky too. <br/>So for me it is a winner and good luck to you.</td>', 'I really like this picture! It''s one of my very few favourits this time.I like the color choice, the wonderfull composition (not many pictures of this challenge used special angles). It''s one of the few pictures with space.It could be a little darker though in the bright parts: the street reflection and the lamps are somewhat bright. I like the dark sky too. So for me it is a winner and good luck to you.', '2003-01-23 06:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(198418, 11221, 5158, '<td valign="top">One of my few favourits this time: I like it''s almost graphical style, the angle of view and the small number of colors. The texture is great too.<br/>The blue sky is very important and seeing more of it might have been even better. <br/>Also the nail is a little dark and thus hard to see on the first look.<br/>Still a wonderfull road-sign picture living from color, composition and of course the topic. Good luck to you.</td>', 'One of my few favourits this time: I like it''s almost graphical style, the angle of view and the small number of colors. The texture is great too.The blue sky is very important and seeing more of it might have been even better. Also the nail is a little dark and thus hard to see on the first look.Still a wonderfull road-sign picture living from color, composition and of course the topic. Good luck to you.', '2003-01-23 06:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(198420, 11324, 1829, '<td valign="top">LMAO.  DUH.  Great shot.</td>', 'LMAO.  DUH.  Great shot.', '2003-01-23 06:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(198421, 11054, 1829, '<td valign="top">Awe===.  I like this shot though, very original.</td>', 'Awe===.  I like this shot though, very original.', '2003-01-23 06:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(198422, 11120, 5158, '<td valign="top">I apreciat in your submission that it is very consequent: because it''s quality is not good at all (focus, contrast, light etc.) I assume that it should be seen more as a joke, not intended to score high or address dog-lovers.<br/>And as a joke -only be understood on this site- it''s great. Acctually I missed a good dog nose in the last challenge.<br/>I hope my interpreatation is correct. However, I will not vote it high.</td>', 'I apreciat in your submission that it is very consequent: because it''s quality is not good at all (focus, contrast, light etc.) I assume that it should be seen more as a joke, not intended to score high or address dog-lovers.And as a joke -only be understood on this site- it''s great. Acctually I missed a good dog nose in the last challenge.I hope my interpreatation is correct. However, I will not vote it high.', '2003-01-23 06:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(198424, 11223, 5158, '<td valign="top">You were realy lucky in finding one of the very few interesting signs of the challenge. Not only is it old, scratched and the tree is grown over it, its heard shape is wonderfull and you have a grat ese in seeing this. Most people would have passed by (including me).<br/>However, somehow the cropping or size does not work well: on the thumbnail the "heart" is more obvious then on the enlarged picture. It''s so big that the viewers eyes do not get the shape with one single view, his eyes have to move.<br/>A square shaped cropping with a smaller sign might have been better.<br/>Still, a very good picture with a wonderful idea. Good luck to you</td>', 'You were realy lucky in finding one of the very few interesting signs of the challenge. Not only is it old, scratched and the tree is grown over it, its heard shape is wonderfull and you have a grat ese in seeing this. Most people would have passed by (including me).However, somehow the cropping or size does not work well: on the thumbnail the "heart" is more obvious then on the enlarged picture. It''s so big that the viewers eyes do not get the shape with one single view, his eyes have to move.A square shaped cropping with a smaller sign might have been better.Still, a very good picture with a wonderful idea. Good luck to you', '2003-01-23 06:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(198425, 11137, 5728, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I guess this is a marathon right? Very colourful.</td>', 'Interesting. I guess this is a marathon right? Very colourful.', '2003-01-23 06:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(198426, 11118, 5158, '<td valign="top">LOL, a wonderful combination of the two road signs. Even without reading the size mismatch is the first thing I noticed. I like the color and darkness of the background: it''s more like a surface on which the main-objects rest. Like in a studio-shot with colored and textured background.<br/>Because you probably used the flash, the sign appear a little flat, more like a graphic rather then a real life object. I can''t say if this is good or bad.<br/>Good luck to you.<br/></td>', 'LOL, a wonderful combination of the two road signs. Even without reading the size mismatch is the first thing I noticed. I like the color and darkness of the background: it''s more like a surface on which the main-objects rest. Like in a studio-shot with colored and textured background.Because you probably used the flash, the sign appear a little flat, more like a graphic rather then a real life object. I can''t say if this is good or bad.Good luck to you.', '2003-01-23 06:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(198433, 11181, 5364, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice alternative take on the subject. I think I would have got a lower viewpoint, so that you aren''t looking down on the objects. Maybe include a toy car?</td>', 'It''s a nice alternative take on the subject. I think I would have got a lower viewpoint, so that you aren''t looking down on the objects. Maybe include a toy car?', '2003-01-23 07:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
