(198743, 11345, 1005, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle shot, I get the message, but obscured as it is, it''s hard to read.  The background "feels" like it''s moving - was it a windy day or were you in a moving vehicle?  (both guesses)  7 Swash</td>', 'Interesting angle shot, I get the message, but obscured as it is, it''s hard to read.  The background "feels" like it''s moving - was it a windy day or were you in a moving vehicle?  (both guesses)  7 Swash', '2003-01-23 14:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(198747, 11201, 1005, '<td valign="top">Verh good shot!  Extremely clean background!  Focus is very good, but some of the edges seem a little pixelated (sorry, no suggestions)  Good color.  I''m a bit conflicted on the shadows on the front of the sign....seems to be more interesting, but somewhat obscuring, too (I''m not using that as score criteria, I''m just too wishy washy about it.)  7 Swash</td>', 'Verh good shot!  Extremely clean background!  Focus is very good, but some of the edges seem a little pixelated (sorry, no suggestions)  Good color.  I''m a bit conflicted on the shadows on the front of the sign....seems to be more interesting, but somewhat obscuring, too (I''m not using that as score criteria, I''m just too wishy washy about it.)  7 Swash', '2003-01-23 14:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(198755, 11326, 4815, '<td valign="top">The urban crush is well exemplified by this image. I like the splash of russet foliage to soften the harsh city look. The panorama format  suits the foto perfectly although I am not a big fan of the red border. This format seems to balance the plethora of vertical elements present. The pedestrian signs pop out well from the relatively high key background. Order among chaos. A well executed concept.</td>', 'The urban crush is well exemplified by this image. I like the splash of russet foliage to soften the harsh city look. The panorama format  suits the foto perfectly although I am not a big fan of the red border. This format seems to balance the plethora of vertical elements present. The pedestrian signs pop out well from the relatively high key background. Order among chaos. A well executed concept.', '2003-01-23 14:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(198757, 11063, 6349, '<td valign="top">Yes!  It is Ironic.  Wonderful.</td>', 'Yes!  It is Ironic.  Wonderful.', '2003-01-23 14:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(198759, 11132, 6349, '<td valign="top">nice tones.  A person would have been nice.  loading of course.</td>', 'nice tones.  A person would have been nice.  loading of course.', '2003-01-23 14:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(198761, 11165, 6349, '<td valign="top">very nice.  touched up?</td>', 'very nice.  touched up?', '2003-01-23 14:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(198763, 11340, 4815, '<td valign="top">I like the gritty alley feel of this foto. The abused fence, the draped signage, the long shadows, the hunched over figure in front of stairs and the grey shadowed homes are among the visual elments that call my attention. A welcome change of vibrant reality edge street  photography as opposed to clinical studio shots. Very good vision and quick reflexes.</td>', 'I like the gritty alley feel of this foto. The abused fence, the draped signage, the long shadows, the hunched over figure in front of stairs and the grey shadowed homes are among the visual elments that call my attention. A welcome change of vibrant reality edge street  photography as opposed to clinical studio shots. Very good vision and quick reflexes.', '2003-01-23 15:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(198764, 11245, 6349, '<td valign="top">Good subject, avergae photo</td>', 'Good subject, avergae photo', '2003-01-23 15:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(198766, 11325, 6349, '<td valign="top">very nice composition.</td>', 'very nice composition.', '2003-01-23 15:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(198769, 11235, 4648, '<td valign="top">Obviously I don''t understand the road signs.  But they look tucked in tightly agains, and almost inside of, two walls.  Appears to be a narrow street on the left, but can''t really tell, because the photo is cropped so tightly.  Would help if there was more photo on each side of the signs.  Might could even figure out what they mean.  It is a nice clear focus, with good texture.  Appears to be someone or something in the window on the left.  Could be an interesting photo is there were a little more of it.  Good photo just needs better execution.  5</td>', 'Obviously I don''t understand the road signs.  But they look tucked in tightly agains, and almost inside of, two walls.  Appears to be a narrow street on the left, but can''t really tell, because the photo is cropped so tightly.  Would help if there was more photo on each side of the signs.  Might could even figure out what they mean.  It is a nice clear focus, with good texture.  Appears to be someone or something in the window on the left.  Could be an interesting photo is there were a little more of it.  Good photo just needs better execution.  5', '2003-01-23 15:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(198770, 11075, 6349, '<td valign="top">What?</td>', 'What?', '2003-01-23 15:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(198772, 11309, 6349, '<td valign="top">nice picture without the sign</td>', 'nice picture without the sign', '2003-01-23 15:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(198773, 11149, 4648, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture, well done.  NIce focus, composition, color, technically a good photo.  Only problem is your title is the only sign of a road sign.  To me this doesn''t even come close to meeting the challenge and that is a large part of the score.   And that''s a real shame because this is such a good photo and I really like it.  But score wise I can''t help you.  a 5 is the best I can do.</td>', 'Very nice picture, well done.  NIce focus, composition, color, technically a good photo.  Only problem is your title is the only sign of a road sign.  To me this doesn''t even come close to meeting the challenge and that is a large part of the score.   And that''s a real shame because this is such a good photo and I really like it.  But score wise I can''t help you.  a 5 is the best I can do.', '2003-01-23 15:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(198775, 11291, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute shot!  Very good details on the palm/thumb, but the knuckles are just to glaring to miss.  (Maybe try a little powder?)  Still overall, it''s very good.  8 Swash</td>', 'Cute shot!  Very good details on the palm/thumb, but the knuckles are just to glaring to miss.  (Maybe try a little powder?)  Still overall, it''s very good.  8 Swash', '2003-01-23 15:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(198777, 11164, 4648, '<td valign="top">Now this is a nice photo.  Nice composition, well executed.  I really like the shadows on the snow.  And the sky is beautiful with the genteal swirls.  Well done for an 8.</td>', 'Now this is a nice photo.  Nice composition, well executed.  I really like the shadows on the snow.  And the sky is beautiful with the genteal swirls.  Well done for an 8.', '2003-01-23 15:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(198781, 11318, 3127, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors! Great title</td>', 'Wonderful colors! Great title', '2003-01-23 15:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(198782, 11315, 4648, '<td valign="top">Nice signs and nice photo.  Nice colors and focus and composition.  But I don''t see any "street signs" to meet the challenge with, and meeting the challenge is half of the project.  It''s a shame because this really is a good photo.</td>', 'Nice signs and nice photo.  Nice colors and focus and composition.  But I don''t see any "street signs" to meet the challenge with, and meeting the challenge is half of the project.  It''s a shame because this really is a good photo.', '2003-01-23 15:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(198783, 11252, 1005, '<td valign="top">I''m there!  Very good shot.   The person being in the shot looking at the sign is a great add.  I''m not sure I like the framing.  (Sign going off the frame...)  Still, it''s well done and very good color, so it''s an 8.  Swash</td>', 'I''m there!  Very good shot.   The person being in the shot looking at the sign is a great add.  I''m not sure I like the framing.  (Sign going off the frame...)  Still, it''s well done and very good color, so it''s an 8.  Swash', '2003-01-23 15:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(198786, 11319, 4648, '<td valign="top">This sign I do not understand at all.  The shape is the international shape for a stop sign, but this appears to be the name of a town.  But it is a "road sign" and this is a nice photo, a little dark and soft focus but nice.  Love the clouds on the mountains.  Wish you could zap out the power lines.  Not a bad photo at all.  Worth a 6.</td>', 'This sign I do not understand at all.  The shape is the international shape for a stop sign, but this appears to be the name of a town.  But it is a "road sign" and this is a nice photo, a little dark and soft focus but nice.  Love the clouds on the mountains.  Wish you could zap out the power lines.  Not a bad photo at all.  Worth a 6.', '2003-01-23 15:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(198793, 11066, 4648, '<td valign="top">Why so yellow and brown?    Good focus and meets challenge.  For me the colors ruin it.</td>', 'Why so yellow and brown?    Good focus and meets challenge.  For me the colors ruin it.', '2003-01-23 15:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(198800, 11309, 4648, '<td valign="top">Very good.  Maybe just a hair dark but really good photo.  Good composition with really good execution.  Only fault I can find, like I said, is maybe just a little dark, especially under the bridge and at the vry end of the bridge.  If you''re going to let me see under there I want to see under there.  But it really doesn''t hurt the photo that much.  Still an 8.</td>', 'Very good.  Maybe just a hair dark but really good photo.  Good composition with really good execution.  Only fault I can find, like I said, is maybe just a little dark, especially under the bridge and at the vry end of the bridge.  If you''re going to let me see under there I want to see under there.  But it really doesn''t hurt the photo that much.  Still an 8.', '2003-01-23 15:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(198802, 11136, 4648, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, now lighten the photo just a little and you got it all.  This way it''s an 8.</td>', 'Nice capture, now lighten the photo just a little and you got it all.  This way it''s an 8.', '2003-01-23 15:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(198804, 11256, 4210, '<td valign="top">Creative!</td>', 'Creative!', '2003-01-23 15:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(198805, 11176, 4648, '<td valign="top">Is this the one where the cow is on top of the building?  Nice sharp photo with good details.  But is this considered a "road sign"?  I''ve seen a lot of strange things used to try to meet the challenge this week.  I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt because it is meant to be seen from the road, even though I don''t think this was what they meant.  It''s a nice photo.</td>', 'Is this the one where the cow is on top of the building?  Nice sharp photo with good details.  But is this considered a "road sign"?  I''ve seen a lot of strange things used to try to meet the challenge this week.  I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt because it is meant to be seen from the road, even though I don''t think this was what they meant.  It''s a nice photo.', '2003-01-23 15:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(198807, 11061, 4210, '<td valign="top">Good composition</td>', 'Good composition', '2003-01-23 15:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(198808, 11343, 4210, '<td valign="top">(qu)Ack! Funny stuff! I think the composition needs a little work though. But this is a creative idea.</td>', '(qu)Ack! Funny stuff! I think the composition needs a little work though. But this is a creative idea.', '2003-01-23 15:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(198809, 11296, 4210, '<td valign="top">Good use of light and shadow. Needs some quality help however.</td>', 'Good use of light and shadow. Needs some quality help however.', '2003-01-23 15:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(198810, 11179, 4210, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but not really that appealing.</td>', 'Interesting, but not really that appealing.', '2003-01-23 15:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(198811, 11071, 4210, '<td valign="top">A good idea, but it needs to be better quality (difficult I know in low light conditions).</td>', 'A good idea, but it needs to be better quality (difficult I know in low light conditions).', '2003-01-23 15:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(198812, 11114, 4648, '<td valign="top">Georgeous countryside.  Love the blue sky.  You lucked out with this sign being in such a beautiful setting.    Love the framing with the trees and fence.  Great job.</td>', 'Georgeous countryside.  Love the blue sky.  You lucked out with this sign being in such a beautiful setting.    Love the framing with the trees and fence.  Great job.', '2003-01-23 15:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(198814, 11276, 4210, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Good play with light, good colours.</td>', 'Interesting. Good play with light, good colours.', '2003-01-23 15:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(198816, 11292, 4210, '<td valign="top">I have the inasane wish that there was a horse and buggy about to go over this bridge. Ah well, can''t win ''em all I suppose.</td>', 'I have the inasane wish that there was a horse and buggy about to go over this bridge. Ah well, can''t win ''em all I suppose.', '2003-01-23 15:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(198819, 11182, 885, '<td valign="top">One.  A big fat 1.  You know why.  Meanie.</td>', 'One.  A big fat 1.  You know why.  Meanie.', '2003-01-23 15:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(198820, 11206, 4210, '<td valign="top">A wonderful change from all the duck crossing signs. I like te clouds alot too. They look painted on.</td>', 'A wonderful change from all the duck crossing signs. I like te clouds alot too. They look painted on.', '2003-01-23 15:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(198821, 11215, 4648, '<td valign="top">This could have been such an interesting photo with a little more on the left.  Gives the appearance of a place that hasn''t changed much in the last 20 or 30 years.  I''m having trouble buying this as "road signs", and not just in your photo, but guess I will have to accept it.  Nice photo and well done.  Just not enough of it.  But still godd what you do have.</td>', 'This could have been such an interesting photo with a little more on the left.  Gives the appearance of a place that hasn''t changed much in the last 20 or 30 years.  I''m having trouble buying this as "road signs", and not just in your photo, but guess I will have to accept it.  Nice photo and well done.  Just not enough of it.  But still godd what you do have.', '2003-01-23 15:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(198822, 11185, 4210, '<td valign="top">A great statement</td>', 'A great statement', '2003-01-23 15:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(198824, 11151, 4210, '<td valign="top">Great composition!</td>', 'Great composition!', '2003-01-23 15:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(198825, 11262, 4648, '<td valign="top">The cross and flowers are a little out of focus.  otherwise fairly nice photo.  Like the lake or pond in the back on the left.  I wish you the best in the challenge.</td>', 'The cross and flowers are a little out of focus.  otherwise fairly nice photo.  Like the lake or pond in the back on the left.  I wish you the best in the challenge.', '2003-01-23 15:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(198826, 11344, 4648, '<td valign="top">No much in focus.  Not an exciting or different photo.  Looks like a snapshot taken from the car.  Not my kind of photo.</td>', 'No much in focus.  Not an exciting or different photo.  Looks like a snapshot taken from the car.  Not my kind of photo.', '2003-01-23 15:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(198829, 11128, 4648, '<td valign="top">Not even people; just keep on walking.  Could use a sharper focus. Even the signs are a little too soft on focus.  Good composition, but needs better execution.</td>', 'Not even people; just keep on walking.  Could use a sharper focus. Even the signs are a little too soft on focus.  Good composition, but needs better execution.', '2003-01-23 16:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(198830, 11218, 4648, '<td valign="top">It''s a wonder you didn''t get the camera yanked out of your hands.  Nice job of framing with the tree and sign post.  Good job.  Nice B &amp; W.</td>', 'It''s a wonder you didn''t get the camera yanked out of your hands.  Nice job of framing with the tree and sign post.  Good job.  Nice B & W.', '2003-01-23 16:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(198832, 11245, 5677, '<td valign="top">The quality seems a bit grainy to me.  Other than that, it''s a nice photo.</td>', 'The quality seems a bit grainy to me.  Other than that, it''s a nice photo.', '2003-01-23 16:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(198833, 11120, 5677, '<td valign="top">Does this have anything to do with the challenge?</td>', 'Does this have anything to do with the challenge?', '2003-01-23 16:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(198839, 11108, 5677, '<td valign="top">Might have been better is the sign was lit up a bit more.  It''s hard to read because it''s so dark.</td>', 'Might have been better is the sign was lit up a bit more.  It''s hard to read because it''s so dark.', '2003-01-23 16:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(198844, 11223, 1005, '<td valign="top">Interesting how the tree seems to grown over the sign.  Good eye to see this as a circle straight on, but from this (good) angle, it does appear in a heart shape.  <br/>8 Swash</td>', 'Interesting how the tree seems to grown over the sign.  Good eye to see this as a circle straight on, but from this (good) angle, it does appear in a heart shape.  8 Swash', '2003-01-23 16:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(198846, 11129, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very well taken shot.  Pleasant background, focus is A #1, good framing.  Is the title an inside joke/comment?  The tiny text is nearly readable, but that''s about as good as one could expect.  Interest level is moderate, to me.  Overall, it''s a very nice picture.  8 Swash</td>', 'Very well taken shot.  Pleasant background, focus is A #1, good framing.  Is the title an inside joke/comment?  The tiny text is nearly readable, but that''s about as good as one could expect.  Interest level is moderate, to me.  Overall, it''s a very nice picture.  8 Swash', '2003-01-23 16:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(198851, 11135, 1005, '<td valign="top">Don''t you just hate it when that happens?  If I could spell double entandre, I''d say this was a good one.  Very clear shot with very good color.  8 Swash</td>', 'Don''t you just hate it when that happens?  If I could spell double entandre, I''d say this was a good one.  Very clear shot with very good color.  8 Swash', '2003-01-23 16:48:30.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(198853, 11324, 1005, '<td valign="top">Might be a good idea....do you have one of those sea-going cars?  Very good shot!  Great color, very strong.  8 Swash</td>', 'Might be a good idea....do you have one of those sea-going cars?  Very good shot!  Great color, very strong.  8 Swash', '2003-01-23 16:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(198863, 11278, 4815, '<td valign="top">Top marks for DOF in this image. The toppled sign and weathered tree trunk compliment each other well. The hint of bush on the right is a nice touch to soften the harsh sign edges. What does this image look like in B&amp;W? I find the Maple St. sign a tad dark but that is probably the best you could do considering the shadow-highlight extremes under those conditions. Your vantage point is also well chosen. I would like to see the right corner of the Maple St. sign. Otherwise a very good effort.</td>', 'Top marks for DOF in this image. The toppled sign and weathered tree trunk compliment each other well. The hint of bush on the right is a nice touch to soften the harsh sign edges. What does this image look like in B&W? I find the Maple St. sign a tad dark but that is probably the best you could do considering the shadow-highlight extremes under those conditions. Your vantage point is also well chosen. I would like to see the right corner of the Maple St. sign. Otherwise a very good effort.', '2003-01-23 17:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(198866, 11249, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome photo and the title is good.  But where is the \"Road\" sign that says your title.  The road sign would have made this a 10+.  By splitting hairs that it did not say \"traffic\" signs you can get in technically.  But because of that I can only give it a 7.  And I hate that because it is awesome.  Fantastic photo.  Maybe that\''s too harsh and it should be an 8.</td>', 'This is an awesome photo and the title is good.  But where is the \"Road\" sign that says your title.  The road sign would have made this a 10+.  By splitting hairs that it did not say \"traffic\" signs you can get in technically.  But because of that I can only give it a 7.  And I hate that because it is awesome.  Fantastic photo.  Maybe that\''s too harsh and it should be an 8.', '2003-01-23 17:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(198867, 11300, 4815, '<td valign="top">The lighting is very pleasing in this image. I especially admire the wet look on the pavement  and the various textures. The highlight on the pavement  is beautiful. Personally I would like to separate the sign from the lights and building corner in the background. A matter of breathing space.The  hint of bright sky adds an uplifting note to a sombre picture. The sign does stand out well from the background which is another nice contrast. A worthy notable image.</td>', 'The lighting is very pleasing in this image. I especially admire the wet look on the pavement  and the various textures. The highlight on the pavement  is beautiful. Personally I would like to separate the sign from the lights and building corner in the background. A matter of breathing space.The  hint of bright sky adds an uplifting note to a sombre picture. The sign does stand out well from the background which is another nice contrast. A worthy notable image.', '2003-01-23 17:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(198868, 11181, 6155, '<td valign="top">interesting idea</td>', 'interesting idea', '2003-01-23 17:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(198869, 11244, 6155, '<td valign="top">nicely done</td>', 'nicely done', '2003-01-23 17:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(198871, 11262, 6155, '<td valign="top">like the way the red and white are the more prominent colours</td>', 'like the way the red and white are the more prominent colours', '2003-01-23 17:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(198873, 11122, 6155, '<td valign="top">is your intention for it not to be in focus, like it is when you look at the moon sometimes?</td>', 'is your intention for it not to be in focus, like it is when you look at the moon sometimes?', '2003-01-23 17:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(198874, 11182, 4815, '<td valign="top">I love the crisp metallic look of this image. Hard steel urbania mood. The dramatic  edges among shadows and highlights are very appealing. The cloudless sky really adds to the starkness. The viewpoint is well chosen and adds to the towering looming metropolitan aura. Personally I would like a touch of space between the sign and tower. Otherwise this image has an awe inspiring  modern age impact. Hope you receive many more positive remarks. Good work</td>', 'I love the crisp metallic look of this image. Hard steel urbania mood. The dramatic  edges among shadows and highlights are very appealing. The cloudless sky really adds to the starkness. The viewpoint is well chosen and adds to the towering looming metropolitan aura. Personally I would like a touch of space between the sign and tower. Otherwise this image has an awe inspiring  modern age impact. Hope you receive many more positive remarks. Good work', '2003-01-23 17:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(198875, 11346, 6155, '<td valign="top">like the way the trees/shrubbery and clouds seem to follow the sign</td>', 'like the way the trees/shrubbery and clouds seem to follow the sign', '2003-01-23 17:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(198878, 11325, 6155, '<td valign="top">nicely done, like the interpretation and the juxtaposition of plane and road sign</td>', 'nicely done, like the interpretation and the juxtaposition of plane and road sign', '2003-01-23 17:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(198881, 11094, 6155, '<td valign="top">title and b/w go well with this photo</td>', 'title and b/w go well with this photo', '2003-01-23 17:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(198885, 11221, 1005, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  I got a good laugh from it.  I was thinking the hail should be down a couple inches.....There''s a odd orange line running diagonally throught the shot (hits his bent knee and forearm.  It''s odd, but I see no reason to change your score for it, just thought you should know.  8 Swash</td>', 'Great shot!  I got a good laugh from it.  I was thinking the hail should be down a couple inches.....There''s a odd orange line running diagonally throught the shot (hits his bent knee and forearm.  It''s odd, but I see no reason to change your score for it, just thought you should know.  8 Swash', '2003-01-23 17:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(198886, 11054, 6155, '<td valign="top">like the clouds and the evening feel the photo has</td>', 'like the clouds and the evening feel the photo has', '2003-01-23 17:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(198888, 11289, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very good pic!  Interesting angle, clean background, good title, too.  8 Swash</td>', 'Very good pic!  Interesting angle, clean background, good title, too.  8 Swash', '2003-01-23 17:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(198889, 11049, 6155, '<td valign="top">quite a spooky shot, and the sign adds to this feeling emanating from this picture.</td>', 'quite a spooky shot, and the sign adds to this feeling emanating from this picture.', '2003-01-23 17:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(198892, 11331, 6155, '<td valign="top">interesting sign, and humourous presentation</td>', 'interesting sign, and humourous presentation', '2003-01-23 17:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(198893, 11326, 1005, '<td valign="top">Funny/odd shot.  Your title''s a bit long, but it''s understandable.  Good focus and color.  Framing:  I think I could have lived w/o the last partial No Stopping sign.  Wicked waste of tax dollars.  Are the ppl THAT dumb there?  8 Swash</td>', 'Funny/odd shot.  Your title''s a bit long, but it''s understandable.  Good focus and color.  Framing:  I think I could have lived w/o the last partial No Stopping sign.  Wicked waste of tax dollars.  Are the ppl THAT dumb there?  8 Swash', '2003-01-23 17:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(198895, 11245, 1005, '<td valign="top">Well, that way of course!  Nice find.  Ppl where I live drive by braille, so anything along the road side is either damaged or knocked over, so this sign is in good shape for my neighborhood!  Very well taken shot.  Good focus, framing and lighting seems just about right.  8 Swash</td>', 'Well, that way of course!  Nice find.  Ppl where I live drive by braille, so anything along the road side is either damaged or knocked over, so this sign is in good shape for my neighborhood!  Very well taken shot.  Good focus, framing and lighting seems just about right.  8 Swash', '2003-01-23 17:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(198897, 11182, 2752, '<td valign="top">Great perspective shot..well composed and very sharp.</td>', 'Great perspective shot..well composed and very sharp.', '2003-01-23 17:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(198898, 11178, 1005, '<td valign="top">I like you title and the oxymoron, but this whole sign has confusion...What''s the surprise?  (that someone would do this?)  Very good focus/ framing / color.  <br/>8 Swash</td>', 'I like you title and the oxymoron, but this whole sign has confusion...What''s the surprise?  (that someone would do this?)  Very good focus/ framing / color.  8 Swash', '2003-01-23 17:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(198900, 11304, 2752, '<td valign="top">Very clear and sharp composition..The colors compliment each other nicely.  The sky is especially nice.</td>', 'Very clear and sharp composition..The colors compliment each other nicely.  The sky is especially nice.', '2003-01-23 17:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(198905, 11185, 2752, '<td valign="top">Wonderful message and well done composition.</td>', 'Wonderful message and well done composition.', '2003-01-23 17:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(198911, 11165, 1005, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  Good focus, nice framing, sort of a cool halo the building has on top.  8 Swash</td>', 'Interesting shot.  Good focus, nice framing, sort of a cool halo the building has on top.  8 Swash', '2003-01-23 17:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(198915, 11217, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very good, clear shot.  Nice color.  Interest level seems a little low, please draw me, the viewer, into your shot (but no suggestions, sorry!)  7 Swash</td>', 'Very good, clear shot.  Nice color.  Interest level seems a little low, please draw me, the viewer, into your shot (but no suggestions, sorry!)  7 Swash', '2003-01-23 18:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(198916, 11098, 1005, '<td valign="top">Odd, yet cool.  It''s interesting how you got the Speed sign frozen very well, but blurred the background.  Nicely done!  Too bad the blur takes a little away from the great color of the sunset (no points).  8 Swash</td>', 'Odd, yet cool.  It''s interesting how you got the Speed sign frozen very well, but blurred the background.  Nicely done!  Too bad the blur takes a little away from the great color of the sunset (no points).  8 Swash', '2003-01-23 18:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(198918, 11151, 1005, '<td valign="top">Odd shot.  Did you find it this way, or did you plant the sign?  (No matter, just curious)  Very good focus/color - interesting framing and angle.  8 Swash</td>', 'Odd shot.  Did you find it this way, or did you plant the sign?  (No matter, just curious)  Very good focus/color - interesting framing and angle.  8 Swash', '2003-01-23 18:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(198927, 11318, 811, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast and simplicity of the colors in this shot.  My only suggestion would be to try NEAT IMAGE or somethng like that as I can see some "noise" in the sky (other than teh plane and contrail).</td>', 'I love the contrast and simplicity of the colors in this shot.  My only suggestion would be to try NEAT IMAGE or somethng like that as I can see some "noise" in the sky (other than teh plane and contrail).', '2003-01-23 18:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(198934, 11118, 4615, '<td valign="top">queensland?</td>', 'queensland?', '2003-01-23 18:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(198939, 11075, 4615, '<td valign="top">a relic of the recent past?</td>', 'a relic of the recent past?', '2003-01-23 18:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(198940, 11271, 6328, '<td valign="top">Makes me cold just looking at this photo.  Like the DO NO PASS sign just pass the HELL sign too!</td>', 'Makes me cold just looking at this photo.  Like the DO NO PASS sign just pass the HELL sign too!', '2003-01-23 18:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(198942, 11273, 6328, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but it just doesn''t say much to me. It''s a cute smile, but that''s it.</td>', 'Sorry, but it just doesn''t say much to me. It''s a cute smile, but that''s it.', '2003-01-23 18:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(198943, 11149, 6328, '<td valign="top">I can see the TeePee''s on the left, but the road wants to keep leading me beyond into the . . .forest??  Nice color, greys, browns, greens.</td>', 'I can see the TeePee''s on the left, but the road wants to keep leading me beyond into the . . .forest??  Nice color, greys, browns, greens.', '2003-01-23 18:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(198944, 11241, 6328, '<td valign="top">Cute.  Like the green moss on the walls and trees.  Like the leaves on the sidewalk too.</td>', 'Cute.  Like the green moss on the walls and trees.  Like the leaves on the sidewalk too.', '2003-01-23 18:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(198946, 11256, 6328, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Color here is great!  Lime gree shows up great as does the rusty color on the wheels and the dirt and grime on the sides of the car and wheels.  Road sign is nice and clear also.  Nice job.</td>', 'Wow!  Color here is great!  Lime gree shows up great as does the rusty color on the wheels and the dirt and grime on the sides of the car and wheels.  Road sign is nice and clear also.  Nice job.', '2003-01-23 19:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(198947, 11094, 6328, '<td valign="top">Sure does look lonely, but can''t read any of the road signs.  What do they say?<br/>perhaps just too much sky?</td>', 'Sure does look lonely, but can''t read any of the road signs.  What do they say?perhaps just too much sky?', '2003-01-23 19:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(198949, 11235, 1647, '<td valign="top">Those signs have some real history to them.  The agressive cropping really draws attention to them.  You''re image has a lot of texture and even though I''m not a fan of black and white I suspect this is an image that could look really powerful converted to black and white - There are some articles on using Photoshops "Channel Mixer" to create powerful black and white images.  Your border is ok, but not really necessary in my opinion - that might change after converting to b&amp;w though.  Focus and exposure are great, except perhaps the building on the left which is a bit overexposed (not much you could do about that).  Well done.</td>', 'Those signs have some real history to them.  The agressive cropping really draws attention to them.  You''re image has a lot of texture and even though I''m not a fan of black and white I suspect this is an image that could look really powerful converted to black and white - There are some articles on using Photoshops "Channel Mixer" to create powerful black and white images.  Your border is ok, but not really necessary in my opinion - that might change after converting to b&w though.  Focus and exposure are great, except perhaps the building on the left which is a bit overexposed (not much you could do about that).  Well done.', '2003-01-23 19:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(198950, 11235, 6328, '<td valign="top">love the color.  Look at the rust on the bottom sign.  the cracking of the concrete building, the red brick wall, the peeling of the tape on the top sign, the decay.  You''ve shown it all, yet the window to the left of the other building looks newly painted.  Well done!</td>', 'love the color.  Look at the rust on the bottom sign.  the cracking of the concrete building, the red brick wall, the peeling of the tape on the top sign, the decay.  You''ve shown it all, yet the window to the left of the other building looks newly painted.  Well done!', '2003-01-23 19:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(198951, 11161, 4615, '<td valign="top">bizarre rule.</td>', 'bizarre rule.', '2003-01-23 19:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(198952, 11165, 6328, '<td valign="top">Love your night shot.  The Blue and White sign against the Dark Sky with the Greyness of the Hospital and the lights shining from the parking lot.  Great shot.</td>', 'Love your night shot.  The Blue and White sign against the Dark Sky with the Greyness of the Hospital and the lights shining from the parking lot.  Great shot.', '2003-01-23 19:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(198953, 11312, 1647, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately this sign really hides against the gutter and road - only the chain led my eyes to it.  The plants take my attention because they are so much brighter.  Focus and exposure are good, and I like the aspect ratio you chose for the final image (I hate square images normally).</td>', 'Unfortunately this sign really hides against the gutter and road - only the chain led my eyes to it.  The plants take my attention because they are so much brighter.  Focus and exposure are good, and I like the aspect ratio you chose for the final image (I hate square images normally).', '2003-01-23 19:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(198954, 11203, 6328, '<td valign="top">too close for comfort.  should show the whole marker with some background perhaps?</td>', 'too close for comfort.  should show the whole marker with some background perhaps?', '2003-01-23 19:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(198955, 11218, 6328, '<td valign="top">Nice B&amp;W Shot.  Makes me thinks it''s a cold morning that you were out there taking this shot.  Nice crisp photo.  Nice job.</td>', 'Nice B&W Shot.  Makes me thinks it''s a cold morning that you were out there taking this shot.  Nice crisp photo.  Nice job.', '2003-01-23 19:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(198957, 11264, 6328, '<td valign="top">eh!  What can I say.  It''s another highway sign.  Like the various colors on the wall.</td>', 'eh!  What can I say.  It''s another highway sign.  Like the various colors on the wall.', '2003-01-23 19:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(198958, 11068, 1647, '<td valign="top">This is certainly a little different to most of this signs this week, and that in itself is refreshing.  Choosing to have the picture rotated so much is also interesting (my boring nature wouldn''t allow me to take such a shot!)  Unfortunately the sign doesn''t really draw my attention (except that it is the only focused point), but I certainly appreciate the attempt at something different.  Well done.</td>', 'This is certainly a little different to most of this signs this week, and that in itself is refreshing.  Choosing to have the picture rotated so much is also interesting (my boring nature wouldn''t allow me to take such a shot!)  Unfortunately the sign doesn''t really draw my attention (except that it is the only focused point), but I certainly appreciate the attempt at something different.  Well done.', '2003-01-23 19:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(198959, 11145, 2158, '<td valign="top">I really like this - so different from all the others.</td>', 'I really like this - so different from all the others.', '2003-01-23 19:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(198960, 11058, 6328, '<td valign="top">Cute and Funny.  Never saw a Duck Crossing Before.  Nice and Crisp colors, you even got good colors on the red stop sign, and the stars on the lights are good too.</td>', 'Cute and Funny.  Never saw a Duck Crossing Before.  Nice and Crisp colors, you even got good colors on the red stop sign, and the stars on the lights are good too.', '2003-01-23 19:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(198962, 11172, 1647, '<td valign="top">My very initial reaction was "that front sign is superimposed" - the reason is your red border line.  It merges with the red painted gutter and makes the signpost float.  I''d suggest a different border perhaps.  The focus on the sign is wonderful, the image is perhaps a tiny bit too dark but not my much.  Composition is good.</td>', 'My very initial reaction was "that front sign is superimposed" - the reason is your red border line.  It merges with the red painted gutter and makes the signpost float.  I''d suggest a different border perhaps.  The focus on the sign is wonderful, the image is perhaps a tiny bit too dark but not my much.  Composition is good.', '2003-01-23 19:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(198963, 11296, 6328, '<td valign="top">it''s just a picture</td>', 'it''s just a picture', '2003-01-23 19:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(198965, 11290, 6328, '<td valign="top">Like to know how you did this.  Looks erie.</td>', 'Like to know how you did this.  Looks erie.', '2003-01-23 19:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(198967, 11178, 6328, '<td valign="top">Certainly the most unusual sign I''ve ever seen.  The colors sure match the blue sky.</td>', 'Certainly the most unusual sign I''ve ever seen.  The colors sure match the blue sky.', '2003-01-23 19:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(198969, 11315, 1647, '<td valign="top">I like the border.  I think you cropped to close to the right edge of the white sign though - it almost touches the border at the top-right.  An equal gap on bottom, right and top of the sign would be good.  Colour and focus is good - short DOF really make the white sign the focal point for my eyes.  Of course it''s not really a road sign, but I guess you saw it on a road so I''ll let that one pass.</td>', 'I like the border.  I think you cropped to close to the right edge of the white sign though - it almost touches the border at the top-right.  An equal gap on bottom, right and top of the sign would be good.  Colour and focus is good - short DOF really make the white sign the focal point for my eyes.  Of course it''s not really a road sign, but I guess you saw it on a road so I''ll let that one pass.', '2003-01-23 19:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(198971, 11182, 6328, '<td valign="top">Ooh, nice job!  Cool!  I want to know how you did this. . .<br/>the blue/black pole is great, the white/black sign is great, and the building is great and then everything against that sky is marvelous! ! !</td>', 'Ooh, nice job!  Cool!  I want to know how you did this. . .the blue/black pole is great, the white/black sign is great, and the building is great and then everything against that sky is marvelous! ! !', '2003-01-23 19:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(198973, 11291, 6328, '<td valign="top">very thoughtful.  nicely clean and trimmed nails too!</td>', 'very thoughtful.  nicely clean and trimmed nails too!', '2003-01-23 19:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(198974, 11240, 6328, '<td valign="top">hmmm.  never thought of looking at anything from their point of view before.</td>', 'hmmm.  never thought of looking at anything from their point of view before.', '2003-01-23 19:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(198976, 11139, 6328, '<td valign="top">me thinks you should not have cut corners here.  against the blue sky, it''s nice.</td>', 'me thinks you should not have cut corners here.  against the blue sky, it''s nice.', '2003-01-23 19:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(198979, 11048, 6328, '<td valign="top">nice and crisp black and whites.</td>', 'nice and crisp black and whites.', '2003-01-23 19:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(198980, 11217, 6328, '<td valign="top">Looks confusing, busy, a lot to look at, all at once.</td>', 'Looks confusing, busy, a lot to look at, all at once.', '2003-01-23 19:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(198983, 11054, 6328, '<td valign="top">Wow.  A lot of hunter''s don''t like stop signs around here!  Beautiful Colors in the sky, nice blue on the mountains in the background, nice red on the stop sign with the [rust] bullet holes.  the flatbed on the right really makes a fine finish to this photo, nice job, well done.</td>', 'Wow.  A lot of hunter''s don''t like stop signs around here!  Beautiful Colors in the sky, nice blue on the mountains in the background, nice red on the stop sign with the [rust] bullet holes.  the flatbed on the right really makes a fine finish to this photo, nice job, well done.', '2003-01-23 19:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(198986, 11148, 2158, '<td valign="top">That out of focus car at the bottom detracts from an otherwise interesting photo.  I really like the black and white for this.</td>', 'That out of focus car at the bottom detracts from an otherwise interesting photo.  I really like the black and white for this.', '2003-01-23 19:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(198993, 11342, 2752, '<td valign="top">Nice angle..my monitor shows everything a little on the blurry side.  Maybe a tripod and remote would help.</td>', 'Nice angle..my monitor shows everything a little on the blurry side.  Maybe a tripod and remote would help.', '2003-01-23 20:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(198994, 11199, 4411, '<td valign="top">This could do with straightening up and the sign is probably too far to one side, but it''s still a good photo. Those clouds in the background are great. Nice work.</td>', 'This could do with straightening up and the sign is probably too far to one side, but it''s still a good photo. Those clouds in the background are great. Nice work.', '2003-01-23 20:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(198996, 11285, 2752, '<td valign="top">nice sharp stop sign..the contrast of the background is good.  I think if the sign were aff center it might have more impact.  I don\''t think the border helps(wrong shade of red)</td>', 'nice sharp stop sign..the contrast of the background is good.  I think if the sign were aff center it might have more impact.  I don\''t think the border helps(wrong shade of red)', '2003-01-23 20:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(198997, 11066, 2752, '<td valign="top">Nice study in yellow and black/brown...great perspective.</td>', 'Nice study in yellow and black/brown...great perspective.', '2003-01-23 20:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(198998, 11312, 2752, '<td valign="top">How unfriendly..great shot...good perspective and good job focusing.</td>', 'How unfriendly..great shot...good perspective and good job focusing.', '2003-01-23 20:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(198999, 11318, 2752, '<td valign="top">very clever shot..well positioned and great colors.</td>', 'very clever shot..well positioned and great colors.', '2003-01-23 20:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(199000, 11049, 4411, '<td valign="top">I like the fog which fits in with the sign very well. B&amp;W works well here too. I would have prefered a tighter crop to cut out at least the black patch in the foreground. Nice work.</td>', 'I like the fog which fits in with the sign very well. B&W works well here too. I would have prefered a tighter crop to cut out at least the black patch in the foreground. Nice work.', '2003-01-23 20:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(199001, 11049, 1717, '<td valign="top">love the mood of this photo...excellent work!</td>', 'love the mood of this photo...excellent work!', '2003-01-23 20:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(199002, 11114, 4793, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2003-01-23 21:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(199003, 11125, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, nicely focused.  Maybe a little tightly cropped.  But I do not take this to be a "road sign".  It is a business establishment sign.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, nicely focused.  Maybe a little tightly cropped.  But I do not take this to be a "road sign".  It is a business establishment sign.', '2003-01-23 21:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(199004, 11342, 1717, '<td valign="top">very cool!  love the boldness!</td>', 'very cool!  love the boldness!', '2003-01-23 21:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(199005, 11313, 4648, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  Definitely meets the challenge.  What kind of grove is that?  I wish you had gotten more of the sky in to offset the amount of grass on the bottom that really couldn''t be cropped off.  That would have lightened the photo up a little too.  But it''s still a really nice photo.  Worth a 7 any day.</td>', 'Nice photo.  Definitely meets the challenge.  What kind of grove is that?  I wish you had gotten more of the sky in to offset the amount of grass on the bottom that really couldn''t be cropped off.  That would have lightened the photo up a little too.  But it''s still a really nice photo.  Worth a 7 any day.', '2003-01-23 21:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(199007, 11335, 1717, '<td valign="top">love the shadows and light...pretty halo effect on their heads.</td>', 'love the shadows and light...pretty halo effect on their heads.', '2003-01-23 21:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(199008, 11145, 1717, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors...love that green!!  well done!!</td>', 'beautiful colors...love that green!!  well done!!', '2003-01-23 21:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(199009, 11333, 1717, '<td valign="top">very beautiful....special filter or photoshop plug-in used to get this effect?  i like it!</td>', 'very beautiful....special filter or photoshop plug-in used to get this effect?  i like it!', '2003-01-23 21:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(199010, 11068, 4648, '<td valign="top">The tilt to the photo ruins it.  Sorry.  This is just my opinion.</td>', 'The tilt to the photo ruins it.  Sorry.  This is just my opinion.', '2003-01-23 21:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(199011, 11264, 4648, '<td valign="top">A really nice photo.  Sometime I feel like this:  going in two different directions at the same time.  Signs like this are confusing.  The photo is right up there.  I love the color and texture of the stones in the over pass.   Decent overall focus.  Wish the sky wasn''t so white - washed out or hazy?.  Still a really good photo and clearly meets the challenge.</td>', 'A really nice photo.  Sometime I feel like this:  going in two different directions at the same time.  Signs like this are confusing.  The photo is right up there.  I love the color and texture of the stones in the over pass.   Decent overall focus.  Wish the sky wasn''t so white - washed out or hazy?.  Still a really good photo and clearly meets the challenge.', '2003-01-23 21:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(199013, 11252, 4648, '<td valign="top">this is an advertisement sign rather than a "road sign":    A lot have done this this week and it''s a shame.  This is a really good and clear photo.  But it doesn''t meet the challenge in my opinion and that''s what this is all about.  I hate to cut the score but to be fair to those who took "road signs" must.</td>', 'this is an advertisement sign rather than a "road sign":    A lot have done this this week and it''s a shame.  This is a really good and clear photo.  But it doesn''t meet the challenge in my opinion and that''s what this is all about.  I hate to cut the score but to be fair to those who took "road signs" must.', '2003-01-23 21:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(199014, 11300, 4648, '<td valign="top">Pleasantly surprised at the quality of this night shot.  Very clear and sharp.  Love the sky.  The sign on the other side of the street says it is a pedestrian crossing.  Wonder which sign is correct?  Would love to see a daytime photo of this place.  Well done and really deserves a 9.</td>', 'Pleasantly surprised at the quality of this night shot.  Very clear and sharp.  Love the sky.  The sign on the other side of the street says it is a pedestrian crossing.  Wonder which sign is correct?  Would love to see a daytime photo of this place.  Well done and really deserves a 9.', '2003-01-23 21:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(199015, 11098, 4648, '<td valign="top">Not a good motion photo at all, in my opinion</td>', 'Not a good motion photo at all, in my opinion', '2003-01-23 21:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(199016, 11131, 1647, '<td valign="top">Funny title.  I like you composition - the sign is well placed (perhaps just a little close to the tallest building under it),  The shot of the city is an interesting one - lots of variety and the clouds of smoke / steam add an industrial feel to it.  My biggest negative is that the sign is a little dark - I wonder if using a flash would have helped illuminate the sign since it was backlit by the sun.  Well done.</td>', 'Funny title.  I like you composition - the sign is well placed (perhaps just a little close to the tallest building under it),  The shot of the city is an interesting one - lots of variety and the clouds of smoke / steam add an industrial feel to it.  My biggest negative is that the sign is a little dark - I wonder if using a flash would have helped illuminate the sign since it was backlit by the sun.  Well done.', '2003-01-23 21:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(199018, 11061, 1647, '<td valign="top">Colour is great in this photo.  I also like the composition - the road and the array of signs (thankfully all the same colour scheme).  Does the mud in the grass imply that a few people miss the corner. :-)</td>', 'Colour is great in this photo.  I also like the composition - the road and the array of signs (thankfully all the same colour scheme).  Does the mud in the grass imply that a few people miss the corner. :-)', '2003-01-23 21:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(199020, 11297, 1647, '<td valign="top">No dogs with detachable heads allowed huh?  The sign is perhaps a little too dark (although you''d probably have to artificially light it to overcome that).  Composition is pretty good - maybe too much sky but in a way I like the balance...  it creates a sense of openness and space.</td>', 'No dogs with detachable heads allowed huh?  The sign is perhaps a little too dark (although you''d probably have to artificially light it to overcome that).  Composition is pretty good - maybe too much sky but in a way I like the balance...  it creates a sense of openness and space.', '2003-01-23 21:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(199021, 11180, 4648, '<td valign="top">So, where''s the "road sign"?  I see the back of a couple, but the park appears to be your subject.  Unless you are calling the round sign in the air a "road sign", and that''s stretching it.  Nice night time photo.  A little soft on the focus.  The stop light is a bit much, but otherwise a decent photo.  Worth a 6.</td>', 'So, where''s the "road sign"?  I see the back of a couple, but the park appears to be your subject.  Unless you are calling the round sign in the air a "road sign", and that''s stretching it.  Nice night time photo.  A little soft on the focus.  The stop light is a bit much, but otherwise a decent photo.  Worth a 6.', '2003-01-23 21:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(199022, 11051, 1647, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately none of the signs really grab my attention.  The fountain is too nice and the leftmost streetlight too stunning - I keep looking at them.  I might have tried to crop out the flare in the top right corner of the image, but it''s not a big problem.  Exposure is good and focus is very strong for a long exposure like this.</td>', 'Unfortunately none of the signs really grab my attention.  The fountain is too nice and the leftmost streetlight too stunning - I keep looking at them.  I might have tried to crop out the flare in the top right corner of the image, but it''s not a big problem.  Exposure is good and focus is very strong for a long exposure like this.', '2003-01-23 21:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(199023, 11309, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice photo - although I''m surprised by the sign.  Most (if not all) of the types of truck shown would weigh more than 3T unladen - especially the semi which probably weighs 8-10T.  Anyway, back to the photo...  Nice composition and focus is pretty good (perhaps just a little blury on the bridge).  Colours are good and the sign is well positioned to grab my attention.  Good work.</td>', 'Nice photo - although I''m surprised by the sign.  Most (if not all) of the types of truck shown would weigh more than 3T unladen - especially the semi which probably weighs 8-10T.  Anyway, back to the photo...  Nice composition and focus is pretty good (perhaps just a little blury on the bridge).  Colours are good and the sign is well positioned to grab my attention.  Good work.', '2003-01-23 21:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(199025, 11231, 4648, '<td valign="top">Personally would like to have you pulled back and showing the photo all the way to the ground so I can tell exactly what I''m looking at.  It''s a nice photo as is, but I can''t really tell what it''s a photo of.  Still Worth a 5, but more gives better possibilities.</td>', 'Personally would like to have you pulled back and showing the photo all the way to the ground so I can tell exactly what I''m looking at.  It''s a nice photo as is, but I can''t really tell what it''s a photo of.  Still Worth a 5, but more gives better possibilities.', '2003-01-23 21:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(199026, 11085, 1647, '<td valign="top">Composition is good for the suggested target.  In some ways the giveway sign is distracting - since it''s a more traditional sign it fights for attention.  I think this would have been more effective with no other signs in the shot - although I realise that probably wasn''t possible without losing the road (unless you hid the giveway sign behind the solar panel)</td>', 'Composition is good for the suggested target.  In some ways the giveway sign is distracting - since it''s a more traditional sign it fights for attention.  I think this would have been more effective with no other signs in the shot - although I realise that probably wasn''t possible without losing the road (unless you hid the giveway sign behind the solar panel)', '2003-01-23 21:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(199028, 11291, 1647, '<td valign="top">I think the sign needed more light - my eyes are drawn to the fingers initially.  I like the composition and black and white was the correct choice I think.</td>', 'I think the sign needed more light - my eyes are drawn to the fingers initially.  I like the composition and black and white was the correct choice I think.', '2003-01-23 21:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(199029, 11324, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful "or else" photo.  Nice composition with execellent execution.  Love the color of the water.  Just a great photo, technically well done, and meets the challenge clearly.  Worth an 8 to me.</td>', 'Beautiful "or else" photo.  Nice composition with execellent execution.  Love the color of the water.  Just a great photo, technically well done, and meets the challenge clearly.  Worth an 8 to me.', '2003-01-23 21:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(199030, 11218, 1647, '<td valign="top">It''s a lovely building in the background, but the tree and sign fight with each other too much.</td>', 'It''s a lovely building in the background, but the tree and sign fight with each other too much.', '2003-01-23 21:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(199031, 11122, 4648, '<td valign="top">Need more of the sign.  Should have pulled back a bit.  Sign also out of focus and shooting further away would have cleared that up, and still gotten the moon in.  Would have been a good shot and met the challenge.  As is I can''t score it more than a 4.</td>', 'Need more of the sign.  Should have pulled back a bit.  Sign also out of focus and shooting further away would have cleared that up, and still gotten the moon in.  Would have been a good shot and met the challenge.  As is I can''t score it more than a 4.', '2003-01-23 21:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(199033, 11300, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice work - I like the feel to this photo.  You were lucky to get a wet road to photograph.  The sign grabs my attention since it is well lit in the photo.  The border is appropriate and frames the photo well without distracting me.  Great work.</td>', 'Nice work - I like the feel to this photo.  You were lucky to get a wet road to photograph.  The sign grabs my attention since it is well lit in the photo.  The border is appropriate and frames the photo well without distracting me.  Great work.', '2003-01-23 21:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(199034, 11298, 4648, '<td valign="top">Funny sign and good photo.  Meets the challenge well.  Love it, especially the sign.  Great job.</td>', 'Funny sign and good photo.  Meets the challenge well.  Love it, especially the sign.  Great job.', '2003-01-23 22:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(199035, 11313, 1647, '<td valign="top">This photo is ok but doesn''t really "grab" me.  Perhaps it would have been better taken further away so that the cows weren''t so small compared to the sign.</td>', 'This photo is ok but doesn''t really "grab" me.  Perhaps it would have been better taken further away so that the cows weren''t so small compared to the sign.', '2003-01-23 22:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(199036, 11272, 4648, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge well.  The redish tone is personally not appealing to me.  Decent photo otherwise.</td>', 'Meets the challenge well.  The redish tone is personally not appealing to me.  Decent photo otherwise.', '2003-01-23 22:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(199037, 11328, 4648, '<td valign="top">Looks more like an ocean sign rather than a "road sign".  Otherwise the photo is a really good one.  I especially like the different colors in the water.  Is this in the water on on the tip of the land.  I''ll have to give you the benefit of the doubt and assume it''s on the land, in which case it meets the challenge.  Anyway it''s a really nich photo, technically and appeal wise.  Nice one.  7</td>', 'Looks more like an ocean sign rather than a "road sign".  Otherwise the photo is a really good one.  I especially like the different colors in the water.  Is this in the water on on the tip of the land.  I''ll have to give you the benefit of the doubt and assume it''s on the land, in which case it meets the challenge.  Anyway it''s a really nich photo, technically and appeal wise.  Nice one.  7', '2003-01-23 22:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(199040, 11161, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice composition - and what a wierd sign.</td>', 'Nice composition - and what a wierd sign.', '2003-01-23 22:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(199041, 11150, 1647, '<td valign="top">As a roadsign it doesn''t interest me, however I find the mini parked under the tree kind of cute - with some creative editing that could become a cool photo.  Technically though your photo is ok - composition is good, the image is perhaps a little overexposed or too bright though.</td>', 'As a roadsign it doesn''t interest me, however I find the mini parked under the tree kind of cute - with some creative editing that could become a cool photo.  Technically though your photo is ok - composition is good, the image is perhaps a little overexposed or too bright though.', '2003-01-23 22:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(199042, 11144, 1647, '<td valign="top">The photo is perhaps smaller than it needed to be and a little soft (levels in photoshop might have put some life into it.</td>', 'The photo is perhaps smaller than it needed to be and a little soft (levels in photoshop might have put some life into it.', '2003-01-23 22:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(199045, 11066, 1647, '<td valign="top">I like the colouring however the white snow (?) on the road is a little too bright - perhaps try toning this down a little.  Composition is good - especially the perspective on the sign.</td>', 'I like the colouring however the white snow (?) on the road is a little too bright - perhaps try toning this down a little.  Composition is good - especially the perspective on the sign.', '2003-01-23 22:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(199047, 11150, 6328, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors.  Color of water mixes well with the color of sky.  nice composition.</td>', 'Beautiful colors.  Color of water mixes well with the color of sky.  nice composition.', '2003-01-23 22:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(199048, 11159, 6328, '<td valign="top">Wow - so many signs!  And look at all the color.  That pirate flag up above looks great, the yellow light by the taxicab, too bad you couldn''t include the yellow cafe sign on the left a little more. . .</td>', 'Wow - so many signs!  And look at all the color.  That pirate flag up above looks great, the yellow light by the taxicab, too bad you couldn''t include the yellow cafe sign on the left a little more. . .', '2003-01-23 22:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(199049, 11134, 6328, '<td valign="top">some imagination to get this shot.  very well done.</td>', 'some imagination to get this shot.  very well done.', '2003-01-23 22:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(199051, 11223, 6328, '<td valign="top">sorry, doesn''t tell me anything.  doesn''t do anything for me.</td>', 'sorry, doesn''t tell me anything.  doesn''t do anything for me.', '2003-01-23 22:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(199052, 11075, 6328, '<td valign="top">Wow!</td>', 'Wow!', '2003-01-23 22:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(199054, 11266, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and colour.  The image is perhaps a little too soft for my preference although I''m not sure whether sharpening it might help or hinder.  The mile marker is well positioned in the frame and I love the way the road disappears - it makes me want to know where it goes.</td>', 'Nice composition and colour.  The image is perhaps a little too soft for my preference although I''m not sure whether sharpening it might help or hinder.  The mile marker is well positioned in the frame and I love the way the road disappears - it makes me want to know where it goes.', '2003-01-23 22:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(199055, 11281, 6328, '<td valign="top">nice variation, very thoughtful.  nice color against the yellow schoolbus</td>', 'nice variation, very thoughtful.  nice color against the yellow schoolbus', '2003-01-23 22:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(199058, 11164, 6328, '<td valign="top">Not even in the summer!  Make you think about it when you see this sign.  No matter where you look in the photo, your eye comes right back to the sign.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Not even in the summer!  Make you think about it when you see this sign.  No matter where you look in the photo, your eye comes right back to the sign.  Nicely done.', '2003-01-23 22:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
