(199069, 11063, 5999, '<td valign="top">Good composition, good crop, could be a bit brighter maybe? Great photograph.</td>', 'Good composition, good crop, could be a bit brighter maybe? Great photograph.', '2003-01-23 22:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(199070, 11118, 1031, '<td valign="top">...and toad hunters?</td>', '...and toad hunters?', '2003-01-23 23:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(199071, 11290, 1647, '<td valign="top">I think the sign is placed a little too far to the edge of the picture - it''s supposed to be the theme this week.  The focus on the sign also seems to be a little bit off.</td>', 'I think the sign is placed a little too far to the edge of the picture - it''s supposed to be the theme this week.  The focus on the sign also seems to be a little bit off.', '2003-01-23 23:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(199072, 11256, 3306, '<td valign="top">Good  shot. Very nicely staged. I like the colors and the subject. One of my favorites this week. Good job.</td>', 'Good  shot. Very nicely staged. I like the colors and the subject. One of my favorites this week. Good job.', '2003-01-23 23:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(199073, 11320, 1647, '<td valign="top">It looks like some tag team photography going on here - congrats.  That also looks like a good camera in his hands.  I love the humour of the sign in this shot - very dry.  Composition is pretty good however the top edge is a little uncomfortable - difficult to crop with the top of the sign crooked.  I wonder if rotating the image to crop along the sign edge would have worked or looked silly.</td>', 'It looks like some tag team photography going on here - congrats.  That also looks like a good camera in his hands.  I love the humour of the sign in this shot - very dry.  Composition is pretty good however the top edge is a little uncomfortable - difficult to crop with the top of the sign crooked.  I wonder if rotating the image to crop along the sign edge would have worked or looked silly.', '2003-01-23 23:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(199074, 11345, 1647, '<td valign="top">This photo looks a little over exposed - the black isn''t very black and the red looks washed out.  Also having part of each work hidden is a little uncomfortable.  Perhaps you were trying to create the illusion that you weren''t stopping (ie: were moving past the sign) however this thought didn''t occur to me for quite a long time (ie: several viewings) so it''s not obvious.</td>', 'This photo looks a little over exposed - the black isn''t very black and the red looks washed out.  Also having part of each work hidden is a little uncomfortable.  Perhaps you were trying to create the illusion that you weren''t stopping (ie: were moving past the sign) however this thought didn''t occur to me for quite a long time (ie: several viewings) so it''s not obvious.', '2003-01-23 23:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(199075, 11059, 1031, '<td valign="top">Has the look of a trophy to me...</td>', 'Has the look of a trophy to me...', '2003-01-23 23:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(199076, 11318, 1031, '<td valign="top">If the contrail was at any other angle it would be a distraction, but it works as you got it. Interesting that the top sign is the same shape as a baseball home-plate.</td>', 'If the contrail was at any other angle it would be a distraction, but it works as you got it. Interesting that the top sign is the same shape as a baseball home-plate.', '2003-01-23 23:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(199077, 11132, 1031, '<td valign="top">Odd lighting seems to work OK anyway...I like the way the type looks spot-lit.</td>', 'Odd lighting seems to work OK anyway...I like the way the type looks spot-lit.', '2003-01-23 23:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(199078, 11314, 1647, '<td valign="top">This image is fairly good but it just doesn''t grab my attention.  Composition is fairly good, although perhaps cropped a little too tight on the left edge.  I wonder if there was someway of including the windy road - as hinted by the sign.  Also the image is perhaps a little too dark - but only by a fraction.</td>', 'This image is fairly good but it just doesn''t grab my attention.  Composition is fairly good, although perhaps cropped a little too tight on the left edge.  I wonder if there was someway of including the windy road - as hinted by the sign.  Also the image is perhaps a little too dark - but only by a fraction.', '2003-01-23 23:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(199080, 11298, 6073, '<td valign="top">That\''s the funniest sign I have seen yet.</td>', 'That\''s the funniest sign I have seen yet.', '2003-01-23 23:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(199081, 11066, 1031, '<td valign="top">The roadway looks radioactive...</td>', 'The roadway looks radioactive...', '2003-01-23 23:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(199082, 11070, 1647, '<td valign="top">Ok, I recognise the link to the other challenge but I don''t think that should really count towards votes much so I''ll ignore it.  Composition is fairly good, focus is quite good but the photo really isn''t interesting.</td>', 'Ok, I recognise the link to the other challenge but I don''t think that should really count towards votes much so I''ll ignore it.  Composition is fairly good, focus is quite good but the photo really isn''t interesting.', '2003-01-23 23:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(199083, 11133, 5964, '<td valign="top">Yikes, that is cold! This shot has really good focus, and I love the originality, but I am not really drawn to the signs in this shot more to the scenic back drop/road/cars. I think I would have cropped the whole road out of this shot and kept with the 2 signs as this would create more visual attention to them . With a crop like that it would tend to follow the 3rds a bit more also.  7.</td>', 'Yikes, that is cold! This shot has really good focus, and I love the originality, but I am not really drawn to the signs in this shot more to the scenic back drop/road/cars. I think I would have cropped the whole road out of this shot and kept with the 2 signs as this would create more visual attention to them . With a crop like that it would tend to follow the 3rds a bit more also.  7.', '2003-01-23 23:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(199084, 11144, 1031, '<td valign="top">I think I''d have tried to increase the contrast -- especially with so small an image it would help bring out more detail.</td>', 'I think I''d have tried to increase the contrast -- especially with so small an image it would help bring out more detail.', '2003-01-23 23:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(199085, 11260, 6073, '<td valign="top">Great framing &amp; border combo.  Well done.</td>', 'Great framing & border combo.  Well done.', '2003-01-23 23:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(199086, 11138, 1031, '<td valign="top">Although it''s well shot and interestingly-lit, I don''t think you need nearly so much foreground. Since the subjects are so near the top, I''d try a severe crop (1/3 to 1/2 off the bottom) and make it a more panoramic shot. That should also accentuate the look of speed.</td>', 'Although it''s well shot and interestingly-lit, I don''t think you need nearly so much foreground. Since the subjects are so near the top, I''d try a severe crop (1/3 to 1/2 off the bottom) and make it a more panoramic shot. That should also accentuate the look of speed.', '2003-01-23 23:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(199087, 11197, 1031, '<td valign="top">You''ll have to go back there for this week''s challenge!</td>', 'You''ll have to go back there for this week''s challenge!', '2003-01-23 23:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
