(199112, 11092, 811, '<td valign="top">You reckon????  Good use of depth of field -- the sign is sharp and is accentuated by the background being just slightly blurry.  The road entering at the bottom adn curving upwards is also effective.  I think if you could have shot/cropped it so that it wasn''t so tight on the left, it might have been a little more effective for me.  Still an awesome shot.</td>', 'You reckon????  Good use of depth of field -- the sign is sharp and is accentuated by the background being just slightly blurry.  The road entering at the bottom adn curving upwards is also effective.  I think if you could have shot/cropped it so that it wasn''t so tight on the left, it might have been a little more effective for me.  Still an awesome shot.', '2003-01-24 00:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(199113, 11277, 5793, '<td valign="top">This is very whitty.  I know winter right now and the sund doesn''t cooperate all the time.  It just would''ve been nice to have this bee just little brighter/pop harder.  Overall, nice work.</td>', 'This is very whitty.  I know winter right now and the sund doesn''t cooperate all the time.  It just would''ve been nice to have this bee just little brighter/pop harder.  Overall, nice work.', '2003-01-24 00:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
