(199122, 11066, 5793, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this image.  Interesting things are all in very "comfortable" places in the frame and negative space is utilized quite well.  However, the exposure is too hot.  Auto-Bracketing is a feature many digi cameras are now equipped with and is hand for when it''s very cold like this I assume.  Other than that.  Good Job!</td>', 'I like the composition of this image.  Interesting things are all in very "comfortable" places in the frame and negative space is utilized quite well.  However, the exposure is too hot.  Auto-Bracketing is a feature many digi cameras are now equipped with and is hand for when it''s very cold like this I assume.  Other than that.  Good Job!', '2003-01-24 00:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(199123, 11244, 4813, '<td valign="top">I am glad you went with black and white.  It works well</td>', 'I am glad you went with black and white.  It works well', '2003-01-24 00:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
