(199173, 11054, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors in the sky, and how the details of the sign shows, bu the thing (a railroad car or something) is almost silhouetted.  It sets up a nice contrast.  Good humor, as well.</td>', 'I really like the colors in the sky, and how the details of the sign shows, bu the thing (a railroad car or something) is almost silhouetted.  It sets up a nice contrast.  Good humor, as well.', '2003-01-24 01:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
