(199363, 11206, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nicely taken shot!  Color, exposure and framing are all very nice.  That''s a neat sign you found, more detailed than most.   You would have gotten a 10 for a duck in the frame (yes, I do ask for the moon and the stars....) In this case, you provided the moon, that''s good enough for an 8.  (I''m being silly.)  Swash</td>', 'Very nicely taken shot!  Color, exposure and framing are all very nice.  That''s a neat sign you found, more detailed than most.   You would have gotten a 10 for a duck in the frame (yes, I do ask for the moon and the stars....) In this case, you provided the moon, that''s good enough for an 8.  (I''m being silly.)  Swash', '2003-01-24 12:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(199364, 11118, 1005, '<td valign="top">That is just a killer sign!  I like the extra purple, makes for a dramatic sky (and it didn''t hurt the caution signs either).  Technical issues..none, very good focus, framing and exposure.  I just plain like this shot.  9 Swash</td>', 'That is just a killer sign!  I like the extra purple, makes for a dramatic sky (and it didn''t hurt the caution signs either).  Technical issues..none, very good focus, framing and exposure.  I just plain like this shot.  9 Swash', '2003-01-24 12:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
