(199551, 11137, 6328, '<td valign="top">It''s almost like you''ve said it all too!  Here comes the winner. . .<br/>All the colour of the confetti, the people, the signs.</td>', 'It''s almost like you''ve said it all too!  Here comes the winner. . .All the colour of the confetti, the people, the signs.', '2003-01-24 18:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(199554, 11181, 6328, '<td valign="top">no comment</td>', 'no comment', '2003-01-24 18:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(199556, 11188, 6328, '<td valign="top">I could just imagine what''s coming down on top of me from this sign!  Really different, indeed.</td>', 'I could just imagine what''s coming down on top of me from this sign!  Really different, indeed.', '2003-01-24 18:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(199565, 11199, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very well done shot!  The clouds add a very nice dramatic feel to this shot.  Focus seem very good.  Framing is interesting...but rather than the field included, I would have preferred the road (Moon and Stars request - a cow or sheep on the road).  Suggested alternate title - Cow Following Sheep Crossing (har har)  8 Swash</td>', 'Very well done shot!  The clouds add a very nice dramatic feel to this shot.  Focus seem very good.  Framing is interesting...but rather than the field included, I would have preferred the road (Moon and Stars request - a cow or sheep on the road).  Suggested alternate title - Cow Following Sheep Crossing (har har)  8 Swash', '2003-01-24 18:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(199567, 11325, 1005, '<td valign="top">This has quite a bit of WOW factor for me!  The speed limit sign is dramatically white, even though it''s dirty (impressive!).  The sunset sky has wonderful tones from light blue to azure, very nice.  The sillhouetted jet is a great touch (we want them to go fast! joke)  Score upgrade from 8 to 9 (wow factor again!)  Swash</td>', 'This has quite a bit of WOW factor for me!  The speed limit sign is dramatically white, even though it''s dirty (impressive!).  The sunset sky has wonderful tones from light blue to azure, very nice.  The sillhouetted jet is a great touch (we want them to go fast! joke)  Score upgrade from 8 to 9 (wow factor again!)  Swash', '2003-01-24 18:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(199579, 11244, 2752, '<td valign="top">Simply great...great composition and use of black and white.  The placement of the snow around the word,stop, very dramatic.  One of my few 10''s .</td>', 'Simply great...great composition and use of black and white.  The placement of the snow around the word,stop, very dramatic.  One of my few 10''s .', '2003-01-24 19:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(199586, 11083, 2752, '<td valign="top">Great perspective and dof..the cross rock fencing and vehicals, the trees and bottom of sign balance the piece very nicely..I take it only aritficial insemination is used in your part of the world?</td>', 'Great perspective and dof..the cross rock fencing and vehicals, the trees and bottom of sign balance the piece very nicely..I take it only aritficial insemination is used in your part of the world?', '2003-01-24 19:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(199590, 11240, 2752, '<td valign="top">The perspective is very good..I like your angle shot..only suggestion would be that the glare on the top sign is distracting.</td>', 'The perspective is very good..I like your angle shot..only suggestion would be that the glare on the top sign is distracting.', '2003-01-24 19:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(199593, 11092, 1005, '<td valign="top">I know I commented this!  Very good shot!  Great focus, color and I esp. like the framing.  Including the road adds context helpful for the viewer.  I like that!  (Gosh, I wish I could remember all the great stuff I wrote the first time...)  Very good shot.  Strong 8.  Swash</td>', 'I know I commented this!  Very good shot!  Great focus, color and I esp. like the framing.  Including the road adds context helpful for the viewer.  I like that!  (Gosh, I wish I could remember all the great stuff I wrote the first time...)  Very good shot.  Strong 8.  Swash', '2003-01-24 19:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(199594, 11060, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wicked and very eye catchy!  I really like the sign and diagonally the  lower right half (does that make sense?).  The light rays with the trees behind them is simply spectacular!  Less than fond of the other half that is totally blown out, but I''m sure that was a trade off and I can accept that.   Visually WOW!!!  9 Swash</td>', 'Wicked and very eye catchy!  I really like the sign and diagonally the  lower right half (does that make sense?).  The light rays with the trees behind them is simply spectacular!  Less than fond of the other half that is totally blown out, but I''m sure that was a trade off and I can accept that.   Visually WOW!!!  9 Swash', '2003-01-24 19:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(199595, 11125, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very bright and colorful.  Good focus, love the colors.  It seems very tightly cropped, was this to exclude bad things?  If possible, a tad looser crop might have been nice.   8 Swash</td>', 'Very bright and colorful.  Good focus, love the colors.  It seems very tightly cropped, was this to exclude bad things?  If possible, a tad looser crop might have been nice.   8 Swash', '2003-01-24 19:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(199597, 11333, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, love the old house and the tree background.  Usually, I like foreground stuff, but this might be a little too much of it.  The sepia tones are very effective.  <br/>8 Swash</td>', 'Cool shot, love the old house and the tree background.  Usually, I like foreground stuff, but this might be a little too much of it.  The sepia tones are very effective.  8 Swash', '2003-01-24 19:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(199598, 11167, 1005, '<td valign="top">I like this angle, I might have even liked it better were it a stronger angle, but maybe less personally insulting were it pointed away from you.  Very good focus.  Framing works well.  Background is nice.  8 Swash</td>', 'I like this angle, I might have even liked it better were it a stronger angle, but maybe less personally insulting were it pointed away from you.  Very good focus.  Framing works well.  Background is nice.  8 Swash', '2003-01-24 19:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(199600, 11182, 675, '<td valign="top">the best</td>', 'the best', '2003-01-24 19:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(199602, 11314, 1005, '<td valign="top">Simply gorgeous shot!  I esp. like that you included the curvy road with the sign.  (Now a curvy woman would have been better!  just joking!)  Lovely color, great reflections off the lake.  Focus is good.  Very strong 9.  Swash</td>', 'Simply gorgeous shot!  I esp. like that you included the curvy road with the sign.  (Now a curvy woman would have been better!  just joking!)  Lovely color, great reflections off the lake.  Focus is good.  Very strong 9.  Swash', '2003-01-24 19:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(199603, 11291, 4815, '<td valign="top">A cute pic! Good sense of humour and a nice creative touch. B&amp;W works well for this shot. I like the close cropping, too. The knuckles are a tad bright compared to the other flesh tones for my taste. A good foto.</td>', 'A cute pic! Good sense of humour and a nice creative touch. B&W works well for this shot. I like the close cropping, too. The knuckles are a tad bright compared to the other flesh tones for my taste. A good foto.', '2003-01-24 19:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(199604, 11156, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is a favorite!  The sign is very clear, great color and the tree as part of the background is fantastic!  Cute title, too.  While I do prefer sign shots that include the "action" of the sign (in this case, a type of dead end road), but this is so very nice, I just don''t care that''s not included.  10 Swash</td>', 'This is a favorite!  The sign is very clear, great color and the tree as part of the background is fantastic!  Cute title, too.  While I do prefer sign shots that include the "action" of the sign (in this case, a type of dead end road), but this is so very nice, I just don''t care that''s not included.  10 Swash', '2003-01-24 19:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(199605, 11087, 1005, '<td valign="top">Funniest sign in the challenge!  Focus is good, color seems about right, cropping is just O.K., but as I don''t know what you excluded, there might have been a great reason for being this tight.  Too bad it was a cloudy day, this might have won with better weather.  I do like the tree in the background and I''m not going to let your lack of weather control affect the score I''m giving you.  10!! Swash</td>', 'Funniest sign in the challenge!  Focus is good, color seems about right, cropping is just O.K., but as I don''t know what you excluded, there might have been a great reason for being this tight.  Too bad it was a cloudy day, this might have won with better weather.  I do like the tree in the background and I''m not going to let your lack of weather control affect the score I''m giving you.  10!! Swash', '2003-01-24 20:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(199606, 11170, 4815, '<td valign="top">The crisp bright color scheme is very eyecatching. Extremely graphic look. The impact of the sign seems relatively secondary to the other visual elements. In otherwords the gratings, shadows and brick texture steal the show. An alluring shot just the same.</td>', 'The crisp bright color scheme is very eyecatching. Extremely graphic look. The impact of the sign seems relatively secondary to the other visual elements. In otherwords the gratings, shadows and brick texture steal the show. An alluring shot just the same.', '2003-01-24 20:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(199607, 11153, 2158, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, pity it''s not a bit sharper.</td>', 'Nice idea, pity it''s not a bit sharper.', '2003-01-24 20:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(199608, 11132, 4815, '<td valign="top">The monochromatic theme of this image has lots of power. The rough and ready nature of both the sign and truck add lots of character to the foto. The limited DOF certainly focuses attention on the sign. Good job.</td>', 'The monochromatic theme of this image has lots of power. The rough and ready nature of both the sign and truck add lots of character to the foto. The limited DOF certainly focuses attention on the sign. Good job.', '2003-01-24 20:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(199609, 11221, 4815, '<td valign="top">Great sense of humour. I like the bit of blue to compliment the overwhelming yellow. Nice tight shot. The nail shadow really adds value to your image. Good go.</td>', 'Great sense of humour. I like the bit of blue to compliment the overwhelming yellow. Nice tight shot. The nail shadow really adds value to your image. Good go.', '2003-01-24 20:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(199610, 11111, 4815, '<td valign="top">Love the barren dismal mood of this image. The Battered wall and cold snow contrast very well to the bright signage. Perfect composition, DOF and lighting. Good location shot that makes a statement</td>', 'Love the barren dismal mood of this image. The Battered wall and cold snow contrast very well to the bright signage. Perfect composition, DOF and lighting. Good location shot that makes a statement', '2003-01-24 20:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(199612, 11312, 4815, '<td valign="top">The sweep of the horizontal lines go well with the panoramic format. The greenery softens the edge of modern age. If the viewpoint was a little lower perhaps the white portions of the sign would not blend in with the curb but contrast against the plants instead ( a small suggestion). What do you think of placing the sign a bit more off center? Otherwise a good solid shot.</td>', 'The sweep of the horizontal lines go well with the panoramic format. The greenery softens the edge of modern age. If the viewpoint was a little lower perhaps the white portions of the sign would not blend in with the curb but contrast against the plants instead ( a small suggestion). What do you think of placing the sign a bit more off center? Otherwise a good solid shot.', '2003-01-24 20:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(199613, 11228, 4815, '<td valign="top">Great urban comment. The shopping cart in the puddle steals the show. I also like the brick wall texture and the freezer rust. Box shapes throughout the image pull the whole show together. Well done.</td>', 'Great urban comment. The shopping cart in the puddle steals the show. I also like the brick wall texture and the freezer rust. Box shapes throughout the image pull the whole show together. Well done.', '2003-01-24 20:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(199615, 11253, 4815, '<td valign="top">Spooky stuff. A bit sinister for my taste. But what the hey, it''s a different style with it''s own speaks. Like a bittersweet licorice kiss. Grows on you after a while. Unusual and inspiring.</td>', 'Spooky stuff. A bit sinister for my taste. But what the hey, it''s a different style with it''s own speaks. Like a bittersweet licorice kiss. Grows on you after a while. Unusual and inspiring.', '2003-01-24 20:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(199616, 11260, 4815, '<td valign="top">Great border that compliments the image well. Nice tight graphic shot. Vibrant colour. Technically good image.</td>', 'Great border that compliments the image well. Nice tight graphic shot. Vibrant colour. Technically good image.', '2003-01-24 20:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(199618, 11297, 4815, '<td valign="top">Good sense of humour.  As a suggestion perhaps a bit more sea in your shot to emphasize the sea dog quality. The lagre area of sky tones are nice and tend to draw the attention to the background instead of the sign and sea. I guess you need a 20 ft ladder to work the vantage point here. Not a bad shot</td>', 'Good sense of humour.  As a suggestion perhaps a bit more sea in your shot to emphasize the sea dog quality. The lagre area of sky tones are nice and tend to draw the attention to the background instead of the sign and sea. I guess you need a 20 ft ladder to work the vantage point here. Not a bad shot', '2003-01-24 20:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(199622, 11243, 4815, '<td valign="top">Very funny! Good simple graphic shot. Concept executed well. The tire texture and very bright pavement dominate the image. Overcast or shadow conditions would yield less harsh tones and allow more visual voice to the sign perhaps ( just a thought ). Nice shot.</td>', 'Very funny! Good simple graphic shot. Concept executed well. The tire texture and very bright pavement dominate the image. Overcast or shadow conditions would yield less harsh tones and allow more visual voice to the sign perhaps ( just a thought ). Nice shot.', '2003-01-24 20:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(199633, 11054, 543, '<td valign="top">Brilliant work.  You''ve balanced the exposure between the sign and the sky perfectly, and the wheel on the flatcar is a nice counterpoint to the sign.  I generally dislike square crops, but I think this would be even better with the R side cropped away.</td>', 'Brilliant work.  You''ve balanced the exposure between the sign and the sky perfectly, and the wheel on the flatcar is a nice counterpoint to the sign.  I generally dislike square crops, but I think this would be even better with the R side cropped away.', '2003-01-24 21:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(199634, 11070, 2716, '<td valign="top">Good eye!  Would fit the other challenge too. :)</td>', 'Good eye!  Would fit the other challenge too. :)', '2003-01-24 21:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(199635, 11232, 2716, '<td valign="top">Good capture.</td>', 'Good capture.', '2003-01-24 21:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(199637, 11193, 543, '<td valign="top">I bet this is doing well.  Great colors and clarity here.  Congratulations!</td>', 'I bet this is doing well.  Great colors and clarity here.  Congratulations!', '2003-01-24 21:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(199638, 11298, 2716, '<td valign="top">Now wonder (population 7), pretty embarassing to have that on your liscence.  Good capture.  Jacko.  7</td>', 'Now wonder (population 7), pretty embarassing to have that on your liscence.  Good capture.  Jacko.  7', '2003-01-24 21:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(199639, 11332, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice set up.  Woud like to see the sign lit more.  Did you try your fill flash?  Very nice background.  Jacko.</td>', 'Nice set up.  Woud like to see the sign lit more.  Did you try your fill flash?  Very nice background.  Jacko.', '2003-01-24 21:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(199641, 11219, 2716, '<td valign="top">Watch out, Children in Barns?  lol.  Cute set up.  Jacko.  7</td>', 'Watch out, Children in Barns?  lol.  Cute set up.  Jacko.  7', '2003-01-24 21:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(199642, 11128, 2716, '<td valign="top">I like how the signs are coloured and the background appears black and white.  Really should be more focused.</td>', 'I like how the signs are coloured and the background appears black and white.  Really should be more focused.', '2003-01-24 21:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(199643, 11132, 543, '<td valign="top">Wow.  I''m not sure how you got this effect, but it''s fantastic.  Incredible tones, and I love all that yellow.  My only nit is the upper right hand corner, where things fall apart a little.  Very fine.</td>', 'Wow.  I''m not sure how you got this effect, but it''s fantastic.  Incredible tones, and I love all that yellow.  My only nit is the upper right hand corner, where things fall apart a little.  Very fine.', '2003-01-24 21:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(199645, 11170, 2716, '<td valign="top">That is one fancy street sign.  I like the angle your used; showing the funky building.  Good luck.</td>', 'That is one fancy street sign.  I like the angle your used; showing the funky building.  Good luck.', '2003-01-24 21:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(199646, 11149, 2716, '<td valign="top">I don''t like how the trees on the left obstruct our view of the (teepees?).  I would expect some kind of sign in the shot.  I like how the road seems to go in the distance.</td>', 'I don''t like how the trees on the left obstruct our view of the (teepees?).  I would expect some kind of sign in the shot.  I like how the road seems to go in the distance.', '2003-01-24 21:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(199647, 11058, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice setup.  I like the placement of the sign, the star burst lights, and even the stop sign in the background.  I would prefer this shot without the motion blur of the pasing cars.  Jacko.</td>', 'Nice setup.  I like the placement of the sign, the star burst lights, and even the stop sign in the background.  I would prefer this shot without the motion blur of the pasing cars.  Jacko.', '2003-01-24 21:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(199648, 11300, 543, '<td valign="top">Very nice tones, and a good, desolate feeling.  Plenty of depth for that walk-into-the-picture feeling (especially tasty irony w/r/t the sign).  The top feels a little too tight to me, and the white border aggravates the problem.</td>', 'Very nice tones, and a good, desolate feeling.  Plenty of depth for that walk-into-the-picture feeling (especially tasty irony w/r/t the sign).  The top feels a little too tight to me, and the white border aggravates the problem.', '2003-01-24 21:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(199649, 11296, 2716, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, however there seems to be missing some oomph (too plain).  However, I like how the road takes half of the shot;  Contrast of smooth surface and the woods.  Good luck.  Jacko.</td>', 'Meets the challenge, however there seems to be missing some oomph (too plain).  However, I like how the road takes half of the shot;  Contrast of smooth surface and the woods.  Good luck.  Jacko.', '2003-01-24 21:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(199650, 11180, 2716, '<td valign="top">Night bright colours, however looks like it was exposed too long.  the imaged seems washed out/blurry.</td>', 'Night bright colours, however looks like it was exposed too long.  the imaged seems washed out/blurry.', '2003-01-24 21:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(199651, 11244, 543, '<td valign="top">On second viewing, this needs a higher score.  Very nice B/W with good story.  Compositionally, I''d like the see the S just a little bit higher, but that''s small potatoes.  Very fine.</td>', 'On second viewing, this needs a higher score.  Very nice B/W with good story.  Compositionally, I''d like the see the S just a little bit higher, but that''s small potatoes.  Very fine.', '2003-01-24 21:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(199652, 11197, 2716, '<td valign="top">INteresting building, however the photo looks too busy as a background.  too many angles, curves, windows. Jacko.</td>', 'INteresting building, however the photo looks too busy as a background.  too many angles, curves, windows. Jacko.', '2003-01-24 21:30:23.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(199653, 11325, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  i like how the sign is really bright (used fill flash?).  Great timing too.  Jacko. 9</td>', 'Nice capture.  i like how the sign is really bright (used fill flash?).  Great timing too.  Jacko. 9', '2003-01-24 21:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(199654, 11328, 2716, '<td valign="top">Neat shot.  Very interesting subject.  Too bad the fence is in the back, a bit distracting.  Still a neat shot.</td>', 'Neat shot.  Very interesting subject.  Too bad the fence is in the back, a bit distracting.  Still a neat shot.', '2003-01-24 21:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(199655, 11342, 543, '<td valign="top">Tasty.  This is the image that''s sticking in my mind in this competition.  Great approach to the challenge.  One nit: since you don''t have any pure white in the image, I''d avoid a white border.  All black would look better.</td>', 'Tasty.  This is the image that''s sticking in my mind in this competition.  Great approach to the challenge.  One nit: since you don''t have any pure white in the image, I''d avoid a white border.  All black would look better.', '2003-01-24 21:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(199656, 11193, 2716, '<td valign="top">Super shot I just love the colours.  Great saturation of the sign and the sky.  Where is the post?  Good luck.  My first 10.  Jacko.</td>', 'Super shot I just love the colours.  Great saturation of the sign and the sky.  Where is the post?  Good luck.  My first 10.  Jacko.', '2003-01-24 21:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(199657, 11262, 2716, '<td valign="top">INteresting subject.  You''re righ, don''t need any words to describe what happened.  Good job and good luck.</td>', 'INteresting subject.  You''re righ, don''t need any words to describe what happened.  Good job and good luck.', '2003-01-24 21:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(199658, 11071, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice interpretation.  The image seems a little blurry, but I like how the sign is wll lit (flash?).  Good luck.  Jacko.</td>', 'Nice interpretation.  The image seems a little blurry, but I like how the sign is wll lit (flash?).  Good luck.  Jacko.', '2003-01-24 21:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(199660, 11054, 2716, '<td valign="top">Should have called it: welcome to redneck country :)  Beautiful sky.  Good job.  Jacko.  8</td>', 'Should have called it: welcome to redneck country :)  Beautiful sky.  Good job.  Jacko.  8', '2003-01-24 21:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(199661, 11063, 543, '<td valign="top">Needs a little brightness adjustment, but what a catch!  Crop is a little tight for my taste at UL.</td>', 'Needs a little brightness adjustment, but what a catch!  Crop is a little tight for my taste at UL.', '2003-01-24 21:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(199662, 11061, 2716, '<td valign="top">Great set up.  I love the ultra bright colour of the grass.  Good job.  Jacko.  9</td>', 'Great set up.  I love the ultra bright colour of the grass.  Good job.  Jacko.  9', '2003-01-24 21:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(199663, 11240, 2716, '<td valign="top">I like how you filled the entire frame.  I''m not crazy about the angle, find it a bit disorienting.  Good luck.  Jacko.  7</td>', 'I like how you filled the entire frame.  I''m not crazy about the angle, find it a bit disorienting.  Good luck.  Jacko.  7', '2003-01-24 21:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(199664, 11049, 2716, '<td valign="top">spooky.  don''t think I''d venture down that road.  Looks like something out of a Stephen King book.   Good luck.</td>', 'spooky.  don''t think I''d venture down that road.  Looks like something out of a Stephen King book.   Good luck.', '2003-01-24 21:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(199665, 11318, 2716, '<td valign="top">Wonder, wonderful colour saturation.  I like the inclusion of the plane.  I find the white stickers a bit distracting.  Good luck.  Jacko.  9</td>', 'Wonder, wonderful colour saturation.  I like the inclusion of the plane.  I find the white stickers a bit distracting.  Good luck.  Jacko.  9', '2003-01-24 21:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(199666, 11345, 543, '<td valign="top">This looks like it was taken through the window of a moving bus or train.  A crop to exclude the background at L and the bit of wall (?) at R would be a good start, followed by a dose of auto levels to give it some snap.</td>', 'This looks like it was taken through the window of a moving bus or train.  A crop to exclude the background at L and the bit of wall (?) at R would be a good start, followed by a dose of auto levels to give it some snap.', '2003-01-24 21:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(199667, 11110, 2716, '<td valign="top">Very nice colour saturation.  I don''t understand the placement of the sign, seems too close to the bordres.  Might have worked better in portrait mode and centered.  Still a beautifull photo because of the colours.  8   Jacko.  .</td>', 'Very nice colour saturation.  I don''t understand the placement of the sign, seems too close to the bordres.  Might have worked better in portrait mode and centered.  Still a beautifull photo because of the colours.  8   Jacko.  .', '2003-01-24 21:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(199668, 11304, 2716, '<td valign="top">Great sharpness and colours.</td>', 'Great sharpness and colours.', '2003-01-24 21:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(199669, 11249, 2716, '<td valign="top">Wow, what timing!  Really neat set up.  Good luck.  Jacko.  8</td>', 'Wow, what timing!  Really neat set up.  Good luck.  Jacko.  8', '2003-01-24 21:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(199671, 11348, 543, '<td valign="top">There''s something to be said for keeping the composition simple and the content minimal, but I think you''d have done better to exclude more of the background here.  I like the fence and the sign, but the power lines are a major distradtion.</td>', 'There''s something to be said for keeping the composition simple and the content minimal, but I think you''d have done better to exclude more of the background here.  I like the fence and the sign, but the power lines are a major distradtion.', '2003-01-24 21:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(199672, 11138, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  too bad there was such a glare on the stop sign.  everything looks nice and crisp.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice idea.  too bad there was such a glare on the stop sign.  everything looks nice and crisp.  Good job.', '2003-01-24 21:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(199676, 11094, 543, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  Is that sign in Arabic?  I really like the curve of the road, and the way the sign and lamps lean into the frame.  The road leading toward whatever''s under that hotspot in the sky works for me, too.  Would like to see this bigger, though, and a little less grainy if possible (although the graininess is consistent with the feel of the pic).</td>', 'Interesting.  Is that sign in Arabic?  I really like the curve of the road, and the way the sign and lamps lean into the frame.  The road leading toward whatever''s under that hotspot in the sky works for me, too.  Would like to see this bigger, though, and a little less grainy if possible (although the graininess is consistent with the feel of the pic).', '2003-01-24 21:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(199678, 11346, 543, '<td valign="top">Nice color and clarity.  Possibly better with the diagonal of the hill not directly behind the sign.</td>', 'Nice color and clarity.  Possibly better with the diagonal of the hill not directly behind the sign.', '2003-01-24 21:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
