(199860, 11063, 5904, '<td valign="top">nice perspective.</td>', 'nice perspective.', '2003-01-25 12:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(199864, 11131, 5964, '<td valign="top">This is just really funny, great idea and perspective with the city behind the sign, the title helps also. The focus is good on the city, nice and crisp, but due to poor lighting/shadow on the sign it seems to be a bit grainy. The sign placement os good, grabs your attention yet allows for the view of the city, which is important on this shot. The horizon is also nicely placed on the lower third.  The colors are nice, not eye catchingly brillant, but nice for a cityscape. 7.</td>', 'This is just really funny, great idea and perspective with the city behind the sign, the title helps also. The focus is good on the city, nice and crisp, but due to poor lighting/shadow on the sign it seems to be a bit grainy. The sign placement os good, grabs your attention yet allows for the view of the city, which is important on this shot. The horizon is also nicely placed on the lower third.  The colors are nice, not eye catchingly brillant, but nice for a cityscape. 7.', '2003-01-25 12:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(199866, 11281, 4210, '<td valign="top">I love the colours and the composition.</td>', 'I love the colours and the composition.', '2003-01-25 13:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(199867, 11060, 933, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect.  Waiting to see how you achieved it.  Composition is good given the subject and effect.  You achieved a nice, eeire, vaugely ethereal feel with this photo, which I am sure was the intent.  Good job.  7  md</td>', 'Interesting effect.  Waiting to see how you achieved it.  Composition is good given the subject and effect.  You achieved a nice, eeire, vaugely ethereal feel with this photo, which I am sure was the intent.  Good job.  7  md', '2003-01-25 13:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(199869, 11193, 933, '<td valign="top">The red sign against the red of the rock and the blue of the sky create a nice effect.  The colors seem a tad oversaturated for my liking, but still very attractive.  Positioning of the sign seems a bit off - maybe higher and to the right just a bit might have helped.  Very nice how the sign post gets lost against the rock - makes it seem as if it is floating.  Nice photo, good job.  7  md</td>', 'The red sign against the red of the rock and the blue of the sky create a nice effect.  The colors seem a tad oversaturated for my liking, but still very attractive.  Positioning of the sign seems a bit off - maybe higher and to the right just a bit might have helped.  Very nice how the sign post gets lost against the rock - makes it seem as if it is floating.  Nice photo, good job.  7  md', '2003-01-25 13:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(199870, 11048, 5964, '<td valign="top">Funny, look slike my back yard (sighs). I think you cropped the sign a bit too much on the left, though I do enjoy the angle.  Black and white for this shot was a very good choice, there is not much color in this shot anyways, and it really helps the contrast with the white snow. The lighting is OK, and the white of the snow is not too bright :) 7.</td>', 'Funny, look slike my back yard (sighs). I think you cropped the sign a bit too much on the left, though I do enjoy the angle.  Black and white for this shot was a very good choice, there is not much color in this shot anyways, and it really helps the contrast with the white snow. The lighting is OK, and the white of the snow is not too bright :) 7.', '2003-01-25 13:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(199871, 11132, 4210, '<td valign="top">I really like the colours and what I think is the Clarify effect. Very nice.</td>', 'I really like the colours and what I think is the Clarify effect. Very nice.', '2003-01-25 13:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(199872, 11182, 933, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  B&amp;W works well here.  Good use of border.  The more I have looked at this, the more I like it.  May be a bit too much contrast though as the details of the lamp post get a bit lost in the darkness.  A very nice entry - good job!  8  md</td>', 'Very nice composition.  B&W works well here.  Good use of border.  The more I have looked at this, the more I like it.  May be a bit too much contrast though as the details of the lamp post get a bit lost in the darkness.  A very nice entry - good job!  8  md', '2003-01-25 13:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(199873, 11180, 4210, '<td valign="top">Hmm. Now it''s hard to say without knowing what your camera is capable of, but I would have focused on the words alone, and that would have solved the problem of the overexposed lights.</td>', 'Hmm. Now it''s hard to say without knowing what your camera is capable of, but I would have focused on the words alone, and that would have solved the problem of the overexposed lights.', '2003-01-25 13:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
