(199876, 11302, 5964, '<td valign="top">Good placement of the sign and also good focus. The lighting is good, looks to be a hazy day, I can kinda make out some hills or something to the left. Not a super interesting shot, but well taken.7.</td>', 'Good placement of the sign and also good focus. The lighting is good, looks to be a hazy day, I can kinda make out some hills or something to the left. Not a super interesting shot, but well taken.7.', '2003-01-25 13:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
