(199933, 11167, 1280, '<td valign="top">Whew!  Quite true...thanks for the reminder....hehehehe.</td>', 'Whew!  Quite true...thanks for the reminder....hehehehe.', '2003-01-25 18:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(199936, 11325, 1280, '<td valign="top">Great timing!  Good capture.</td>', 'Great timing!  Good capture.', '2003-01-25 18:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(199937, 11145, 2079, '<td valign="top">This is so well done. The problem I think you might run into here is the sign is not the main focus of the shot. I know its not required that it be the main focus, but many of the voters tend to have a very narrow vision of meeting a challenge. This is a road sign photographed in all its natural glory. I like the artistic elements present in this shot. However when I look at this, I think of cool bright colors, green moss, broken windows, weeds, abandoned buildings One of the last things to enter my mind is road sign I often get annoyed with this aspect of the voters on DPChallenge. It seems a failure at times for many of them to see the art within the picture. Its not easy to make a work of art out of a road sign.  - This is a great shot, one of only two 10s from me this week.  Good Luck with the rest of the voters.</td>', 'This is so well done. The problem I think you might run into here is the sign is not the main focus of the shot. I know its not required that it be the main focus, but many of the voters tend to have a very narrow vision of meeting a challenge. This is a road sign photographed in all its natural glory. I like the artistic elements present in this shot. However when I look at this, I think of cool bright colors, green moss, broken windows, weeds, abandoned buildings One of the last things to enter my mind is road sign I often get annoyed with this aspect of the voters on DPChallenge. It seems a failure at times for many of them to see the art within the picture. Its not easy to make a work of art out of a road sign.  - This is a great shot, one of only two 10s from me this week.  Good Luck with the rest of the voters.', '2003-01-25 18:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(199948, 11278, 1280, '<td valign="top">Different....very nice!</td>', 'Different....very nice!', '2003-01-25 19:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
