(200392, 11243, 4648, '<td valign="top">From the thumbnail it was fantastic.  The black tire looked like it was out in infinity with the road appearing to be the edge of the earth.  And the sign like she had mowed right thru it.  In the big photo it look like a white speckled tire sitting on a small play stop sign.  I lost of of the illusion it had in the small shot.  The thumbnail was a 10.  This one is harder to score.  The white spots on the black tire are very disturbing and the shadow of the tire cutting off part of the "stop sign" looks too fake.  The focus is ok, the framing is nice, and the lighting is rather good.  But I just can seem to score it fairly for what it is.  This may all just be my personal problem, so I will give it a 5 in fairness to you.  I hope you tell us exactly how you did this shot.</td>', 'From the thumbnail it was fantastic.  The black tire looked like it was out in infinity with the road appearing to be the edge of the earth.  And the sign like she had mowed right thru it.  In the big photo it look like a white speckled tire sitting on a small play stop sign.  I lost of of the illusion it had in the small shot.  The thumbnail was a 10.  This one is harder to score.  The white spots on the black tire are very disturbing and the shadow of the tire cutting off part of the "stop sign" looks too fake.  The focus is ok, the framing is nice, and the lighting is rather good.  But I just can seem to score it fairly for what it is.  This may all just be my personal problem, so I will give it a 5 in fairness to you.  I hope you tell us exactly how you did this shot.', '2003-01-26 20:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(200394, 11346, 5250, '<td valign="top">Clear and sharp! I think the sign could be a bit more to the right! Nice colours. jgillard8</td>', 'Clear and sharp! I think the sign could be a bit more to the right! Nice colours. jgillard8', '2003-01-26 20:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(200395, 11182, 5250, '<td valign="top">Great angle. I think that your border distracts a bit from the scene. jgillard7</td>', 'Great angle. I think that your border distracts a bit from the scene. jgillard7', '2003-01-26 20:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(200396, 11244, 5250, '<td valign="top">I think that this would be much more effective in colour. You obviously did not think so, and who am I to judge your style! ;) jgillard6</td>', 'I think that this would be much more effective in colour. You obviously did not think so, and who am I to judge your style! ;) jgillard6', '2003-01-26 20:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(200397, 11291, 5250, '<td valign="top">I think if the one way sign was pointing downwards it would be much funnier! ;) jgillard6</td>', 'I think if the one way sign was pointing downwards it would be much funnier! ;) jgillard6', '2003-01-26 20:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(200398, 11309, 5250, '<td valign="top">That looks sorta like a bridge I know! I like the colour of the sky, but the lower right corner of the image is a bit dark, and draws the viewers eyes there unneccesarily. jgillard6</td>', 'That looks sorta like a bridge I know! I like the colour of the sky, but the lower right corner of the image is a bit dark, and draws the viewers eyes there unneccesarily. jgillard6', '2003-01-26 20:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(200399, 11291, 4648, '<td valign="top">This one gets it for humor.  They just said "road sign" and sure didn''t say where they had to be did they.  Looks like it''s beginning to peel away from your thumb on the back end of it.  Just a little dark, but not enough to really hurt the photo that much.  Shadows are a bit distracting, under the thumb and on the side of the first finger  Nice B &amp; W.  Nice composition with decent execution.  Congrats on a 7.</td>', 'This one gets it for humor.  They just said "road sign" and sure didn''t say where they had to be did they.  Looks like it''s beginning to peel away from your thumb on the back end of it.  Just a little dark, but not enough to really hurt the photo that much.  Shadows are a bit distracting, under the thumb and on the side of the first finger  Nice B & W.  Nice composition with decent execution.  Congrats on a 7.', '2003-01-26 20:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(200401, 11181, 5250, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective. I do not like the colouring of the roof of the fake house though. Still. Effective. jgillard7</td>', 'Simple and effective. I do not like the colouring of the roof of the fake house though. Still. Effective. jgillard7', '2003-01-26 20:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(200402, 11059, 5250, '<td valign="top">Are you sure that you did not hang that there? ;) I think that if you cropped the image so that the open space in the lower left corner was not there, the picture would be more uniform and stronger to the viewers eyes. jgillard6</td>', 'Are you sure that you did not hang that there? ;) I think that if you cropped the image so that the open space in the lower left corner was not there, the picture would be more uniform and stronger to the viewers eyes. jgillard6', '2003-01-26 20:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(200403, 11114, 5250, '<td valign="top">The sky does not look right. It is a little too blue. I like the sign though. jgillard6</td>', 'The sky does not look right. It is a little too blue. I like the sign though. jgillard6', '2003-01-26 20:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(200404, 11201, 5250, '<td valign="top">I think that you should use a better program for resizing your images. If you look closely at the letters you have zaggies. I hope that these are not jpeg artifacts. What I mean is that if the sign was a bit sharper, it would be more effective. I like the angle you shot it at though. jgillard6</td>', 'I think that you should use a better program for resizing your images. If you look closely at the letters you have zaggies. I hope that these are not jpeg artifacts. What I mean is that if the sign was a bit sharper, it would be more effective. I like the angle you shot it at though. jgillard6', '2003-01-26 20:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(200406, 11193, 5250, '<td valign="top">I like your background, but I do not get the point of this sign being here? Im trying to determine what you want to tell me and I am not getting it. For your crisp colours and sharp focus I am giving you a 7 still though. jgillard7</td>', 'I like your background, but I do not get the point of this sign being here? Im trying to determine what you want to tell me and I am not getting it. For your crisp colours and sharp focus I am giving you a 7 still though. jgillard7', '2003-01-26 20:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(200407, 11276, 4648, '<td valign="top">Gotta know?  Wat this photo and title after the fact of getting home and finding it was the best shot, so it was titled as a coverup of an error or was this intentional.  Cause I''m blinded by it also, yet I like it, for some reason.  Just hope the drivers weren''t as blinded by the "sun" light and could see the "stop"light.  Nice one worth a 7 to me.</td>', 'Gotta know?  Wat this photo and title after the fact of getting home and finding it was the best shot, so it was titled as a coverup of an error or was this intentional.  Cause I''m blinded by it also, yet I like it, for some reason.  Just hope the drivers weren''t as blinded by the "sun" light and could see the "stop"light.  Nice one worth a 7 to me.', '2003-01-26 20:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(200409, 11245, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is how a drunk driver sees the signs all the time.  This is too cute.  Don''t particularly like the red tone to it, but that''s personal.  As it goes as a photo otherwise it''s technically a good one:  cropping, subject, meeting challenge, focus, etc.  Deserves every bit of an 8 techinically, just not personally.  So you get the score.</td>', 'This is how a drunk driver sees the signs all the time.  This is too cute.  Don''t particularly like the red tone to it, but that''s personal.  As it goes as a photo otherwise it''s technically a good one:  cropping, subject, meeting challenge, focus, etc.  Deserves every bit of an 8 techinically, just not personally.  So you get the score.', '2003-01-26 20:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(200410, 11185, 4648, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  No arguments or nit picking here.  Like the title.  Photo says it without the title.  I think the border works well here.</td>', 'Good shot.  No arguments or nit picking here.  Like the title.  Photo says it without the title.  I think the border works well here.', '2003-01-26 21:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(200412, 11228, 5250, '<td valign="top">This image is a little dark. The problem with this image is that you oversharpened it wayyyy too much. The shot no longer looks natural. I recommend that you do a search for a tutorial on how to use an unsharp mask correctly! I like your composition though. jgillard4</td>', 'This image is a little dark. The problem with this image is that you oversharpened it wayyyy too much. The shot no longer looks natural. I recommend that you do a search for a tutorial on how to use an unsharp mask correctly! I like your composition though. jgillard4', '2003-01-26 21:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(200413, 11172, 5250, '<td valign="top">I like it! ;) One sign is not enough to get the point across so they have to use two. jgillard7</td>', 'I like it! ;) One sign is not enough to get the point across so they have to use two. jgillard7', '2003-01-26 21:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(200414, 11279, 5250, '<td valign="top">Sad. Love the shadows. Nice and sharp. Great colours. jgillard8</td>', 'Sad. Love the shadows. Nice and sharp. Great colours. jgillard8', '2003-01-26 21:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
