(200418, 11206, 5250, '<td valign="top">Nah.. Speed up for wildfowl ;) This picture will do well I think for three reasons. One, the colours are very nice. Two, it has a good composition. Three, it is very crisp. Oh, and four, people like little ducklings ;) jgillard9</td>', 'Nah.. Speed up for wildfowl ;) This picture will do well I think for three reasons. One, the colours are very nice. Two, it has a good composition. Three, it is very crisp. Oh, and four, people like little ducklings ;) jgillard9', '2003-01-26 21:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
