(200534, 11346, 6328, '<td valign="top">sign shows up nicely against the blue sky, but it makes my eye travel to the sky and way from the sky all the time.  Would it have been possilbe to get higher and show some of the roadway and perhaps less sky?? The yellow pole show up nicely as does the dent in the sign and the black roughage on the sign.</td>', 'sign shows up nicely against the blue sky, but it makes my eye travel to the sky and way from the sky all the time.  Would it have been possilbe to get higher and show some of the roadway and perhaps less sky?? The yellow pole show up nicely as does the dent in the sign and the black roughage on the sign.', '2003-01-26 23:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(200535, 11092, 1280, '<td valign="top">I guess some people just need a reminder eh?  LOL  Nicely composed, and exposed.</td>', 'I guess some people just need a reminder eh?  LOL  Nicely composed, and exposed.', '2003-01-26 23:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(200537, 11125, 6328, '<td valign="top">nice colours here, very vigbrant and alive, but wonder if you should have shown more of the sign, it appears that you''ve cut out some of the top of the name??  Sure comes alive at you though!  Nice job.</td>', 'nice colours here, very vigbrant and alive, but wonder if you should have shown more of the sign, it appears that you''ve cut out some of the top of the name??  Sure comes alive at you though!  Nice job.', '2003-01-26 23:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(200538, 11221, 6328, '<td valign="top">nice live color here, and you really caught the shadow of the nail as well as the rusty nail itself.  What''s that yellow streak running down themiddle of the sign?  some kind of stain, or shadow?</td>', 'nice live color here, and you really caught the shadow of the nail as well as the rusty nail itself.  What''s that yellow streak running down themiddle of the sign?  some kind of stain, or shadow?', '2003-01-26 23:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(200542, 11197, 6328, '<td valign="top">Well, you''ve got a beautiful shot of the building, and that''s what I''m more interested in looking at, compared to the sign at the bottom.</td>', 'Well, you''ve got a beautiful shot of the building, and that''s what I''m more interested in looking at, compared to the sign at the bottom.', '2003-01-26 23:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(200544, 11061, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good job with exposure, and composition, and meeting the challenge.  Good colors too.  The landscape looks very beautiful.</td>', 'Good job with exposure, and composition, and meeting the challenge.  Good colors too.  The landscape looks very beautiful.', '2003-01-26 23:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(200546, 11283, 4813, '<td valign="top">great, great, great photo.  I really like the black and white</td>', 'great, great, great photo.  I really like the black and white', '2003-01-26 23:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(200548, 11182, 4813, '<td valign="top">great photo.  I like the angle and I like the choice on black and white</td>', 'great photo.  I like the angle and I like the choice on black and white', '2003-01-26 23:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(200549, 11300, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good job of meeting the challenge with an interesting image.</td>', 'Good job of meeting the challenge with an interesting image.', '2003-01-26 23:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(200551, 11308, 6328, '<td valign="top">it just doesn''t say much to me.  Perhaps you''d be so kind as to email me as tell me what you saw and help me out.</td>', 'it just doesn''t say much to me.  Perhaps you''d be so kind as to email me as tell me what you saw and help me out.', '2003-01-26 23:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(200552, 11231, 1280, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge and is quite unique.  Good job.</td>', 'Meets the challenge and is quite unique.  Good job.', '2003-01-26 23:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(200553, 11060, 1280, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Good concept shot and well executed.   Very good job!</td>', 'Wow!  Good concept shot and well executed.   Very good job!', '2003-01-26 23:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(200554, 11051, 4813, '<td valign="top">the sign does not seem to be the main focus of the picture.  I keep focusing on the fountain</td>', 'the sign does not seem to be the main focus of the picture.  I keep focusing on the fountain', '2003-01-26 23:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(200555, 11302, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good composition and colors.</td>', 'Good composition and colors.', '2003-01-26 23:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(200556, 11343, 3419, '<td valign="top">Oh! That''s mean!  :-) LOL - what a sense of humour!</td>', 'Oh! That''s mean!  :-) LOL - what a sense of humour!', '2003-01-26 23:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(200557, 11058, 3419, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, and good capture of lighting and detail.</td>', 'Nice composition, and good capture of lighting and detail.', '2003-01-26 23:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(200559, 11070, 1280, '<td valign="top">The car in the bg is good for showing scale here.  Good eye!</td>', 'The car in the bg is good for showing scale here.  Good eye!', '2003-01-26 23:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(200561, 11340, 4813, '<td valign="top">nice black and white photo</td>', 'nice black and white photo', '2003-01-26 23:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(200562, 11286, 4813, '<td valign="top">great photo</td>', 'great photo', '2003-01-26 23:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(200563, 11228, 4813, '<td valign="top">a little to much for me in this picture.  I like the shopping cart though</td>', 'a little to much for me in this picture.  I like the shopping cart though', '2003-01-26 23:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(200564, 11300, 6328, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve captured a great Black &amp; White Photograph.  It''s so stark, so captivating!  The lighting on that building across the street is great, and the moonlight breaking through the dark clouds. . .  You''ve even been able to capture the "pedestrian" crosswalk" sign on the other side of the street.  The small puddle at the bottom of the sign,  - - it''s a great photo.</td>', 'I think you''ve captured a great Black & White Photograph.  It''s so stark, so captivating!  The lighting on that building across the street is great, and the moonlight breaking through the dark clouds. . .  You''ve even been able to capture the "pedestrian" crosswalk" sign on the other side of the street.  The small puddle at the bottom of the sign,  - - it''s a great photo.', '2003-01-26 23:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(200565, 11159, 4813, '<td valign="top">the photo does not  do much for me, however you can never go wrong with an eat me sign<br/></td>', 'the photo does not  do much for me, however you can never go wrong with an eat me sign', '2003-01-26 23:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(200566, 11068, 3419, '<td valign="top">This photo loaded, and then I left my desk to check on something, and when I came back, I saw this photo from a distance. It looks better from a distance in that the words are readable then. Up close, it''s all blurry due to the texture and reflection of light off the pavement. Perhaps a different angle, or a more wide-angle view would help.</td>', 'This photo loaded, and then I left my desk to check on something, and when I came back, I saw this photo from a distance. It looks better from a distance in that the words are readable then. Up close, it''s all blurry due to the texture and reflection of light off the pavement. Perhaps a different angle, or a more wide-angle view would help.', '2003-01-26 23:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(200567, 11132, 3419, '<td valign="top">Good composition, and the strong yellow cast makes this photo look very vintage. I like it.</td>', 'Good composition, and the strong yellow cast makes this photo look very vintage. I like it.', '2003-01-26 23:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(200568, 11292, 6328, '<td valign="top">Don''t see many covered bridges anymore.  This one is lovely.  The color os so great and stands out lovely against the blue sky.  The way you''ve been able to include the older buildings on the other side and the fencing was also nice, and also the lighting just inside the bridge where it shows the logging [walls].  Great job.</td>', 'Don''t see many covered bridges anymore.  This one is lovely.  The color os so great and stands out lovely against the blue sky.  The way you''ve been able to include the older buildings on the other side and the fencing was also nice, and also the lighting just inside the bridge where it shows the logging [walls].  Great job.', '2003-01-26 23:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(200569, 11176, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like it. Different from most.</td>', 'I like it. Different from most.', '2003-01-26 23:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
