(200595, 11271, 3419, '<td valign="top">Like I told the other one - don''t go there! :-)  I like the composition, but the snow is a little overexposed.</td>', 'Like I told the other one - don''t go there! :-)  I like the composition, but the snow is a little overexposed.', '2003-01-26 23:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(200597, 11131, 1280, '<td valign="top">LOL  funny!  Good eye...good shot.</td>', 'LOL  funny!  Good eye...good shot.', '2003-01-26 23:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(200599, 11110, 1280, '<td valign="top">Wonderful contrasting colors...good clear focus.  Nice!</td>', 'Wonderful contrasting colors...good clear focus.  Nice!', '2003-01-26 23:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(200600, 11219, 1280, '<td valign="top">Terrific set up!  Good job!</td>', 'Terrific set up!  Good job!', '2003-01-26 23:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(200602, 11087, 3419, '<td valign="top">LOL - that''s a funny sign! Good composition</td>', 'LOL - that''s a funny sign! Good composition', '2003-01-26 23:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(200603, 11138, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very interesting interpretation of the challenge.  Good job!  Different.</td>', 'Very interesting interpretation of the challenge.  Good job!  Different.', '2003-01-26 23:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(200604, 11230, 3419, '<td valign="top">Gosh - it sure looks cold there! Good composition and capture of the mood!</td>', 'Gosh - it sure looks cold there! Good composition and capture of the mood!', '2003-01-26 23:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(200605, 11137, 1280, '<td valign="top">Quite exhuberant!</td>', 'Quite exhuberant!', '2003-01-26 23:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(200606, 11304, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice, simple composition, and good colors.</td>', 'Nice, simple composition, and good colors.', '2003-01-26 23:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(200607, 11197, 3419, '<td valign="top">That''s a really beautiful building. Interesting composition -most photographers have tried to fill the frame with a road sign whereas you have chosen to minimize it. I like it.</td>', 'That''s a really beautiful building. Interesting composition -most photographers have tried to fill the frame with a road sign whereas you have chosen to minimize it. I like it.', '2003-01-26 23:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(200608, 11120, 3419, '<td valign="top">And the connection with road signs is......?????? Composition is good, but focus needs some work.</td>', 'And the connection with road signs is......?????? Composition is good, but focus needs some work.', '2003-01-26 23:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(200609, 11270, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice.  A little  more detail in the snow would enhance this...not easy to do though.</td>', 'Nice.  A little  more detail in the snow would enhance this...not easy to do though.', '2003-01-26 23:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(200610, 11291, 1280, '<td valign="top">Cute and imaginative.</td>', 'Cute and imaginative.', '2003-01-26 23:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(200611, 11148, 3419, '<td valign="top">I can hear the noise on this busy street. Good capture of the mood.</td>', 'I can hear the noise on this busy street. Good capture of the mood.', '2003-01-26 23:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(200612, 11325, 4210, '<td valign="top">I think that this would have been a fabulous photo without the plane. I know it "makes" the title, but the beautiful sky, and the whiteness of the sign.... wow.</td>', 'I think that this would have been a fabulous photo without the plane. I know it "makes" the title, but the beautiful sky, and the whiteness of the sign.... wow.', '2003-01-26 23:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(200613, 11049, 6370, '<td valign="top">love the dark and misty look...</td>', 'love the dark and misty look...', '2003-01-26 23:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(200614, 11266, 6370, '<td valign="top">I actually like the curve more the sign.  the foliage along the edge of th road, the road, and the line on the road.</td>', 'I actually like the curve more the sign.  the foliage along the edge of th road, the road, and the line on the road.', '2003-01-27 00:00:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(200616, 11182, 92, '<td valign="top">woooo hoooo congrats on a deserved win !!!! I''ll be looking for my print in the mail ! hahaha <br/> <br/>Really a great photo ! You nailed it perfectly !</td>', 'woooo hoooo congrats on a deserved win !!!! I''ll be looking for my print in the mail ! hahaha  Really a great photo ! You nailed it perfectly !', '2003-01-27 00:01:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(200617, 11182, 1880, '<td valign="top">Great job Kollin!!! Congrats on a fantastic pic ...<br/> <br/>Bob<br/></td>', 'Great job Kollin!!! Congrats on a fantastic pic ... Bob', '2003-01-27 00:02:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(200620, 11182, 5793, '<td valign="top">Congrats Mag!!!  This is some great work!</td>', 'Congrats Mag!!!  This is some great work!', '2003-01-27 00:05:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(200622, 11054, 2, '<td valign="top">Hey!  I''m Drew!!  I''m flattered at the very least.  Beautiful colors.  I love how you bring out the texture in the stop sign, and how well that contrasts the reflections that made my shot.  Great job, and congrats on 3rd. :)</td>', 'Hey!  I''m Drew!!  I''m flattered at the very least.  Beautiful colors.  I love how you bring out the texture in the stop sign, and how well that contrasts the reflections that made my shot.  Great job, and congrats on 3rd. :)', '2003-01-27 00:07:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(200624, 11110, 5793, '<td valign="top">Nice finish!  :P  Not too shabby at all.  I concede to you or great one.<br/> <br/>Jason</td>', 'Nice finish!  :P  Not too shabby at all.  I concede to you or great one. Jason', '2003-01-27 00:07:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(200625, 11182, 2011, '<td valign="top">Way to go Kollin.   This is a great shot and a 10 any way you look at it!  Its about damn time.  Yep I grinning!</td>', 'Way to go Kollin.   This is a great shot and a 10 any way you look at it!  Its about damn time.  Yep I grinning!', '2003-01-27 00:07:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(200626, 11182, 656, '<td valign="top">woohooo!  Well deserved, congrats!</td>', 'woohooo!  Well deserved, congrats!', '2003-01-27 00:07:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(200627, 11182, 4162, '<td valign="top">Congrats on 1st place! Absolutely deserved!</td>', 'Congrats on 1st place! Absolutely deserved!', '2003-01-27 00:08:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(200628, 11060, 656, '<td valign="top">Overexposed in Manual mode to give the white light impression and then zoomed the lens through a long shutter speed to get this effect.  Used a polariser to darken it up enough to allow the long exposure.</td>', 'Overexposed in Manual mode to give the white light impression and then zoomed the lens through a long shutter speed to get this effect.  Used a polariser to darken it up enough to allow the long exposure.', '2003-01-27 00:09:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(200631, 11182, 1037, '<td valign="top">Congrats mag :)</td>', 'Congrats mag :)', '2003-01-27 00:11:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(200632, 11182, 327, '<td valign="top">WTG Mag!! Wonderful shot. Impact and pefect focus.</td>', 'WTG Mag!! Wonderful shot. Impact and pefect focus.', '2003-01-27 00:11:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(200633, 11313, 5120, '<td valign="top">I guess no one understood my picture this week.  I was trying to show the sign crapping up the nice pretty pecan grove.  I got comments about the branches in front of the sign.  When I was taking the photograph I started to move them out of the way but then I liked the idea even though man has put this ugly sign smack in the middle of nature, nature is growing over it.  Oh well, there is always next week :)</td>', 'I guess no one understood my picture this week.  I was trying to show the sign crapping up the nice pretty pecan grove.  I got comments about the branches in front of the sign.  When I was taking the photograph I started to move them out of the way but then I liked the idea even though man has put this ugly sign smack in the middle of nature, nature is growing over it.  Oh well, there is always next week :)', '2003-01-27 00:11:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(200634, 11049, 327, '<td valign="top">congrats to you on your win!!</td>', 'congrats to you on your win!!', '2003-01-27 00:12:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(200636, 11054, 327, '<td valign="top">The light is magic! Congrats!!!</td>', 'The light is magic! Congrats!!!', '2003-01-27 00:13:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(200646, 11182, 5508, '<td valign="top">Congrates. Excellent shot well deserved.</td>', 'Congrates. Excellent shot well deserved.', '2003-01-27 00:17:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(200647, 11267, 5268, '<td valign="top">I''m sure the cables killed me here, but they were unavoidable for the image I was trying to display. Thanks for the votes and the comments. Keep up the flame!  Cub</td>', 'I''m sure the cables killed me here, but they were unavoidable for the image I was trying to display. Thanks for the votes and the comments. Keep up the flame!  Cub', '2003-01-27 00:17:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(200651, 11182, 5268, '<td valign="top">Yes!! Finally! My number one vote won first place! Way to go. It''s a great photo!!  Cub</td>', 'Yes!! Finally! My number one vote won first place! Way to go. It''s a great photo!!  Cub', '2003-01-27 00:19:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(200652, 11325, 5508, '<td valign="top">Great job. This photo did well but I thought it would place higher.</td>', 'Great job. This photo did well but I thought it would place higher.', '2003-01-27 00:19:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(200654, 11165, 1863, '<td valign="top">Dude! I gave you an 8! I thought you had another picture... lol</td>', 'Dude! I gave you an 8! I thought you had another picture... lol', '2003-01-27 00:20:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(200661, 11182, 5212, '<td valign="top">Congrats, a well-deserved win.  One of my fav''s this week!</td>', 'Congrats, a well-deserved win.  One of my fav''s this week!', '2003-01-27 00:23:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(200671, 11182, 734, '<td valign="top">YES!!!!! Way to go Mag... so perfect, The contrast and focus is just perfect,.. Is about damn time!!!</td>', 'YES!!!!! Way to go Mag... so perfect, The contrast and focus is just perfect,.. Is about damn time!!!', '2003-01-27 00:29:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(200674, 11049, 5212, '<td valign="top">Congrats, one of my favorites.  Seldom have I seen the use of mood so well done in the challenges.  Despite the lighten up the foreground comments, I really liked it just how it was.</td>', 'Congrats, one of my favorites.  Seldom have I seen the use of mood so well done in the challenges.  Despite the lighten up the foreground comments, I really liked it just how it was.', '2003-01-27 00:30:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(200680, 11159, 3607, '<td valign="top">thank you all for your comments.  the reason why i submitted this photo was because i thought it was a lot of fun.  its a very dynamic photo, with a lot of activity.  no one commented on what i thought was the key feature of the picture, which was the adjustment someone did to the children crossing sign of them carrying a bag of money.  to me that made the photo, was part of the title, and the key to the whole crowded, crazy construction of the photo.  whatever, i''m pretty happy with the outcome, voting wise, and appreciate everyone''s comments and support.  cheers, tom</td>', 'thank you all for your comments.  the reason why i submitted this photo was because i thought it was a lot of fun.  its a very dynamic photo, with a lot of activity.  no one commented on what i thought was the key feature of the picture, which was the adjustment someone did to the children crossing sign of them carrying a bag of money.  to me that made the photo, was part of the title, and the key to the whole crowded, crazy construction of the photo.  whatever, i''m pretty happy with the outcome, voting wise, and appreciate everyone''s comments and support.  cheers, tom', '2003-01-27 00:33:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(200685, 11182, 5728, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on 1st. Terrific photo!</td>', 'Congratulations on 1st. Terrific photo!', '2003-01-27 00:34:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(200689, 11049, 5728, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on second place!</td>', 'Congratulations on second place!', '2003-01-27 00:35:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(200693, 11182, 3607, '<td valign="top">congrats.  i''m from dc but live in nyc now (obviously, just check out my photos).  i know this street well.  your photo is so simple but effective - which is always what the best photos turn out to be.  i can''t tell you that i thought at you would win, but actually i''m so happy that you did win because i think photos like this sometimes get passed up in the voting versus flashier/try-too-hard efforts.  cheers, tomzinho</td>', 'congrats.  i''m from dc but live in nyc now (obviously, just check out my photos).  i know this street well.  your photo is so simple but effective - which is always what the best photos turn out to be.  i can''t tell you that i thought at you would win, but actually i''m so happy that you did win because i think photos like this sometimes get passed up in the voting versus flashier/try-too-hard efforts.  cheers, tomzinho', '2003-01-27 00:37:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(200704, 11185, 933, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments.  Woo hoo, my first top ten finish!  Regarding some of the comments:  I also wanted the entire stop sign in the photo, but unfortunately, there was a street sing on top of the stop sign which really distracted from the shot.  I felt it was better to crop off the top than to leave on the sign.  A copy of the original shot can be seen here... <br/> <br/><a href="//www.pbase.com/image/11588877" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.pbase.com/image/11588877</a> <br/> <br/>If I could have selectively desaturated, I would have removed red everywhere except for the sign.  Lastly, this was taken at a paper mill.  I don''t know for sure if the stuff coming out is steam or not, but I highly doubt it as it stinks of sulfur and can be smelled for miles.  regardless, that''s not the point.  This is not about this one particular paper mill, or paper mills in general.  This is meant to be more of a symbolic reflection upon the waste and pollution which is deposited into our ecosphere with rapidly accelerating abandon.  It''s merely my own personal statement reflecting my opinions about man''s propensity to destroy his own environment.  <br/> <br/>Thanks again to all who commented.  The time you took to share your thoughts was greatly appreciated!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-01-27 00:43:28.</i></td>', 'Thanks for all the comments.  Woo hoo, my first top ten finish!  Regarding some of the comments:  I also wanted the entire stop sign in the photo, but unfortunately, there was a street sing on top of the stop sign which really distracted from the shot.  I felt it was better to crop off the top than to leave on the sign.  A copy of the original shot can be seen here...  //www.pbase.com/image/11588877  If I could have selectively desaturated, I would have removed red everywhere except for the sign.  Lastly, this was taken at a paper mill.  I don''t know for sure if the stuff coming out is steam or not, but I highly doubt it as it stinks of sulfur and can be smelled for miles.  regardless, that''s not the point.  This is not about this one particular paper mill, or paper mills in general.  This is meant to be more of a symbolic reflection upon the waste and pollution which is deposited into our ecosphere with rapidly accelerating abandon.  It''s merely my own personal statement reflecting my opinions about man''s propensity to destroy his own environment.   Thanks again to all who commented.  The time you took to share your thoughts was greatly appreciated!', '2003-01-27 00:41:11.000000', '2003-01-27 00:43:28.000000', 0),
